#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr ""
"„To tylko draśnięcie?”. Zabandażuj i zdezynfekuj tak czy siak, by "
"przyspieszyć leczenie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr "Drzwi to nie jedyne wejście lub wyjście z większości miejsc."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat "
"regularly."
msgstr ""
"Pełen żołądek nie rozwiąże twojego stanu wygłodzenia. Daj sobie czas i jedz "
"regularnie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A pillow or stuffed animal will make it easier to fall asleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr "Ocalony towarzysz to przyjaciel w biedzie. W większości przypadków…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Adhesive bandages are much quicker to use, but not as effective - perfect "
"for minor wounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Boisz się dzikich zwierząt? Krzycz, aż uciekną, lecz uważaj, co możesz "
"przyciągnąć."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be "
"exploited."
msgstr ""
"Opancerzony wróg? Nie poddawaj się, może ma jakieś słabe punkty, które można "
"wykorzystać."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr "Zwierzęta i zombie nie są przyjaciółmi. Wykorzystaj to."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can save you from death."
msgstr ""
"Krwawienie tętnicze po postrzale? Opaska uciskowa może uratować cię przed "
"śmiercią."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Aspirin and ibuprofen don't stack with each other, but most other pain "
"medication does."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Athletics skill helps with swimming, climbing, and max stamina.  Don't "
"neglect it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully "
"customizable too."
msgstr ""
"Automatyczne podnoszenie zaoszczędzi twój cenny czas. Dostosuj je do "
"własnych potrzeb."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Balance armor versus encumbrance, and try not to wear bags in combat"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Bare ground is hard to sleep on and will make you much colder.  Try "
"gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial "
"in the long run."
msgstr ""
"Uważaj co, kiedy i ile jesz. Zrównoważona dieta ma kluczowe znaczenie w "
"dłuższej perspektywie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a "
"master in specific areas."
msgstr ""
"Umiejętności to jeszcze nie biegłości. Zdobądź biegłość, by być mistrzem w "
"określonych dziedzinach."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Being wet makes the cold far worse.  Find some rainproof gear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Binoculars make it easier to scout the terrain, gun scopes work too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Blinded creatures can still detect you in melee, and will remember where "
"they last saw you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to "
"utilize them.  Practice."
msgstr ""
"Książki niosą wiedzę i często przepisy wymagające praktycznych umiejętności. "
"Ćwicz."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Broken limb?  Improvised splints are ok, but hospitals might have better "
"tech for it."
msgstr ""
"Złamana kończyna? Improwizowane szyny są ok, ale szpitale mogą mieć lepszą "
"technologię."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Cameras can blind enemies with their flash in melee.  Say cheese and die!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have "
"components right now."
msgstr ""
"Od czasu do czasu sprawdź, co możesz wytworzyć, nawet jeśli teraz nie masz "
"komponentów."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr "Piwnica lub ziemianka schłodzą jedzenie, by przetrwało dłużej."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Construction can be a good way to gain your first rank of mechanics and "
"electronics."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop "
"bench."
msgstr ""
"Rzemiosło jest szybsze, jeśli masz do tego odpowiednie miejsce, najlepiej "
"stół warsztatowy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crouching is quieter than walking and will let you hide behind some "
"furniture."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Crouching or going prone make you harder to hit in ranged combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr ""
"Zabrałeś wszystko co nie było przybite do ścian? To wróć się jeszcze po "
"gwoździe."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your "
"game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr ""
"Różne postacie, zawody, hobby i scenariusze mogą urozmaicić twoją grę. Wczuj "
"się w rolę!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different enemies require different weapons.  Diversify your loadout, and "
"always have a backup"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the "
"opponents."
msgstr ""
"Sekcja zwłok pomoże ci w zdobyciu wiedzy o słabych punktach przeciwników."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr "Nie bądź zbyt chciwy. Łup nie ma znaczenia, gdy nie żyjesz."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr ""
"Nie walcz za wszelką cenę. Ucieczka nie hańbi, gdy chodzi o przetrwanie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't get surrounded!  Always have an exit plan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't smoke in bed!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't wait until it's too late!  Run away and live to fight another day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but be aware of addiction "
"and overdose."
msgstr ""
"Narkotyki szybko polepszą morale i nie tylko, ale pamiętaj o uzależnieniu i "
"przedawkowaniu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr "Śmierć to część doświadczenia. Spróbuj ponownie i ucz się na błędach."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Jedz zdrowo albo zaszkodzisz zdrowiu. Fast foody są dobre tylko w razie "
"konieczności."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Enemies can see you peeking, but they won't get a chance to shoot you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."
msgstr "Każdy mistrz był kiedyś uczniem. NPC mogą cię uczyć i vice versa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Excessive item counts in proximity to your character can cause slowdown.  "
"Don't be a hoarder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Exercising daily increases your cardio fitness and therefore your stamina "
"pool."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal pipe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling bad after waking up?  Exercise and clean living are key to a healthy "
"lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  "
"Heal now, explore later."
msgstr ""
"Źle się czujesz? Odpocznij, nawet kilka dni, gdy trzeba. Wylecz się "
"najpierw, świat zaczeka."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to "
"your advantage."
msgstr ""
"Walcz na swoich warunkach, kiedy możesz. Wykorzystaj teren, pułapki i ogień "
"na swoją korzyść."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight smarter, not harder.  Even simple traps can turn the tide in your "
"favor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with an abundance of fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr "Jedzenie sprzed Kataklizmu nie jest wieczne. Miej to na uwadze."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a "
"practice target."
msgstr ""
"Za darmo w menu budowy: miejsce do pracy, źródło drewna na opał i cel "
"treningowy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Foraging isn't easy.  It takes survival skill, perception, and a lot of luck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."
msgstr ""
"Zamarznięta żywność nie psuje się, ale może być niejadalna jeśli nie "
"zostanie rozmrożona."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up by activating a pan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Going prone can make it harder for shrapnel to hit you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grabbed enemies can't dodge. If something won't sit still, try making it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grenades create very fine shrapnel which isn't great against armor.  "
"Pipebombs on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Handguns are powerful and easy to use even when you're badly wounded.  "
"Always keep one handy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Holsters, quivers, sheaths, and ammo pouches can be much faster than using a "
"backpack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities "
"can save the day."
msgstr ""
"Licz na lepsze, gotuj się na najgorsze. Rezerwowe zapasy ważnych rzeczy mogą "
"uratować życie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If a wound gets dirty, find some antiseptic quick!  Infections can be deadly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If it's too dark to see, you'll suffer penalties to dodge, melee, and aiming."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If the weather's too bad, you might just want to stay home."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you like archery but lack the strength, consider a crossbow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr "Jeśli się włamujesz, upewnij się, że wiesz również, jak się wydostać."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr ""
"Jeśli utknąłeś w domu ze złamaną nogą, czytaj książki, by czas mijał "
"szybciej."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Injuries take longer to heal the worse they are.  Don't overdo it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Insecticide is really good at killing bugs, even the big ones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It can take days or even weeks to put on weight after you've lost too much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to keep books around the house.  You never know when you'll "
"be laid up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr ""
"To, że miejsce jest niebezpieczne nie oznacza, że jest warte złupienia."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Just because they're all monsters doesn't mean they're friends.  Take "
"advantage of infighting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep a few spare weapons and pieces of armor around your base.  Switching is "
"easier than repairing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your "
"backpack."
msgstr ""
"Miej najpotrzebniejsze rzeczy w kieszeniach na wypadek, gdyby trzeba było "
"porzucić plecak."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you "
"get them faster."
msgstr ""
"Wiedza nie zastąpi praktycznych umiejętności i doświadczenia, ale pomoże ci "
"je szybciej zdobyć."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Large targets are easier to hit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O "
"to sort items."
msgstr ""
"Sortuj swoje łupy jednym ruchem. „Y”, aby ustawić strefy sortowania, „O”, "
"aby posortować."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr ""
"Uczysz się gry? Odwiedź menu przypisań klawiszy i naucz się jak pociągać za "
"sznurki."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."
msgstr ""
"Długość ma znaczenie… przynajmniej, gdy chcesz włożyć łopatę do plecaka."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's the sight, noise, or smell of the "
"living."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr "Lubisz hazard? Użyj mutagenów! Wygraj już dziś!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr ""
"Długa podróż przed tobą? Automatyczna podróż i automatyczne jeżdżenie "
"doprowadzi do wybranego celu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr ""
"Duża utrata krwi? Pij dużo, uzupełniaj żelazo i odpoczywaj, aby zregenerować "
"czerwone krwinki."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Domowej roboty broń szybko się rozpada, ale to jednak broń i można ją zrobić "
"ponownie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what "
"you can do with them."
msgstr ""
"Wiele przedmiotów ma zastosowanie kontekstowe. Menu akcji przedmiotu powie "
"ci, co można z nim zrobić."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr "Wiele przedmiotów ma specjalne akcje. Postaraj się poznać, co robią."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items "
"and drop them in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Noszone przedmioty zaznacz jako ulubione, by łatwo identyfikować nowe i "
"upuszczać je hurtowo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "Łoś może nie być twoim przyjacielem."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most adults are too heavy to climb drainpipes, so go find or make a "
"stepladder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of "
"pills."
msgstr ""
"Większość leków nie działa od razu, więc nie połykaj całej butelki pigułek."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running "
"away."
msgstr ""
"Większość zombie nie omija samochodów, a pcha się przez nie. Pamiętaj o tym "
"jak uciekasz."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Murky water is unsafe to drink, water might be safe, clean water is always "
"safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutagen can dramatically improve your stats.  Bionics can help a little, too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mutant meat is toxic, but surely a little bit would be OK."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutant meat isn't good for you, but if you're hungry, surely you can eat "
"just a little…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master "
"the ins and outs."
msgstr ""
"Brak ci doświadczenia w wytwarzaniu itp.? Przepisy treningowe pozwolą "
"opanować potrzebne tajniki."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply "
"pressure to the wound."
msgstr ""
"Nie ma w pobliżu bandaży? Uwolnij ręce i czekaj w miejscu, aby uciskać ranę."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash "
"cards!"
msgstr ""
"Nikt nie powiedział automatom sprzedającym o końcu świata. Karty płatnicze w "
"ruch!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Not much survives a hit from a very fast car."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting "
"components."
msgstr ""
"Zabrakło ci surowców? Zniszczenie lub rozmontowanie przedmiotów może dać "
"ciekawe rezultaty."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Over the counter pain medication is weak, but it's not habit forming. It may "
"keep you in the fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for "
"unforeseen circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Zbytnia pewność siebie to podstępny zabójca. Zostaw sobie przestrzeń na "
"nieprzewidziane sprawy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed "
"in the character menu."
msgstr ""
"Ból może drastycznie ciebie spowolnić i zredukować twoje statystyki. Sprawdź "
"swoją prędkość w menu postaci."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain medication doesn't reduce pain, it is a buffer against it for the "
"entirety of its duration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't "
"chew."
msgstr "Wybierz swoje walki, a nie vice versa. Mierz siły na zamiary."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Poison, radiation, and blood loss will negatively impact your lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr "Mocny ruch. Możesz przejąć kontrolę i grać jako twój towarzysz NPC."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Priorities for survival: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss "
"of productivity."
msgstr ""
"Długotrwałe wyczerpanie fizyczne powoduje strudzenie. Przepracowanie "
"powoduje utratę wydajności."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr "Umieść lejek nad słoikiem albo beczką i gromadź z czasem deszczówkę."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Rain ponchos are lightweight, easy to store, and can keep you dry in a storm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and "
"removed from it."
msgstr ""
"Pamiętaj, że panel boczny jest konfigurowalny i można tam dodawać i usuwać "
"widżety."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr "Rutyna zabija. Zachowaj czujność! Miej się na baczności."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire "
"to boil it."
msgstr ""
"Oszczędzaj czas. Zamiast korzystać z przepisu, umieść wodę w pojemniku na "
"ogniu, aby ją zagotować."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like "
"spears."
msgstr ""
"Boisz się walki w zwarciu? Rzuć czymś we wroga i użyj broni zasięgowych, "
"takich jak włócznie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Skillful management of your stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve "
"it when you can."
msgstr ""
"Umiejętne zarządzanie staminą jest kluczowe dla przetrwania. Oszczędzaj ją, "
"kiedy tylko możesz."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some animals can be tamed, especially when young.  Try finding some pet food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after defrosting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some mutations allow you to leap.  This makes it easy to get out of melee, "
"or up onto a roof."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some negative traits have their upsides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes you just can't run.  Always try to keep a handgun on you for "
"emergencies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Spraypaint can be used to blind enemies, and is especially effective against "
"robots."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Stun guns will cause even zombies to release their grabs, but effectiveness "
"falls off with size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Switching to a sidearm is often faster than reloading."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Tear gas stuns anything that breathes.  It blinds anything with eyes, except "
"robots and arthropods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr "Teren który cię spowalnia, spowolni też twoich wrogów."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The Archer's Form proficiency lowers the strength requirement on bows by up "
"to 6."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some "
"rare actions there."
msgstr ""
"Menu akcji powie ci, co możesz zrobić. Znajduje się tam również kilka "
"rzadkich akcji."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr "Najlepsza broń na świecie jest bezużyteczna bez amunicji."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) "
"kill them all."
msgstr ""
"Liczba zombie w mieście jest duża, ale skończona. Możesz je (kiedyś) "
"wszystkie zabić."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The worse you're hurt, the slower you'll heal. Try not to push yourself too "
"far."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The zone activity manager can make your life easier.  Do more in one go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are a million ways to use a garbage bag."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are billions of them and one of you, but only you have a working brain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know "
"the difference."
msgstr ""
"Są grzyby które zechcesz zjeść i takie, które zechcesz spalić. Poznasz "
"różnicę."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  "
"Check them out."
msgstr ""
"Kilka niepowiązanych ustawień klawiszy może okazać się dla ciebie przydatne. "
"Sprawdź je."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Te sekretne podziemne laboratoria muszą być pełne ciekawych rzeczy, czyż nie?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr ""
"Zwykle jest więcej niż jeden sposób na osiągnięcie czegoś. Myśl "
"niestereotypowo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."
msgstr "Spragniony podczas długiej zimowej wędrówki? Zabierz ze sobą termos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."
msgstr ""
"Zbyt zimno, by dobrze spać w nocy? Sterta ubrań sprawi, że będzie lepiej."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Trouble with sticky or slippery floors?  Try using them against your enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr "Ubiór strażacki chroni przed ogniem, ale nie przed przegrzaniem."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Twohanded weapons are hard to use when things are grabbing you.  Keep "
"something smaller on hand too!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr "W podziemiach jak jaskinia czy piwnica jest chłodno przez cały rok."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Use the fire, sludge, and acid some enemies spread to your advantage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you "
"need."
msgstr ""
"Używaj mapy mądrze. Priorytetem jest grabienie tych miejsc, które zaopatrzą "
"cię w to co potrzebujesz."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your "
"life."
msgstr ""
"Myśl też w pionie. Jeśli uda ci się jakoś dostać na dach, może ci to "
"uratować życie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want less micro-management?  The zone manager can change your game."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want to protect your gear from acid?  Try wearing a raincoat over it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Weariness can be debilitating.  Don't go into combat if you're tired!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr "Mokry i zły? Suchy ręcznik przywróci ci uśmiech na twarzy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr ""
"Podczas rozglądania się, użyj „T”, aby automatycznie pójść do celu lub "
"przedmiotu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your "
"best friend."
msgstr ""
"Gdy całe miasto to supermarket, koszyk na zakupy staje się twoim najlepszym "
"kumplem."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "When you are prone, you use the bipod of a rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better "
"quality of life."
msgstr ""
"Tam, gdzie to możliwe, stosuj czarne listy, białe listy i filtry, aby "
"poprawić jakość życia."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific "
"items in them."
msgstr ""
"Gdzie jest moja zapalniczka? Zarządzaj pojemnikami, by przypisać im "
"określone przedmioty."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr ""
"Po co chodzić pieszo, skoro można jechać autem? Albo rowerem? Albo na "
"łyżworolkach?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more "
"bullets."
msgstr ""
"Zwycięzcy nie biorą narkotyków. Są zbyt cenne. Zwycięzcy wymieniają "
"narkotyki na więcej naboi."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speed that up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for "
"your convenience."
msgstr ""
"Dla wygody zautomatyzuj powtarzalne zadania, np. zbieractwo, górnictwo czy "
"mycie podłogi."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you "
"make when you move."
msgstr ""
"Kucaj lub leż na ziemi, by kryć się za obiektami i redukować dźwięk, jaki "
"wydajesz podczas ruchu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Możesz zrobić niezwykłe rzeczy ze zwykłych przedmiotów. Przejdź w tryb "
"MacGyvera, gdy potrzeba."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr "Możesz sam ustawić reguły trybu bezpiecznego w menu pauzy."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can throw things while peeking around corners."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can use markers to rename items, making it easier to stay organized."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."
msgstr "Możesz używać myszki w ekwipunku i kilku innych menu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."
msgstr ""
"Można użyć myszy, aby przejść do miejsca docelowego, klikając je dwukrotnie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question "
"mark (?) key."
msgstr ""
"Lokalne przypisania klawiszy w danym podmenu wyświetlisz klawiszem znaku "
"zapytania („?”)."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."
msgstr "Nie musisz siedzieć tuż obok ognia, by go wykorzystać."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You don't need to grab every piece of loot you see.  There's always more to "
"find."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't win, you just do a little better each time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You won't use mutated body parts like fangs and horns to attack if they're "
"covered up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out.  Better yet, go prone first."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only "
"when you must."
msgstr ""
"Twój wróg jest często wolniejszy. Chodź oszczędzając staminę i biegaj tylko, "
"gdy musisz."

#. ~ Weather type name
#: data/core/weather.json
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "przejrzyście"

#. ~ Weather type name
#: data/core/weather.json
msgid "NULL Weather - BUG"
msgstr "PUSTA pogoda - BŁĄD"

