#. ~ Description of furniture "yellow indoor plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A decorative potted plant with a yellow flower, it looks to have wilted and "
"died some time ago."
msgstr ""
"Ozdobna roślina doniczkowa z żółtym kwiatem, wygląda jakby zwiędła i "
"obumarła jakiś czas temu."

#. ~ Description of furniture "seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A freshly planted seed.  If properly tended to, it could grow into a healthy "
"plant."
msgstr ""
"Świeżo zasadzone nasionko. Jeśli będzie odpowiednio pielęgnowane, może "
"wyrosnąć z niego zdrowa roślina."

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  Can "
"be used for planting crops."
msgstr ""
"Donica ogrodowa wypełniona ziemią i wyłożona listwami w celu umożliwienia "
"odpowiedniego drenażu. Może być wykorzystywana do sadzenia roślin."

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one contains a planted seed, and will need attention to grow fully."
msgstr ""
"Donica ogrodowa pełna ziemi i listew, zapewniających odpowiedni drenaż. Ta "
"zawiera zasadzone nasiona i będzie potrzebowała uwagi, aby w pełni wyrosły."

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a fully grown plant, and will need closer examination to harvest."
msgstr ""
"Donica ogrodowa pełna ziemi i listew, zapewniających odpowiedni drenaż. Ta "
"ma w pełni rozwiniętą roślinę, i będzie wymagać bliższych oględzin do zbioru"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a matured plant that should be ready for harvest before long."
msgstr ""
"Donica ogrodowa wypełniona ziemią i wyłożona listwami, zapewniającymi "
"odpowiedni drenaż. Ta ma dojrzałą roślinę, która powinna być gotowa do "
"zbiorów już niedługo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr ""
"Donica ogrodowa wypełniona ziemią i wyłożona listwami, zapewniającymi "
"odpowiedni drenaż. Ta ma nasiona, które właśnie zaczęły wypuszczać swoje "
"pierwsze korzenie."

#. ~ Description of furniture "seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "Nasiono, które właśnie zaczęło wypuszczać swoje pierwsze korzenie."

#. ~ Description of furniture "indoor plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A small potted plant, used for decoration indoors.  It appears to have dried "
"up and died a while ago."
msgstr ""
"Mała roślina doniczkowa, używana do dekoracji wnętrz. Wygląda na to, że "
"uschła i obumarła jakiś czas temu."

#. ~ Description of furniture "stooking spot"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A space has been cleared out here for grain drying.  Place fresh stalks of "
"grain in this spot and examine to set up a stook."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "sprout"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A tiny little sprout that has just begun to grow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "mutant sapling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A twisted and gnarled little tree.  Its shape is at once alien and familiar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "grain stook"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"Sheaves of cut grain have been stood upright in a self-supporting A-frame to "
"dry, keeping the seeds off the ground and out of reach of vermin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with dead plants"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"Somewhere beneath this heap of dying plants you can see the shape of wooden "
"furniture.  Left without care, the plants it used to nurture have shriveled "
"and died."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "mutant tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"This bizarre tree spreads its twisted branches at odd angles toward the "
"sky.  If you squint, it almost looks like a human figure with its arms "
"raised to catch the sun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "overgrown plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"This patch of green used to be a cultivated field or some sort of monocrop "
"agriculture.  Neglected for too long, it has been overtaken by nature."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "This plant has matured, and will be ready to harvest before long."
msgstr "Ta roślina dojrzała i będzie gotowa do zbiorów już niedługo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"This plant is fully grown and ready to be harvested.  Identifying how to "
"harvest it requires closer examination."
msgstr ""
"Ta roślina jest w pełni rozwinięta i gotowa do zbiorów. Identyfikacja "
"sposobu zbioru wymaga dokładniejszych oględzin."

