"Several layers of woven fiberglass stacked and laminated together with epoxy "
"to form an armor plate for a giant's torso.  In a pinch, this could be used "
"in an oversized plate carrier to provide a modicum of protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fiberglass ballistic plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
