#. ~ Description of "survivor backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_storage.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built backpack.  Durable and carefully crafted to hold as much "
"stuff as possible."
msgstr ""
"Spersonalizowany plecak. Wytrzymały i przemyślnie skonstruowany, by "
"pomieścić tyle sprzętu ile się da."

#. ~ Description of "survivor rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_storage.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built heavy backpack.  Durable and carefully crafted to hold as "
"much stuff as possible."
msgstr ""
"Spersonalizowany pojemny plecak podróżny. Wytrzymały i przemyślnie "
"skonstruowany, by pomieścić tyle sprzętu ile się da."

#. ~ Description of "survivor duffel bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_storage.json
