#. ~ Description of "welding goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A dark pair of goggles.  They make seeing very difficult, but protect you "
"from bright flashes."
msgstr ""
"Para gogli spawalniczych. Utrudniają widzenie w normalnych warunkach ale "
"chronią przed intensywnymi błyskami światła."

#. ~ Description of "ski goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A large pair of light-reactive goggles that completely seal off your eyes.  "
"In addition to blocking glare without impeding vision in the dark, they "
"provide excellent protection from environmental dangers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and far-"
"sighted.  You can use them to focus sunlight."
msgstr ""
"Okulary dwuogniskowe z których korzystają osoby z krótko i "
"dalekowzrocznością. Można nimi skupić światło słoneczne."

#. ~ Description of "bifocal sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of bifocal sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those "
"who are both near-sighted and far-sighted."
msgstr ""
"Para dwuogniskowych okularów przeciwsłonecznych do ochrony przed promieniami "
"słonecznymi dla osób, które są zarówno krótkowzroczne jak i dalekowzroczne."

#. ~ Description of "eclipse glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of cardboard-framed glasses with UV and IR-filtered lenses topped "
"with a layer of aluminum coating.  They allow safe viewing of extremely "
"bright and harmful sources of light, like the sun during a solar eclipse."
msgstr ""
"Para okularów z kartonową oprawa z soczewkami złożonymi z filtrów UV i "
"podczerwieni, pokryte warstwą aluminium. Pozwalają na bezpieczne patrzenie "
"na ekstremalnie jasne źródła światła, jak na przykład słońce podczas "
"zaćmienia."

#. ~ Description of "fit-over sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of fit-over sunglasses designed to be worn over a pair of corrective "
"glasses.  Good for keeping the glare out of your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Przeciwsłoneczne nakładki na okulary korekcyjne. Chronią oczy przed słońcem."

#. ~ Description of "transition reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  The lenses contain photochromic dyes "
"that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to sunlight, making them useful "
"day and night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else.  You can "
"use them to focus sunlight."
msgstr ""
"Para okularów dla dalekowidzów. Bezużyteczne dla pozostałych ludzi. Możesz "
"nimi skupić światło."

#. ~ Description of "eyeglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse the "
"sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr ""
"Para okularów dla krótkowidzów. Soczewki szkieł rozpraszają światło, więc "
"nie rozpalisz nimi ognia."

#. ~ Description of "glass goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of old-fashioned goggles with thick glass lenses, somewhat similar to "
"those worn by the pilots of open-cockpit aircraft.  They're not airtight, "
"but might still offer some protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "safety glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of plastic glasses, used in workshops, sports, chemistry labs, and "
"many other places.  Provides great protection from damage."
msgstr ""
"Plastikowe okulary używane w warsztatach, sporcie, laboratoriach chemicznych "
"i wielu innych miejscach. Chronią oczy przed obrażeniami."

#. ~ Description of "stylish bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and "
"far-sighted."
msgstr ""
"Stylowe okulary dwuogniskowe, z których korzystają osoby, które są zarówno "
"krótko i dalekowzroczne."

#. ~ Description of "stylish transition bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and "
"far-sighted.  The lenses contain photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to "
"darken when exposed to sunlight, making them useful day and night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stylish bifocal sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish bifocal sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes "
"of those who are both near-sighted and far-sighted."
msgstr ""
"Para stylowych dwuogniskowych okularów przeciwsłonecznych do ochrony przed "
"promieniami słonecznymi dla osób, które są zarówno krótkowzroczne jak i "
"dalekowzroczne."

#. ~ Description of "stylish reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else."
msgstr ""
"Para stylowych okularów dla dalekowidzów. Bezużyteczne dla pozostałych ludzi."

#. ~ Description of "stylish corrective glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse "
"the sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr ""
"Para stylowych okularów dla krótkowidzów. Soczewki szkieł rozpraszają "
"światło, więc nie rozpalisz nimi ognia."

#. ~ Description of "stylish reading sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses, looks good while keeping the glare out of the "
"eyes of those who are far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else."
msgstr ""
"Para stylowych okularów przeciwsłonecznych, które wyglądają dobrze, a "
"jednoczenie chronią oczy dalekowidzów przed światłem słonecznym. "
"Bezużyteczne dla pozostałych osób."

#. ~ Description of "stylish corrective sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses, looks good while keeping the glare out of the "
"eyes of those who are near-sighted."
msgstr ""
"Para stylowych okularów przeciwsłonecznych, które wyglądają dobrze, a "
"jednocześnie chronią oczy krótkowidzów przed światłem słonecznym."

#. ~ Description of "stylish sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses.  Look good while keeping the glare out of your "
"eyes."
msgstr ""
"Stylowe okulary, które świetnie wyglądają i chronią oczy przed słońcem."

#. ~ Description of "reading sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are "
"far-sighted."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "corrective sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are "
"near-sighted."
msgstr ""
"Para okularów przeciwsłonecznych do ochrony oczu krótkowidzów przed światłem "
"słonecznym."

#. ~ Description of "sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of sunglasses, good for keeping the glare out of your eyes, not so "
"good in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "transition bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of transition bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and "
"far-sighted.  Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken "
"when exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light "
"diminishes, the lenses fade back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "transition corrective glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of transition glasses for the near-sighted.  The lenses contain "
"photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to sunlight, "
"making them useful day and night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather eyepatch"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A patch of black leather to cover an eye, with a string to keep it from "
"falling off.  If wearing this doesn't make you feel a pirate, nothing will."
msgstr ""
"Opaska z czarnej skóry zakrywająca oko, ze sznurkiem, aby nie spadła. Jeśli "
"noszenie tego nie sprawi, że poczujesz się jak pirat, to nic tego nie zrobi."

#. ~ Description of "stylish transition reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A stylish pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  The lenses contain "
"photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to sunlight, "
"making them useful day and night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stylish transition corrective glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A stylish pair of glasses for the near-sighted.  The lenses contain "
"photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to sunlight, "
"making them useful day and night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "monocle"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"An essential article of the gentleman's apparel.  Also corrects near-"
"sightedness.  The concave lens diffuses the sunlight, rendering it useless "
"for starting fires."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ballistic glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"Modern tactical eyewear that protects from small projectiles and fragments.  "
"Provides excellent protection from environmental dangers."
msgstr ""
"Współczesne okulary strzeleckie chroniące przed odłamkami podczas "
"strzelania. Zapewnia doskonałą ochronę oczu przed niebezpiecznymi warunkami "
"środowiskowymi."

#. ~ Description of "snow goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"Traditionally used by the Inuit to protect against snow blindness, these "
"bone goggles provide only a thin slit to see out of.  They'll protect from "
"glare, but at great cost to the wearer's vision."
msgstr ""

