#. ~ Description of "night vision goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"Last generation double-tube night vision device, designed to be mounted on a "
"compatible helmet.  Currently raised up and out of the way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "night vision goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"Last generation single-tube night vision device, designed to be mounted on a "
"compatible helmet.  Limited field of view while activated.  It is turned on, "
"and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

