#. ~ Description of "beekeeping hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A beekeeping hood.  Keeps the bees out, but lets fresh air in."
msgstr ""
"Kaptur pszczelarski. Trzyma pszczoły na dystans przepuszczając jednocześnie "
"powietrze."

#. ~ Description of "ninja cowl"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A cloth hood that covers the mouth, leaving only the wearer's eyes exposed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A cowl made to fit over the head, leaving only the face exposed.  It is "
"quite thick and may be of some use in combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gutskin hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A hood sewn from treated and split intestines, the perfect companion for a "
"gutskin parka."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail coif"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A protective hood made of interlocking steel rings that drape down to cover "
"the neck.  It is of poor quality."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail coif"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A protective hood made of interlocking steel rings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant cowl"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A snug fitting garment that protects your head and neck, made from "
"lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric.  Tough yet breathable, it is light "
"and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr ""
"Przytulny przylegający kaptur chroniący głowę i szyją z cienkiej i lekkiej "
"warstwy ogniotrwałego Nomeksu. Wytrzymały lecz oddychający. Jest na tyle "
"lekki i wygodny, że można go nosić pod ubraniem."

#. ~ Description of "rain hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A waterproof hood made to be worn in bad weather."
msgstr "Nieprzemakalny kaptur przeznaczony do noszenia przy złej pogodzie."

