#. ~ Description of "leather backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A backpack made of leather.  Though a bit heavier than other materials, it "
"is certainly quite durable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "denim backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A backpack made out of soft but durable denim."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A bag stitched together from leather scraps.  Doesn't hold an awful lot but "
"is easy to wear."
msgstr ""
"Sakwa zszyta ze skrawków skór. Wiele nie pomieści ale wygodnie się ją nosi."

#. ~ Description of "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled "
"straps.  Provides some extra storage for outdoor activities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic shopping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bag used to carry groceries home."
msgstr "Torba, w której noszono zakupy do domu."

#. ~ Description of "net backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A bag woven together from strings, with straps to wear it on back.  Lighter "
"than a standard backpack, but more awkward to carry when loaded and unable "
"to hold small or heavy items."
msgstr ""
"Torba spleciona z sznurków, z paskami do noszenia na plecach. Lżejszy od "
"standardowego plecaka, ale bardziej niewygodny w noszeniu po załadowaniu. "
"Nie jest w stanie pomieścić małych lub ciężkich przedmiotów."

#. ~ Description of "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A durable nylon bag marketed towards military personnel.  It has clips on "
"the top and back, making it easy to attach a strap and wear it comfortably "
"as a fanny pack.  MOLLE webbing on the back lets you affix it to body armor "
"or a backpack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A fancy leather purse from a well-known designer.  A bit cumbersome to wear, "
"but provides some storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "straw basket"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A handmade straw basket.  Carry it with you for extra storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "travelpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A hiking pack used for short trips."
msgstr "Plecak używany do krótkich wycieczek."

#. ~ Description of "duffel bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge duffel bag.  Provides plenty of storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr "Olbrzymia torba podróżna z wielką pojemnością, ale bardzo niewygodna."

#. ~ Description of "military rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A huge military rucksack, provides a lot of storage."
msgstr "Olbrzymi plecak wojskowy zapewniający mnóstwo miejsca."

#. ~ Description of "dry duffel bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge watertight duffel bag.  Capable of floating.  Provides plenty of "
"storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "suitcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge wheeled suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other "
"possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it "
"around is neither fast nor comfortable."
msgstr ""
"Wielka walizka z kółkami do przewozu ubrań i innych rzeczy w podróży, "
"zapewnia sporo miejsca, ale ciągnięcie jej nie jest ani wygodne ani szybkie."

#. ~ Description of "jerrypack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A jerrycan modified to be worn in a similar manner to a backpack."
msgstr "Kanister zmodyfikowany by go nosić jak tornister."

#. ~ Description of "swag bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large canvas sack re-purposed for makeshift storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wicker backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large handmade straw basket with a lid and shoulder straps to wear it like "
"a backpack.  Less comfortable than a proper backpack, but will do the job."
msgstr ""
"Duży, ręcznie robiony kosz słomkowy z pokrywą i paskami na ramiona, aby "
"nosić go jak plecak. Mniej wygodny niż prawdziwy plecak, ale spełni swoje "
"zadanie."

#. ~ Description of "hiking backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large hiking backpack with plenty of storage space."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large tactical backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large multi-compartment backpack that offers great lower back support."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large sheet tied into a crude, over-the-shoulder sling."
msgstr "Duży kawałek materiału, zwinięty, by utworzyć naramienne zawieszenie."

#. ~ Description of "loop of rope"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A length of rope tied with a sliding knot into a loop.  You can slip all "
"sorts of large objects in and carry them as a bundle; if you want to tie a "
"single item more securely you'd have to disassemble this loop.  It takes a "
"while to untie it and get things out, and attackers might pull the whole "
"thing undone if you're not careful."
msgstr ""
"Kawałek liny związanej węzłem przesuwnym w pętlę. Możesz w nią wsunąć "
"różnego rodzaju duże przedmioty i nieść je jako wiązkę; jeśli chcesz związać "
"pojedynczy przedmiot w sposób bardziej bezpieczny, musisz rozłożyć tę pętlę. "
"Rozplątanie jej i wyciągnięcie rzeczy zajmuje trochę czasu, a napastnicy "
"mogą rozpiąć całą pętlę, jeśli nie zachowasz ostrożności."

#. ~ Description of "utility vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A light vest covered in pockets and straps for storage."
msgstr ""
"Lekka kamizelka obszyta paskami i kieszeniami na narzędzia i inne przedmioty."

#. ~ Description of "dive bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A lightweight mesh backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr ""
"Lekki plecak z elastycznej siatki, noszony często przez nurków i pływaków."

#. ~ Description of "dry bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight watertight backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "longarm bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long duffel bag.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  Quite "
"cumbersome."
msgstr ""
"Długa torba podróżna. Zapewnia miejsce do przechowywania broni długiej i "
"karabinów. Dość niewygodna."

#. ~ Description of "leather double rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for 2 long arms and "
"rifles.  Includes 3 accessory pockets and a strap."
msgstr ""
"Długi, miękki skórzany futerał na karabiny. Umożliwia przechowywanie 2 sztuk "
"broni długiej i karabinów. Zawiera 3 kieszenie na akcesoria i pasek."

#. ~ Description of "leather rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  "
"Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr ""
"Długi, miękki skórzany futerał na karabiny. Pozwala na przechowywanie broni "
"długiej i karabinów. Zawiera małą kieszeń, pasek i uchwyt."

#. ~ Description of "double rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long soft rifle case.  Provides storage for 2 long arms and rifles.  "
"Includes 3 accessory pockets and a strap."
msgstr ""
"Długi, miękki futerał na karabiny. Umożliwia przechowywanie 2 sztuk broni "
"długiej i karabinów. Zawiera 3 kieszenie na akcesoria i pasek."

#. ~ Description of "rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long soft rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  "
"Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr ""
"Długi, miękki futerał na karabiny. Pozwala na przechowywanie broni długiej i "
"karabinów. Zawiera małą kieszeń, pasek i uchwyt."

#. ~ Description of "box backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A makeshift backpack comprised of a wooden box and a pair of ropes."
msgstr "Prowizoryczny plecak składający się z drewnianej skrzynki i pary lin."

#. ~ Description of "pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift bag, cobbled together from rags.  Really gets in the way, but "
"provides a decent amount of storage."
msgstr ""
"Prowizoryczna sakwa spleciona z kilku szmat. Niewygodnie się ją taszczy, "
"choć zapewnia przyzwoitą pojemność."

#. ~ Description of "suitcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A mid-sized wheeled suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other "
"possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it "
"around is not exactly comfortable."
msgstr ""
"Średnich rozmiarów walizka na kółkach do przewozu ubrań i innych rzeczy w "
"podróży; zapewnia przyzwoitą ilość miejsca, ale taszczenie jej ze sobą nie "
"jest zbyt wygodne."

#. ~ Description of "backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A nylon backpack with a zipper pocket."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift knapsack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A pair of pants with the bottom ends tied with string, and then passed "
"through the belt loops so the knapsack can be carried on the back."
msgstr ""
"Para spodni z nogawkami zawiązanymi sznurkiem i następnie przewleczonym "
"przez szlufki aby ten prowizoryczny plecak można było nosić na plecach."

#. ~ Description of "laundry basket"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A plastic basket meant for storing and hauling clothing."
msgstr ""
"Plastikowy kosz przeznaczony do przechowywania i transportowania ubrań."

#. ~ Description of "debug pocket universe"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A pocket universe.  Can store approximately 384 * 10^6 bugs."
msgstr "Kieszonkowy wszechświat. Może pomieścić około 384 * 10^6 bugów."

#. ~ Description of "drop leg pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A pouch that can be worn on the thighs using buckled straps.  This variety "
"is favored by the military."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diving pouches"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A set of pouches that can be worn on the thighs using buckled neoprene rig.  "
"This variety is favored by the divers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "camera bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A simple bag used to hold a camera, with a small pocket on the side for "
"accessories.  Comes with a carry strap."
msgstr ""
"Prosta torba do przechowywania aparatu fotograficznego, z małą kieszonką z "
"boku na akcesoria. Wyposażona w pasek do przenoszenia."

#. ~ Description of "sling pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A simple single-sling backpack.  Easier to access than a normal backpack, "
"but can't comfortably hold as much."
msgstr ""
"Prosty plecaczek o jednym ramiączku. Zapewnia łatwiejszy dostęp od zwykłego "
"plecaka, ale nie można komfortowo zmieścić w nim równie tyle rzeczy."

#. ~ Description of "ankle wallet pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed wallet pouch worn on the ankle.  If you strap it under "
"your clothes, it can help you keep your wallet hidden and safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fanny pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small fabric bag worn on the waist, with the pouch in front for easy "
"access.  Once used as a visual shorthand for unstylish geeks and silly "
"tourists, it was making a decent comeback before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be worn on the upper arm using buckled straps.  This "
"is a favored item among sports & camping enthusiasts.  Use it to adjust it "
"to fit your leg."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small purse that can be worn on the upper leg using buckled straps, easier "
"to use than on the arm.  For those who want to wear a dress without pockets "
"while carrying their phone and money.  Use it to adjust it to fit your arm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "golf bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A tall canvas and plastic bag with fold-out legs used for golfing.  It even "
"has straps to be worn on the back and a slot for an umbrella."
msgstr ""
"Wysoki płócienny i plastikowy worek z rozkładanymi nóżkami, używany do "
"golfu. Ma nawet paski do noszenia na plecach i kieszeń na parasol."

#. ~ Description of "big trapper pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A wooden frame with waterproofed cloth stretched around it, and a drawstring "
"at the top to hold things in.  It has straps to wear it on your back."
msgstr ""
"Drewniana rama z nieprzemakalną tkaniną rozciągniętą wokół niej i sznurkiem "
"ściągającym u góry, który przytrzymuje rzeczy. Posiada paski umożliwiające "
"noszenie jej na plecach."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "tourniquet (arm)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "tourniquet (leg)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "messenger bag"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "adjustable sling"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "adjustable sling (front)"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json data/json/items/gunmod/sling.json
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Adjust"
msgstr "Wyreguluj"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Adjust on the arm"
msgstr "Dopasuj na rękę"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Adjust on the leg"
msgstr "Dopasuj na nogę"

#. ~ Description of "high-volume rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Also known as a \"bigpack\", this gigantic rucksack is prized by packrats, "
"but it would be inadvisable to attempt any physical activity while wearing "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "trapper pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An L-shaped wooden frame with a waterproofed cloth sack attached to it.  "
"There's a drawstring to hold things in and straps to carry it on your back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pack frame"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "An L-shaped wooden frame with straps to secure a large item to it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical dump pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An expandable pouch secured with straps.  Provides a bit of extra storage "
"with minimal encumbrance."
msgstr ""
"Rozciągliwa ładownica montowana paskami. Zapewnia dodatkową przestrzeń bez "
"istotnego skrępowania ruchów."

#. ~ Description of "long leather rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An extra long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and "
"rifles.  Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr ""
"Bardzo długi, miękki skórzany futerał na karabiny. Pozwala na przechowywanie "
"broni długiej i karabinów. Zawiera małą kieszeń, pasek i uchwyt."

#. ~ Description of "bookstrap"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned book strap carrier.  Guaranteed to make you feel like a "
"proper scholar."
msgstr ""
"Staroświeckie nosidełko do książek. Gwarantuje, że poczujesz się jak "
"prawdziwy uczony."

#. ~ Description of "daypack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An ultralight nylon backpack intended for one-day hiking trips.  Waterproof, "
"slim, and spacious."
msgstr ""
"Ultralekki plecak nylonowy przeznaczony do jednodniowych wycieczek pieszych. "
"Wodoodporny, smukły i przestronny."

#. ~ Description of "petpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm this would allow your four-legged friend to see the "
"world, now it's used to shield them from the world."
msgstr ""
"Przed Kataklizmem pozwoliłoby to twojemu czworonożnemu przyjacielowi "
"zobaczyć świat, teraz służy do chronienia go przed światem."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Center pocket."
msgstr "Środkowa kieszeń."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Front pocket."
msgstr "Przednia kieszeń."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
msgid_plural "H&K operational briefcases (empty)"
msgstr[0] "walizka operacyjna H&K (pusta)"
msgstr[1] "walizki operacyjne H&K (puste)"
msgstr[2] "walizek operacyjnych H&K (pustych)"
msgstr[3] "walizki operacyjnej H&K (pustej)"

#. ~ Description of "messenger bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Light and easy to wear, but doesn't offer much storage."
msgstr "Lekka i łatwa w noszeniu, ale pojemność nie jest przesadna."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE assault pack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE assault packs"
msgstr[0] "plecak patrolowy MOLLE"
msgstr[1] "plecaki patrolowe MOLLE"
msgstr[2] "plecaków patrolowych MOLLE"
msgstr[3] "plecaka patrolowego MOLLE"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE large rucksack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE large rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "plecak główny MOLLE"
msgstr[1] "plecaki główne MOLLE"
msgstr[2] "plecaków głównych MOLLE"
msgstr[3] "plecaka głównego MOLLE"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE medium rucksack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE medium rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "plecak średni MOLLE"
msgstr[1] "plecaki średnie MOLLE"
msgstr[2] "plecaków średnich MOLLE"
msgstr[3] "plecaka średniego MOLLE"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "hiking backpack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE assault pack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE medium rucksack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE large rucksack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "military rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Pouch sized for a hydration pack."
msgstr "Kieszeń wielkości bukłaka na plecy."

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "hiking backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Sheath blade"
msgstr "Schowaj ostrze"

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "golf bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Sheath golf club"
msgstr "Schowaj kij golfowy"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "daypack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "travelpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Small pocket for a water bottle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "MOLLE assault pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"backpack.  Covered with pockets and straps, it strikes a fine balance "
"between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets to the "
"outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"Modułowy system przenoszenia oporządzenia osobistego MOLLE to zaawansowany "
"plecak wojskowy. Zaopatrzony w kieszenie i zaczepy, stanowi zbalansowane "
"rozwiązanie pomiędzy zapewnieniem pojemności a skrępowaniem ruchu. Można "
"przymocować kieszenie na akcesoria do olinowania zewnętrznego."

#. ~ Description of "MOLLE large rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"large rucksack.  Covered with straps for modularity, it strikes a fine "
"balance between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets "
"to the outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"Modułowy system przenoszenia oporządzenia osobistego MOLLE to zaawansowany "
"zasadniczy plecak wojskowy. Zaopatrzony w pasy dla modularności, stanowi "
"zbalansowane rozwiązanie pomiędzy zapewnieniem pojemności a skrępowaniem "
"ruchu. Można przymocować kieszenie na akcesoria do olinowania zewnętrznego."

#. ~ Description of "MOLLE medium rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"medium rucksack.  Covered with straps for modularity, it strikes a fine "
"balance between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets "
"to the outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"Modułowy system przenoszenia oporządzenia osobistego MOLLE to zaawansowany "
"średni plecak wojskowy. Zaopatrzony w pasy dla modularności, stanowi "
"zbalansowane rozwiązanie pomiędzy zapewnieniem pojemności a skrępowaniem "
"ruchu. Można przymocować kieszenie na akcesoria do olinowania zewnętrznego."

#. ~ Description of "runner pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The obvious choice for outdoor athletes, this ergonomic backpack is light "
"and easy to wear, ensuring comfort when carrying heavy and bulky items."
msgstr ""
"Oczywisty wybór sportowca. Ergonomiczna lekka sakwa wygodna w noszeniu, "
"zapewniająca komfort w noszeniu ciężkich lub dużych przedmiotów."

#. ~ Description of "tainted hide bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The raw skin of a monster, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage.  "
"It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr ""
"Nieprzetworzona skóra potwora, szybko zamieniona w improwizowaną torbę. "
"Wciąż będzie się rozkładać i musi być wyprawiona i wygarbowana."

#. ~ Description of "hide bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The raw skin of an animal, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage.  "
"It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr ""
"Nieprzetworzona skóra zwierzęcia, szybko zamieniona w prowizoryczną torbę. "
"Wciąż będzie się rozkładać i musi być wyprawiona i wygarbowana."

#. ~ Description of "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"This is a plain, hard-sided black briefcase with a trigger in the handle and "
"a concealed hole in the side.  Squeezing the trigger would currently do "
"nothing, as it is empty.  Don't forget to put a suitable MP5 back inside "
"before you try to pay any ransom fees with lead."
msgstr ""
"Jest to zwykła, twarda, czarna walizka ze spustem w rączce i ukrytym otworem "
"z boku. Naciśnięcie spustu nic nie da, ponieważ jest pusta. Nie zapomnij "
"włożyć do środka odpowiedniego MP5, zanim spróbujesz zapłacić okup ołowiem."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "backpack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "leather backpack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "denim backpack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "large tactical backpack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "high-volume rucksack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "box backpack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "daypack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "makeshift knapsack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE assault pack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE medium rucksack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE large rucksack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "military rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Tucked between your back and the backpack."
msgstr "Schowane między twoimi plecami a plecakiem."

#. ~ Description of "briefcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Useful for carrying money, documents, or smuggled goods."
msgstr "Używana do przenoszenia pieniędzy, dokumentów lub kontrabandy."

#. ~ Description of "violin case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Useful to carry your precious musical instrument around protected from any "
"harm."
msgstr ""
"Użyteczny do noszenia twojego cennego instrumentu muzycznego i chronienia go "
"przed uszkodzeniem."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#, c-format
msgid "You adjust your %s to wear it on your arm."
msgstr "Dopasowujesz swój przedmiot: %s do noszenia go na ręce."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#, c-format
msgid "You adjust your %s to wear it on your leg."
msgstr "Dopasowujesz swój przedmiot: %s do noszenia go na nodze."

#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "golf bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#, c-format
msgid "You awkwardly sheath your %s"
msgstr "Niezgrabnie chowasz %s do torby"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "messenger bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "You move the bag to your back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "messenger bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "You slide the bag to your side."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bindle"
