#. ~ Description of "Siddur"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A Siddur, or prayerbook, contains the set order of prayers for Jewish "
"religious services.  This one is comprehensive, divided into morning, "
"afternoon, and evening prayers for both weekdays and Shabbat, along with "
"separate sections for minor and major holidays."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Hell in Jewish Literature" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A analysis of rabbinic discussions of Gehinnom, the Jewish afterlife for the "
"cleansing of sins, including how big it is, how hot it is, who goes there, "
"how long they stay there, whether there is any relief from their punishments "
"in the meantime, and exactly what shape Gehinnom is."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "experimental novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A bizarre play about the philosophy of existential absurdity.  Or maybe it's "
"about two guys waiting for their friend to show up.  It's confusing."
msgstr ""
"Dziwaczna sztuka o filozofii i absurdzie egzystencji. Choć może o dwóch "
"kolesiach czekających na mającego zjawić się kolegę. Dezorientująca."

#. ~ Description of variant "Zohar: The Book of Splendor: Basic Readings from the Kabbalah" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A book of Jewish mysticism often attributed to the great rabbi Shimon bar "
"Yochai, the Zohar is the central work of Kabbalah.  This is an abridged "
"version containing selected passages from the full text."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "book of classic literature"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A book of classic literature, timeless and enjoyable but a bit dense to read."
msgstr ""
"Książka z literatury klasycznej, ponadczasowa i przyjemna ale trochę gęsta "
"do czytania."

#. ~ Description of variant "Mimekor Yisrael, Book One: The National Tales" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of Jewish folktales, from Ashmedai king of demons to golem-"
"making rabbis, from the Torah scholar who showed Aristotle the futility of "
"philosophy to how Satan refused to bow to Adam because Adam was created from "
"the dust of the earth, from martyrs murdered by Christian persecutors to "
"General Joab single-handedly killing two thousand Amalekites so that when "
"the blood ran out like a river through the city gates his troops knew to "
"stop besieging the city and assault it, and dozens more besides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "book of essays"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of essays by various authors from around the world, including "
"works by Churchill, Mailer, Eco, and Voltaire."
msgstr ""
"Zbiór esejów różnego autorstwa z całego świata, w tym prace Churchila, "
"Mallera, Eco i Woltera."

#. ~ Description of variant "Miriam's Tambourine: Jewish Folktales from Around the World" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of over fifty Jewish folktales, from classics like the story of "
"Miriam's well or Rabbi Loew and the golem or the life of the Baal Shem Tov, "
"to Jewish versions of modern cultural classics like Snow White or Sinbad."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "book of plays"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of plays by various authors from around the world, including "
"scripts by Wilde, Beckett, Checkov, and Shakespeare."
msgstr ""
"Kolekcja sztuk teatralnych różnych autorów z całego świata, w tym Wilde’a, "
"Becketta, Czechowa i Szekspira."

#. ~ Description of "book of poetry"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of poetry by various authors from around the world, including "
"writings by Dickinson, Goethe, Thoreau, and Yeats."
msgstr ""
"Kolekcja wierszy wybranych autorów z całego świata. Zawiera wiersze "
"Dickinsona, Goethego, Thoreaua i Yeatsa."

#. ~ Description of variant "OU Manual for Checking Fruits and Vegetables" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A comprehensive guide to checking produce for insect infestation and how to "
"prepare produce according to Jewish dietary law."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Megillat Esther: The Book of Esther" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A comprehensive work for celebrating Purim, this book contains the complete "
"Book of Esther in Hebrew, multiple English translations, commentary on each "
"of its chapters, and commentary on certain verses by a group of Conservative "
"rabbis.  Cursed be Haman (booo)!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Standing Again at Sinai: Judaism from a Feminist Perspective" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A critique of Jewish practice by a Jewish feminist theologian."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mystery novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A detective investigates an unusual murder in a secluded location."
msgstr "Detektyw bada sprawę tajemniczego morderstwa w ustronnej lokalizacji."

#. ~ Description of variant "Reviving Synagogue Communities Using Smart Tech" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A discussion of ways to use modern technology to alleviate the "
"administrative burden on clergy and synagogue staff but without losing the "
"human touch that leads to a proper religious community."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "black box transcript"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A full flight log for a military aircraft.  Nothing of interest stands out."
msgstr ""
"Pełny log lotu wojskowego samolotu. Nic nietypowego nie rzuca się w oczy."

#. ~ Description of "buddy novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A gripping tale of two friends struggling to survive on the streets of New "
"York City."
msgstr ""
"Chwytająca za serce powieść o dwójce przyjaciół walczących o przetrwanie na "
"ulicach Nowego Jorku."

#. ~ Description of "Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A grizzled clodhopper interviews a mess of rangehands, flummoxing longhorns "
"and tenderfoot alike in a flusteration of jawing."
msgstr ""
"Stary wyjadacz robi wywiad z bandą nieogarniętych pomagierów, chłopców na "
"posyłki i wioskowych głupków, w ferworze szczękania zębami."

#. ~ Description of "erotic novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A hackneyed fictional narrative concealing low-grade literary smut."
msgstr "Nudna fikcyjna narracja skrywająca literackie porno niskiej klasy."

#. ~ Description of "grimoire"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A hefty book with a thick leather cover and metal clasps.  Both covers are "
"completely empty, though on the first page there is an author's name written "
"in English: \"Abdul Alhazred\"; below it the book title is written in "
"Arabian: \"العزيف\", and below it in Greek: \"Νεκρονομικόν\".  The book "
"looks very old and sinister."
msgstr ""
"Solidna księga z grubą skórzaną okładką i metalowymi zapięciami. Obie "
"okładki są zupełnie puste, choć na pierwszej stronie widnieje nazwisko "
"autora napisane po angielsku: „Abdul Alhazred”; pod nim tytuł książki "
"napisany po arabsku: „العزيف”, a pod nim po grecku: „Νεκρονομικόν”. Książka "
"wygląda bardzo staro i złowieszczo."

#. ~ Description of variant "From the Maccabees to the Mishnah" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A history of the development of Rabbinic Judaism, from the Jewish Revolt in "
"the first century to the writing of the Mishnah, and how Judaism and "
"Christianity fully separated."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "photo album"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A leather album full of photos of somebody's family.  You don't know any of "
"the people in them, but seeing these pictures still makes you think of "
"happier times."
msgstr ""
"Skórzany album ze zdjęciami czyjejś rodziny. Nie znasz nikogo na zdjęciach, "
"ale przypominają ci o szczęśliwszych czasach."

#. ~ Description of variant "On the Doorposts of Your House" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A list of prayers, meditations, and rituals for use at home, from lighting "
"the Shabbat candles to welcoming a new child into the household."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Stinky Bart Puts on Starch"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A local bandit, driven by sadistic impulses, begins offering unlicensed "
"dentistry to brave frontiersmen with few options and fewer teeth."
msgstr ""
"Miejscowy bandyta, wiedziony sadystycznymi impulsami, zaczyna oferować "
"nielicencjonowaną stomatologię odważnym mieszkańcom pogranicza, którzy mają "
"mało opcji i jeszcze mniej zębów."

#. ~ Description of variant "The Observant Life: The Wisdom of Contemporary Judaism for Contemporary Jews" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A long discussion of the ways in which Judaism's ancient rituals, "
"traditions, and ethical practices are still relevant and meaningful in the "
"modern world.  Unfortunately, there's no discussion of post-apocalyptic "
"Judaism."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "patient treatment records"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A massive stack of medical records that contain every gory detail."
msgstr ""
"Masywny plik kart chorób i wyników badań zawierający każdy krwawy szczegół."

#. ~ Description of variant "When Bad Things Happen to Good People" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A meditation on meaningless tragedy and why the disaster and sorrow in the "
"world is unevenly distributed.  Written decades before the Cataclysm, but "
"the author was obviously on to something."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Rural Digest-Examiner"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A newsweekly covering regional events.  There is an article on the winter's "
"snowstorms and several letters to the editor concerning the community "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Tygodnik powszechny skupiający się na regionalnych wydarzeniach. Jest w nim "
"artykuł o zimowych opadach śniegu z komentarzem wydawcy o reakcji lokalnej "
"społeczności."

#. ~ Description of "frequency list"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A notepad with a number of frequencies scribbled on it."
msgstr "Notatnik z odnotowaną listą obecności."

#. ~ Description of "Cat's Cradle"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A paperback edition of Kurt Vonnegut's fourth novel, in which the threat of "
"nuclear destruction isn't much of an influence on human nature."
msgstr ""
"Wydanie papierowe czwartej powieści Kurta Vonneguta, w której groźba "
"nuklearnej zagłady nie ma większego wpływu na ludzką naturę."

#. ~ Description of "satire novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A political satire of the pre-apocalypse world.  Looking back on it from "
"this side of Armageddon makes it seem all the more ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"Polityczna satyra z przedapokaliptycznego świata. Patrząc wstecz z tej "
