"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat, sourced from a mutant "
"humanoid.  It won't rot for a very long time, and can be used as an "
"ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "human tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered human fat.  It will remain "
"edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods "
"and projects."
msgstr ""
"Gładki biały blok oczyszczonego wytopionego tłuszczu ludzkiego. Pozostaje "
"jadalny przez bardzo długi czas i wykorzystany do wielu potraw i innych "
"celów."

#. ~ Description of "coconut oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
msgid ""
"Despite the name, coconut oil is solid at room temperature.  Smelling "
"vaguely tropical, it was popular as a natural, meat-free alternative to "
"products like shortening or lard."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "vegetable shortening"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fats.json
