#. ~ Description of "lung provence"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A French lung dish, made by poaching the lungs before pan-frying them with "
"onion, tomato, seasonings, and a generous amount of wine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "töttchen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A German peasant dish that converts many less-desirable meat cuts and organs "
"into a palatable meal with the liberal application of butter, sugar, and "
"wine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "liver & onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "A classic way to serve liver."
msgstr "Klasyczny sposób podania wątróbki."

#. ~ Description of "deviled kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A delicious way to prepare kidneys, originating from Victorian England.  You "
"had to make some substitutions in the devilling sauce, but it still came out "
"damn good."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leverpostej"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional Danish pate.  Probably better if you spread it on some bread."
msgstr ""
"Tradycyjne danie duńskie. Najlepiej smakuje rozsmarowany na kawałku chleba."

#. ~ Description of "humble pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Also known as 'Umble' pie, made with chopped organ meats.  Not half bad, and "
"full of vitamins!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scrambled eggs and brain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Brain and eggs, why didn't you ever think to put these together?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stuffed heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Chunks of heart filled with vegetables and spices."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "canned heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Chunks of heart preserved in a can."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fried brain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what you were expecting.  It's brain.  It's deep-fried.  Enjoy!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "canned liver"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Livers preserved in a can.  Chock-full of B vitamins!"
msgstr "Wątróbka zakonserwowana w puszce. Pełna witamin z grupy B."

#. ~ Description of "grilled sweetbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Not sweet like the name would suggest, but delicious all the same!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sausage casing"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sausage casings made from animal intestines.  Ready to be used for forming "
"meat products."
msgstr ""
"Osłonki na kiełbasę wykonane z jelit zwierzęcych. Gotowe do użycia do "
"formowania wyrobów mięsnych."

#. ~ Description of "artificial sausage casing"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sausage casings made from plastic bags.  Ready to be used for forming meat "
"products."
msgstr ""
"Osłonki na kiełbasę wykonane z worków foliowych. Gotowe do użycia do "
"formowania wyrobów mięsnych."

#. ~ Description of "deep-fried tripe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Some people don't enjoy the taste or texture of organ meat, so deep-frying "
"is a great way to disguise both."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stewed tripe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Stomach lining, cut up and stewed for an hour in broth.  Better than it "
"sounds."
msgstr ""
"Wyściółka żołądka, pocięta i gotowana w rosole przez godzinę. Smakuje lepiej "
"niż brzmi."

#. ~ Description of "fried heart"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Tasty deep-fried heart, retaining most of its texture and gaining that "
"delicious fried taste."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fried liver"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Tasty deep-fried liver, a Southern delicacy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "faux gras"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Though this meal is technically not foie gras, you have a feeling neither "
"the French nor animal rights groups are likely to criticize it now."
msgstr ""

