msgstr "Źdźbło tymianku. Pięknie pachnie."

#. ~ Description of "wild herbs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"A tasty collection of wild herbs including violet, sassafras, mint, clover, "
"purslane, and fireweed."
msgstr ""
"Smakowita kolekcja dziko rosnących ziół zawierająca fiołek, wawrzyn, miętę, "
"koniczynę i wierzbówkę."

#. ~ Description of "chili powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Chili P, yo!  Not edible on its own, but it could be used to make seasoning."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hot sauce"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Flamin' hot sauce.  It'd be a bad idea to drink it on its own.  You should "
"probably wash your hands after handling it, too."
msgstr ""

