msgid ""
"A jigsaw puzzle cardboard box containing 1000 cardboard pieces that when "
"connected together properly forms the otherworldly beautiful view of the "
"Northern Lights (Aurora Borealis) which occur most often in the Arctic "
"Circle and polar regions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Grand Canyon jigsaw puzzle" of item "Jigsaw puzzle"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
