#. ~ Description of "standing mirror"
#: data/json/items/furniture/decorative.json
msgid ""
"A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek aluminum frame.  Metal stand is "
"currently folded."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bar stool"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid ""
"A bar stool with a leather seat on a steel support.  Not practical for "
"sleeping at all but it does feel nicer than sitting on the ground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "log stool"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid ""
"A short section from a tree trunk with one of the flat ends smoothed down.  "
"Makes for a decent place to sit, but not quite a real chair."
msgstr ""
"Krótki fragment pnia drzewa z wygładzonym jednym z płaskich końców. Stanowi "
"przyzwoite miejsce do siedzenia, ale to nie do końca prawdziwe krzesło."

#. ~ Description of "plywood chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid ""
"A simple chair made of plywood on a steel frame.  Quite uncomfortable but "
"works for sleeping if it's the only option available."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden stool"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid ""
"A simple stool, with four legs and a seat.  While it's a touch more "
"maneuverable to sit on, the lack of back support means it's significantly "
"less comfortable than a normal chair."
msgstr ""
"Prosty stołek, z czterema nogami i siedziskiem. Jest nieco bardziej mobilny "
"przy siadaniu na nim, ale brak oparcia oznacza, że jest znacznie mniej "
"wygodny niż zwykłe krzesło."

#. ~ Description of "wooden chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to "
"rest your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat "
"a meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again."
msgstr ""
"Proste, drewniane krzesło, z czterema nogami, siedziskiem i oparciem. "
"Przyjemnie jest choć raz dać odpocząć nogom, a w połączeniu z odpowiednim "
"stołem, można zjeść porządnie posiłek i prawie udawać, że wszystko jest "
"znowu normalne."

#. ~ Description of "black wooden chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to "
"rest your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat "
"a meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again.  This "
"particular chair was painted black."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "white wooden chair"
#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to "
"rest your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat "
"a meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again.  This "
"particular chair was painted white."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "steel mesh"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A 6-inch square piece of finely-woven steel wire, useful for dryer lint "
"traps and reusable coffee filter baskets.  You could put this on a window to "
"keep mosquitoes and other bugs out if it was larger, but chain link fencing "
"will do these days."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "secured USB drive"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A USB thumb drive.  Useful for holding software.  This one seems like it "
"could get run over by a truck and be fine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "onyx"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A beautiful black onyx."
msgstr "Piękny czarny onyks."

#. ~ Description of "pile of dried seaweed"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big heap of dried seaweed.  It's tough, inedible, and possibly poisonous, "
"but it could be burned or used for crafts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Boston-Chan body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a blue-haired Boston-Chan, the "
"mascot of Boston AnimeCon, on both sides.  It's highly unlikely the "
"convention would officially endorse such a lewd depiction of her."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Boston-Chan body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a blue-haired Boston-Chan, the "
"mascot of Boston AnimeCon, on both sides.  This seems to be official merch, "
"and the art on both sides is quite tame."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "yandere body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a cute maid on the front and the "
"same maid - covered in blood and holding a knife - on the back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "femboy body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a feminine man on the front and his "
"scantily-clad version on the back.  It's captioned with 'FEMBOY SUPREMACY' "
"on both sides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "gun body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a fully-modded tacticool M4 SOPMOD "
"II on both sides.  The rifle firing a grenade somehow looks suggestive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "tomboy body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a masculine woman on the front and "
"her scantily-clad version on the back.  It's captioned with 'TOMBOY "
"SUPREMACY' on both sides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "VTuber body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a popular anime VTuber on the front "
"and their scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "vocaloid body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a popular blue-twintailed virtual "
"musician on the front and her scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "tsundere body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of a pouting anime character on the "
"front and their scantily-clad version on the back.  They don't actually like "
"you or anything, they swear!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "ship body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an aircraft carrier drawn on both "
"sides.  The one on the back is stripped of its armor plating, how naughty."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "goth body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an anime character dressed in all "
"black on the front and their scantily-clad version on the back.  They're "
"surrounded by red candles and laying atop a demonic pentagram."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "body pillow"
#. ~ Description of variant "anime body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an anime character on the front and "
"their scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "fox body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an anthropomorphic fox on the front "
"and a scantily-clad version on the back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "survivor body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow with an anime-style print of Bear Grillings, "
"Ultimate Survivor on both sides.  On one side he's holding a pneumatic air "
"rifle, and on the other he is clad in nothing but duct tape.  The pillow is "
"stylized to look like Kevlar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "makeshift body pillow" of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A big, body-sized pillow.  Someone drew a vaguely humanoid figure on it.  "
"Its heartwarming smile fills you with joy."
msgstr ""
"Duża poduszka długości i rozmiaru człowieka. Ktoś wyrysował na niej z "
"grubsza humanoidalny kształt. Jego radujący serce uśmiech wypełnia cię o "
"radością."

#. ~ Description of "dried seaweed"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A bit of dried seaweed.  It's tough, inedible, and possibly poisonous, but "
"it could be burned or used for crafts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough with koji"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A block of dried dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, "
"covered with koji mold.  Usable for making soy sauce."
msgstr ""
"Blok suszonego ciasta z gotowanej i utartej soi oraz mąki pszennej, pokryty "
"pleśnią koji. Nadaje się do wyrobu sosu sojowego."

#. ~ Description of "book binder"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A book binder.  With a pen and some paper you could copy some recipes from "
"books into it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pine bough"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A branch from a pine tree, oozing sticky sap and bristling with prickly "
"needles."
msgstr ""
"Gałąź z drzewa sosnowego, z której sączy się lepka żywica, i na której "
"połyskują kłujące igły."

#. ~ Description of "candlestick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A brass candlestick with a gold finish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken C-4 hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken C-4 hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on solid "
"ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty młynek C-4. O wiele mniej groźny teraz, gdy leży bez ruchu na ziemi. "
"Można wypruć z niego części."

#. ~ Description of "broken EMP hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken EMP hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on solid "
"ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty młynek EMP. O wiele mniej groźny teraz, gdy leży bez ruchu na ziemi. "
"Można wypruć z niego części."

#. ~ Description of "broken M202A1 TALON"
#. ~ Description of "broken launcher TALON UGV"
#. ~ Description of "broken rifle TALON UGV"
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/broken_bots.json
msgid ""
"A broken TALON UGV, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be "
"gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty UGV TALON, z rozbitą pokrywą i wyciekłym płynem. Można go "
"wypatroszyć na części."

#. ~ Description of "broken camspy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken camspy.  It probably won't spy on anything ever again.  Could be "
"gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuta kamera szpiegowska. Prawdopodobnie nie będzie już niczego "
"szpiegować. Można by ją wypatroszyć na części."

#. ~ Description of "broken flashbang hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken flashbang hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on "
"solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty młynek ogłuszający. O wiele mniej groźny teraz, gdy leży bez ruchu "
"na ziemi. Można wypruć z niego części."

#. ~ Description of "broken grenade hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken grenade hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on "
"solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty młynek-granat. O wiele mniej groźny teraz, gdy leży bez ruchu na "
"ziemi. Można wypruć z niego części."

#. ~ Description of "broken grocery bot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken grocery bot.  Its smiling face stares vacantly into empty space.  "
"Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken loudspeaker"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken loudspeaker.  It's so unusually quiet now….  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty głośnik. Niezwykle cichy dla odmiany… Może być wypatroszony na "
"części."

#. ~ Description of "broken manhack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken manhack.  Much less threatening now that it lies limp on solid "
"ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty młynek. O wiele mniej groźny teraz, gdy leży bez ruchu na ziemi. "
"Można wypruć z niego części."

#. ~ Description of "broken recon mech"
#. ~ Description of "broken mech lifter"
#. ~ Description of "broken combat mech"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A broken mech exoskeleton suit, it looks beyond repair."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken military dispatch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken military dispatch.  Though the scratched manhacks visible in its "
"belly are disarmed, their destructive potential still inspires a spark of "
"fear in you, even now.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken miner bot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken miner bot.  Much less threatening now that it's no longer capable "
"of drilling anything.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty bot górniczy. O wiele mniej groźny teraz, gdy nie jest w stanie "
"niczego przewiercić. Można wypruć z niego części."

#. ~ Description of "broken nurse bot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken nurse bot.  Its smooth face stares vacantly into empty space.  "
"Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken prototype robot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken prototype robot--well, more broken than before.  Could be gutted "
"for parts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken riot control turret"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken riot control turret.  Much less threatening now that it's laid limp "
"on solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuta wieżyczka kontroli tłumu. Znacznie mniej groźna teraz gdy leży "
"nieruchomo na ziemi. Można ją wybebeszyć w poszukiwaniu części."

#. ~ Description of "broken riot dispatch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken riot dispatch, with its mesh midsection filled with fried manhacks "
"and its motor limp and still.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty bot kontroli tłumu, ze środkową siatkową sekcją wypełnioną "
"usmażonymi młynkami, oraz wygaszonym milczącym silnikiem."

#. ~ Description of "broken skitterbot"
#. ~ Description of "broken exterminatron"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken robot.  Much less threatening now that it lies limp on solid "
"ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken secubot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken secubot, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be gutted "
"for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty bot ochrony, z rozbitą pokrywą i wyciekłym płynem. Można go "
"wypatroszyć na części."

#. ~ Description of "broken green maintenance security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken yellow maintenance security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken blue maintenance security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken green research security drone"
#. ~ Description of "broken black security drone"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken security drone, with its propellers still and camera inert.  Could "
"be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty dron bezpieczeństwa, z nieruchomymi śmigłami i niewładną kamerą. "
"Można go wypatroszyć na części."

#. ~ Description of "broken taser hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken taser hack, with its propellers still and taser inert.  Could be "
"gutted for parts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken tear gas hack"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken tear gas hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on "
"solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuty młynek z gazem łzawiącym. O wiele mniej groźny teraz, gdy leży bez "
"ruchu na ziemi. Można wypruć z niego części."

#. ~ Description of "broken turret"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken turret.  Much less threatening now that it's laid limp on solid "
"ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Zepsuta wieżyczka. Znacznie mniej groźna teraz gdy leży nieruchomo na ziemi. "
"Można ją wybebeszyć w poszukiwaniu części."

#. ~ Description of "spare tire carrier"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A bumper-mounted rig for attaching and storing a spare tire on the back of a "
"vehicle.  Combine it with a wheel to get a mountable piece."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift tree spile"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A carved piece of wood which is inserted in a tree crust in order to slowly "
"harvest its sap.  Can be used on a maple tree in between late winter and "
"early spring to harvest maple sap."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "processor board"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A central processor unit, useful in advanced electronics crafting."
msgstr ""
"Jednostka centralnego procesora, użyteczna w zaawansowanej elektronice."

#. ~ Description of "ceramic armor plate"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A ceramic armor plate, specifically engineered for use as armor.  Not "
"suitable for human use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic flower pot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A cheap plastic pot used for planting."
msgstr "Tania plastikowa doniczka używana do sadzenia."

#. ~ Description of "amplifier circuit"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A circuit designed to amplify the strength of a signal.  Useful in lots of "
"electronics recipes."
msgstr ""
"Obwód opracowany do wzmacniania siły sygnału. Użyteczny w wielu projektach "
"elektronicznych."

#. ~ Description of "transponder circuit"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A circuit designed to repeat a signal.  Useful for crafting communications "
"equipment."
msgstr ""
"Obwód opracowany do powtarzania sygnału. Użyteczny w wielu projektach "
"sprzętu komunikacyjnego."

#. ~ Description of "ballast organs"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A cluster of hydrostatic organs, each about the size of a baseball, "
"retrieved from inside a kraken mutant.  Some of them seem to be lighter than "
"air, and some seem to weigh as much as air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cluster of gas sacs"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A cluster of membranous bubbles, each about the size of a grape, retrieved "
"from inside a mutant insect.  They float like tiny helium balloons - perhaps "
"they are full of a lighter-than-air gas."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "adobe brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, baked dry enough to harden into "
"a brick."
msgstr ""
"Zagęszczona masa gleby i włókien naturalnych, upieczona na tyle, by "
"utwardzić się w cegłę."

#. ~ Description of "soft adobe brick"
#. ~ Description of "soft adobe brick (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, still too wet to build with.  "
"Load it onto a pallet and leave it to dry."
msgstr ""
"Zbita masa ziemi i naturalnych włókien, nadal zbyt mokra by z niej budować. "
"Załaduj na paletę i zostaw do wyschnięcia."

#. ~ Description of "delayed fuze"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A complex mechanical fuze.  It seems it can be used to detonate stable "
"explosives after a short time by triggering it."
msgstr ""
"Złożony mechaniczny zapalnik. Wydaje się, że może być użyty do detonacji "
"stabilnych materiałów wybuchowych w krótkim czasie po aktywacji."

#. ~ Description of "impact fuze"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A complex mechanical fuze.  It seems it can be used to detonate stable "
"explosives upon a solid impact."
msgstr ""
"Złożony mechaniczny zapalnik. Wydaje się, że może być użyty do detonacji "
"stabilnych materiałów wybuchowych po solidnym uderzeniu."

#. ~ Description of "condensor coil"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A compressor and fan that work together to cool down refrigerant."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "withered plant"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A dead plant.  Good for starting fires or making crude tailoring crafts."
msgstr ""
"Martwa roślina. Dobra się do rozpalania ognisk lub wykonywania prymitywnych "
"rzemiosł krawieckich."

#. ~ Description of "large damaged tent"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A family-sized tent, very bulky but with plenty of space.  This tent is "
"broken and cannot be deployed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fishbowl"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A filled fishbowl, the tag says 'to Ed' and the fish's name, 'Hoss'.  The "
"fish appears to have tiny antlers."
msgstr ""
"Napełnione kuliste akwarium. Na metce jest napisane „dla Eda” a imię rybki "
"„Hoss”. Rybka wydaje się mieć małe poroże."

#. ~ Description of "brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fire-hardened building block used in masonry construction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "petrified eye"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A fist-sized eyeball with a cross-shaped pupil.  It seems to be made of "
"stone, but doesn't look like it was carved."
msgstr ""
"Oko wielkości pięści, ze źrenicą w kształcie krzyża. Wygląda, że jest "
"zrobione z kamienia, ale nie wygląda na wyrzeźbione."

#. ~ Description of "large wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A flat case used to carry items such as currency, identification documents, "
"laminated cards, and other small items."
msgstr ""
"Płaski pojemnik używany do noszenia przedmiotów takich jak pieniądze, "
"dokumenty identyfikacyjne, karty laminowane i inne małe przedmioty."

#. ~ Description of "travel wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A flat case with a neck strap, used to carry items such as currency, "
"identification documents, laminated cards, and other small items."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mower blade"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A flat steel blade with openings for fasteners and one tapered edge on "
"either end.  It's meant to function as part of a machine and in its present "
"state would make an awkward weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lanyard"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A flat, clear plastic sleeve for identification documents, laminated cards, "
"and other small items.  It has a neck strap attached."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "down-filled pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fluffy pillow to rest your head on when sleeping."
msgstr "Puszysta poduszka pod głowę na czas snu."

#. ~ Description of "cottonwood tree boll"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A fluffy white seed.  While it looks like the common cotton, it is too weak "
"and short to be turned into clothing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lump of clay"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fresh piece of clay.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "Świeża bryła gliny. Przydatna w wytwarzaniu pewnych rzeczy."

#. ~ Description of "abstract plastic card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A generic plastic card item template with numbers based off a credit card."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gold chalice"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A gold chalice."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "armored training dummy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  "
"This one is covered in scrap armor and looks on guard.  You need to embed it "
"into the ground for training."
msgstr ""
"Ręcznie wykonana humanoidalna figura, przydatna do treningu walki w zwarciu. "
"Ta jest pokryta zbroją ze złomu i wygląda na chronioną. Do treningu należy "
"wbić ją w ziemię."

#. ~ Description of "training dummy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  "
"This one is made from wood and has some duct tape to mark the striking "
"points.  You need to embed it into the ground for training."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chamomile flowers"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A handful of white chamomile flowers, used as an herbal remedy since ancient "
"times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "spurge flowers"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A handful of yellow-green flowers.  Can be brewed into a tea that prevents "
"asthma attacks."
msgstr ""
"Garść żółto-zielonych kwiatów. Można z nich zaparzyć herbatę "
"przeciwdziałającą atakom astmy."

#. ~ Description of "heating element"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heating element, like the ones used in hotplates or kettles.  Consists of "
"nichrome wire surrounded by electrical insulator and placed inside a steel "
"casing."
msgstr ""
"Element grzewczy, typowy dla czajników i podgrzewaczy elektrycznych. Składa "
"się z chromonikielinowego drutu otoczonego izolatorem elektrycznym i "
"umieszczonym w stalowej obudowie."

#. ~ Description of "DARPA hard case"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and very durable protective case made of steel and thick plastic, "
"locked with a six-dial combination.  A sticker with the logo of DARPA is "
"attached to the front, but looking at the surface, you can see that another "
"marking - formerly stenciled into the material - was recently and hastily "
"destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "salt lick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy cube-shaped block of salt for livestock.  Don't lick it, it's gross."
msgstr ""
"Ciężki blok soli w kształcie sześcianu, dla trzody. Nie liż tego, to ohydne."

#. ~ Description of "manhole cover"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy iron disc that typically covers a ladder into the sewers.  Lifting "
"it from the manhole is impossible without a crowbar."
msgstr ""
"Ciężki żelazny dysk który zwyczajowo zakrywa właz do studzienki prowadzącej "
"do kanałów. Podniesienie go ze studzienki jest niemożliwe bez łomu."

#. ~ Description of "high-quality lens"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A high-quality glass lens, useful for focusing or diffusing light.  Might be "
"useful for starting a fire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tree spile"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hollow metal cylinder which is inserted in a tree crust in order to slowly "
"harvest its sap.  Can be used on a maple tree between late winter and early "
"spring to harvest maple sap."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bundle of cloth patches"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hundred cloth patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble "
"to unpack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bundle of felt"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hundred felt patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble "
"to unpack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "television"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large LCD television, full of delicious electronics."
msgstr "Duży ciekłokrystaliczny telewizor, pełen smakowitej elektroniki."

#. ~ Description of "large LCD screen"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large backlit screen, used for displaying images.  Useful in some "
"electronics recipes."
msgstr ""
"Duży podświetlany od tyłu ekran do wyświetlania obrazu. Użyteczny w "
"niektórych projektach elektronicznych."

#. ~ Description of "household water heater"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large metal tank with a water faucet attached to it, primarily used to "
"store and heat water."
msgstr ""
"Duży metalowy zbiornik z przymocowanym do niego kranikiem, służący głównie "
"do przechowywania i podgrzewania wody."

#. ~ Description of "family–sized household water heater"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large metal tank with a water faucet attached to it, primarily used to "
"store and heat water.  Large enough for a whole family."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scythe blade"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large, curved blade.  Could be used to assemble a scythe, or make an "
"improvised polearm."
msgstr ""
"Duże zakrzywione ostrze. Można go użyć by skonstruować kosę, lub "
"zaimprowizować broń drzewcową."

#. ~ Description of "spring"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy-duty spring.  Expands with significant force when compressed."
msgstr ""
"Duża sprężyna do znacznych obciążeń. Rozpręża się ze znaczną siłą gdy "
"ściśnięta."

#. ~ Description of "barbed wire"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of stiff wire, covered in sharp barbs."
msgstr "Kawałek sztywnego drutu pokrytego ostrymi kolcami."

#. ~ Description of "wire"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A length of thin, relatively stiff steel wire.  Like the sort you find in "
"chain link fences."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "piano wire"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A length of thin, relatively stretchy coiled steel wire.  Used to produce "
"musical notes in instruments."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small railroad track"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of track, made from some planks and rails."
msgstr "Odcinek linii kolejowej, z podkładów i szyn."

#. ~ Description of "lotus flower"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A lovely flower that grows on the surface of bodies of fresh water.  "
"Traditionally connected with many Eastern cultures."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chunk of biosilicified chitin"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A lump of exoskeleton that has undergone biosilicification.  It is acid-"
"resistant but rather brittle."
msgstr ""
"Płatek egzoszkieletu, który został poddany biokrzemionkowaniu. Jest on "
"odporny na działanie kwasów, ale dość kruchy."

#. ~ Description of "opal"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A lustrous opal."
msgstr "Połyskujący opal."

#. ~ Description of "pearl"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A lustrous pearl."
msgstr "Połyskująca perła."

#. ~ Description of "autoclave pouch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A medical device that bears the approval of the FDA (Food and Drug "
"Administration).  If used properly, this pouch can keep things sterile "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "drone memory bank"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A memory bank containing the information collected by the meteorologist "
"drone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "withered bouquet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A mixed collection of flowers.  Unfortunately, they have all withered with "
"time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "signal receiver"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A module designed to receive many forms of signals.  Useful for crafting "
"communications equipment."
msgstr ""
"Moduł opracowany do odbioru wielu form sygnałów. Użyteczny w wielu "
"projektach sprzętu komunikacyjnego."

#. ~ Description of "lawnmower"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A motorized pushmower that seems to be broken.  You could take it apart if "
"you had a wrench."
msgstr ""
"Ta zmotoryzowana kosiarka wygląda na popsutą. Można ją rozebrać na części, "
"gdyby tylko mieć klucz nastawny."

#. ~ Description of "clay flower pot"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A nice-looking clay pot used for planting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tinted glass lenses"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A pair of small, darkened glass lenses, like the ones used in sunglasses."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "loyalty card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A paper card with spaces marked for stamps or punches to be added upon "
"repeat visits to a business."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chunk of chitin"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A piece of a giant arthropod's exoskeleton.  It is light and very durable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "strand of endochitin"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A piece of chitin which was growing on the inside of a giant arthropod's "
"body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pile of straw"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A pile of dry grass.  Can be used to craft a straw bed if there is nothing "
"else to sleep on."
msgstr ""
"Snopek wysuszonej trawy. Przydatny do stworzenia siennika, jak nie ma "
"niczego innego na czym można by spać."

#. ~ Description of "pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A pillow to rest your head on when sleeping."
msgstr "Poduszka pod głowę na czas snu."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A pillowcase with straw and other dead plants as filling.  It's better than "
"nothing…"
msgstr ""
"Poszewka na poduszkę ze słomą i innymi uschniętymi roślinami służącymi za "
"wypełnienie. Lepsze to niż nic…"

#. ~ Description of "pilot light"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A pilot light from a gas-burning device, this particular one is a simple "
"piezoelectric igniter."
msgstr ""
"Zapalnik z urządzenia na gaz. Ten tutaj jest prostym zapalnikiem "
"piezoelektrycznym."

#. ~ Description of "power converter"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A power supply unit.  Useful in lots of electronics recipes."
msgstr ""
"Zasilacz do sprzętu elektronicznego. Użyteczny w wielu projektach "
"elektronicznych."

#. ~ Description of "crude heating element"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A primitive heating element made from thin coiled steel wire.  It will "
"degrade much quicker with use than normal heating elements, but it'll do for "
"some applications."
msgstr ""
"Prymitywny element grzewczy zrobiony z cienkiego zwiniętego stalowego drutu. "
"Zdegraduje się znacznie szybciej w trakcie używania niż normalny element "
"grzewczy, ale do niektórych celów się nada."

#. ~ Description of "circuit board"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A printed card that supports and electrically connects electronic components "
"on a non-conductive substrate."
msgstr ""
"Płyta drukowana, która jest podstawą i łącznikiem elektrycznym części "
"elektronicznych na nieprzewodzącym podkładzie."

#. ~ Description of "cannabis plant"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A psychoactive plant indigenous to Central Asia and the Indian subcontinent "
"traditionally cultivated for its fiber, oil, for medicinal purposes, and for "
"use as a recreational drug.  It requires further processing to be useful."
msgstr ""
"Psychoaktywna roślina pochodząca z Azji centralnej i subkontynentu "
"indyjskiego, tradycyjnie uprawiana dla włókien, oleju, i potrzeb medycznych, "
"a także jako rekreacyjny narkotyk. Wymaga dalszego przetworzenia by być "
"użyteczna."

#. ~ Description of "electronic scrap"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A random collection of resistors, capacitors, and diodes which have been "
"stripped from printed circuits."
msgstr ""
"Kolekcja różnych rezystorów, kondensatorów, i diod które zostały wymontowane "
"z płyt drukowanych."

#. ~ Description of "light bulb"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A rather outdated light bulb used in all sorts of lighting equipment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fire brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A reinforced brick designed to withstand intense heat."
msgstr "Wzmocniona cegła odporna na wysoką temperaturę."

#. ~ Description of "spiral stone"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A rock the size of your fist.  It is covered with intricate spirals; it is "
"impossible to tell whether they are carved, naturally formed, or some kind "
"of fossil."
msgstr ""
"Kamień wielkości pięści. Jest pokryty misternymi spiralami. Nie da się "
"stwierdzić czy zostały wyrzeźbione, uformowały się naturalnie, czy jest to "
"jakaś skamielina."

#. ~ Description of "rebar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A rod of rebar.  It's too thin, too floppy, and too heavy to be much use as "
"a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sassafras root"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A root taken from a sassafras tree.  Used in the production of certain sweet "
"beverages."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "LIXA research archive backup"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A secured USB thumb drive, containing a copy of the LIXA facility's research "
"archives."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "evaporator coil"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A set of long, snakelike tubes for evaporating refrigerant."
msgstr "Zestaw długich, wężowatych tub do odparowywania czynnika chłodniczego."

#. ~ Description of "willowbark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of bark taken from a willow tree.  Used in the production of aspirin."
msgstr "Płat kory z drzewa wierzby. Używana w produkcji aspiryny."

#. ~ Description of "paper"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sheet of paper.  It might be useful for starting a fire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tanbark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sheet of tannin-rich bark from a tree, useful for tanning leather"
msgstr "Płat bogatej w taninę kory drzewnej, użytecznej w garbowaniu skóry."

#. ~ Description of "birchbark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sheet of tough, water-resistant bark taken from a birch tree."
msgstr "Płat twardej wodoodpornej kory z drzewa brzozy."

#. ~ Description of "bimetal thermostat"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A simple thermostat controlled by thermal expansion of a bimetal strip."
msgstr "Prosty termostat sterowany termiczną ekspansją paska bimetalu."

#. ~ Description of "antenna"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A simple thin copper shaft.  Useful in lots of electronics recipes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic die"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A six-sided plastic die."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small LCD screen"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small backlit screen, used for displaying images.  Useful in some "
"electronics recipes."
msgstr ""
"Mały podświetlany od tyłu ekran do wyświetlania obrazu. Użyteczny w "
"niektórych projektach elektronicznych."

#. ~ Description of "desk fan"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small fan, used to propel air around a room."
msgstr "Mały wiatrak, powodujący ruch powietrza w pomieszczeniu."

#. ~ Description of "hand mirror"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small hand mirror."
msgstr "Małe ręczne lusterko."

#. ~ Description of "small lock and key"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small lock, with its key still inserted."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "clock"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small mechanical clock, it's stopped at 10:10."
msgstr "Mały mechaniczny zegar. Zatrzymał się O 10:10."

#. ~ Description of "annotated paper scrap"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small scrap of paper with two long character sequences scribbled on it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "refrigerant tank"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small tank containing some sort of refrigerant often used in devices such "
"as freezers.  Hermetically sealed to prevent evaporation - cannot be opened "
"without prior connection to a compatible valve."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "damaged tent"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small tent, just big enough to fit one person comfortably.  This tent is "
"broken and cannot be deployed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small, flat case used to carry items such as currency, identification "
"documents, and laminated cards."
msgstr ""
"Mały płaski pojemnik używany do noszenia przedmiotów takich jak pieniądze, "
"dokumenty identyfikacyjne i karty laminowane."

#. ~ Description of "small high-quality lens"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small, high-quality glass lens, useful for focusing or diffusing light.  "
"Might be useful for crafting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "twig"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small, slender branch.  Makes passable firewood but is not useful for much "
"else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "prototype I/O recorder"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small, transparent card that was attached to the prototype robot's CPU.  "
"It might contain the data the intercom spoke of."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "box archery target"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A soft target for archery, consisting of tightly-packed cloth stuffed into a "
