"A brightly colored beach volleyball.  It is slightly larger than a regular "
"white one."
msgstr "Kolorowa piłka do siatkówki plażowej. Nieco większa od standardowej."

#. ~ Description of "aim game target practice kit"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
