#. ~ Description of "Glock 22 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
msgid ""
"A .40 S&W variant of the popular Glock 17 pistol.  The standard-issue "
"firearm of the FBI and of countless other law enforcement agencies worldwide."
msgstr ""
"Wariant popularnego Glocka 17 na amunicję .40 S&W. Standardowa broń FBI i "
"wielu agencji bezpieczeństwa publicznego całego świata."

#. ~ Description of gun "Luty SMG"
#. ~ Description of "Luty SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
msgid ""
"A Luty pattern makeshift smoothbore SMG crudely constructed out of various "
"steel parts using advanced powered hand tools; likely one of the most "
"complex guns that is feasible to make outside of a machine shop, but still "
"very unreliable.  This one is chambered for .40 S&W cartridges and accepts "
"custom-made makeshift magazines."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "handmade revolver"
#. ~ Description of "handmade revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
msgid ""
"A homemade 6-shot revolver.  While it's not as good as the pre-Cataclysm "
"manufactured weapons, it's a decent piece of work, all things considered."
msgstr ""
"Domowej produkcji sześciostrzałowy rewolwer. Choć nie tak dobry jak broń "
"sprzed Kataklizmu, to biorąc pod uwagę okoliczności, to całkiem niezła "
"klamka."

#. ~ Description of gun "Beretta 90-two pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Beretta 90-two pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
msgid ""
"A more modern version of Beretta's popular 92 series of handguns, the 90-two "
"performs largely the same.  The main difference is a sleeker, almost "
"futuristic-looking design owed in large part to the polymer underbarrel rail "
"cover.  This one is chambered in .40 S&W."
msgstr ""

