"A large flamethrower with substantial gas reserves.  The steel frame, with "
"canvas accoutrements and aluminum cylinders, are all colored olive drab, "
"like so many other pieces of equipment from the Vietnam War era."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "DARPA flamethrower"
#. ~ Description of "DARPA flamethrower"
#: data/json/items/gun/flammable.json
msgid ""
"A modernized flamethrower, using alloy components and composite pressure "
"tanks.  Despite having been replaced by the M202 FLASH, due to the "
"questionable effectiveness of the flamethrower in modern combat, it appears "
"that someone, somewhere, needed a flamethrower for the modern age, as the "
"date code on many of the components is within the past five years.  While "
"this resembles the Vietnam War era M9-7, the wand ignition system has been "
"improved with a piezoelectric one, in addition to the material improvements "
"of the system overall."
msgstr ""

