#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis "
"of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring "
"STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly makes the most from the weapon's "
"bullpup design with a 20-inch barrel configuration, coaxing increased "
"terminal performance from fired rounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 MICRON assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 MICRON assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis "
"of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring "
"STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly renders the MDRX into a compact "
"CQB carbine, with an 11.5-inch barrel recessed into the weapon's bullpup "
"layout."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 standard-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 standard-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis "
"of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions, the assembly "
"requires STANAG magazines for feeding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .300BLK standard-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .300BLK standard-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis "
"of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .300 AAC Blackout munitions, the "
"assembly requires STANAG magazines for feeding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .308 standard-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .308 standard-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach, 16-inch barrel installable within the "
"chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Chambered for long-range .308 "
"Winchester munitions and requiring AR-10 magazines for feeding, the assembly "
"essentially retools the weapon into a designated marksman's rifle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .308 extended-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .308 extended-assembly"
