#. ~ Description of gun "atlatl"
#. ~ Description of "atlatl"
#: data/json/items/ranged/atlatl.json
msgid ""
"Although spear throwing contraptions were used throughout the entire world, "
"this design in particular hails from Mesoamericas.  It was especially "
"popular among Peruvian natives, despite the Nahuatl origin of the name.  It "
"is essentially a carved piece of wooden shaft with a hollowed space to place "
"the projectile of the same name.  It'll also do well as a melee weapon in a "
"pinch."
msgstr ""

