#. ~ Description of "sharp rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A baseball-sized rock with a somewhat sharp edge that also chips in a semi-"
"predictable way if struck.  With the right skills, you could give it a "
"better edge."
msgstr ""
"Kamień wielkości piłki baseballowej o nieco ostrej krawędzi, który przy "
"uderzeniu odpryskuje w częściowo przewidywalny sposób. Przy odpowiednich "
"umiejętnościach można nadać mu lepszą krawędź."

#. ~ Description of "antler"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A branching length of antler, dropped by or harvested from one of the local "
"ungulates terrorizing the region."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ceramic shard"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A broken ceramic shard.  It is relatively heavy for its size and has a "
"somewhat sharp edge, but it's too irregular to cut properly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thick rubber chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of thick, semi-rigid rubber, similar to what tires are made from."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "grenade launcher buttstock"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collapsible buttstock designed for the M320 grenade launcher.  When "
"combined with this stock, the M320 can be used as a standalone weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cannonball"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A four-pound cannonball.  With some gunpowder, wadding, and a fuse, it could "
"be prepared to load into a cannon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chunk of paraffin wax"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A large chunk of paraffin wax."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rubber tire strip"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A long, curled strip of thick, semi-rigid rubber cut from a tire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broom"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A long-handled broom.  Makes a terrible weapon unless you're chasing cats."
msgstr ""
"Miotła na długim stylisku. Słaba z niej broń, chyba że do poganiania kotów."

#. ~ Description of "fuse"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A piece of fuse, long enough to give you enough time to get away from most "
"explosions."
msgstr ""
"Kawałek lontu, długi na tyle, by dać ci wystarczająco dużo czasu, aby uciec "
"od większości eksplozji."

#. ~ Description of "triffid stinger"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A short wooden dart grown from a mutated plant."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "down mattress"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A single, or twin, sized down-filled mattress."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mattress"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A single, or twin, sized mattress."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bee stinger"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A six-inch stinger from a giant bee.  Makes a mediocre melee weapon."
msgstr ""
"Dziesięciocentymetrowe żądło z gigantycznej pszczoły. Mierna broń do walki "
"wręcz."

#. ~ Description of "wasp stinger"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A six-inch stinger from a giant wasp.  Makes a poor melee weapon."
msgstr ""
"Dziesięciocentymetrowe żądło z gigantycznej osy. Mierna broń do walki wręcz."

#. ~ Description of "antler piece"
