msgstr "Solidne metalowe grabie, niezbędne w okresie jesiennym."

#. ~ Description of "snow shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy metal shovel used for picking up snow and moving it somewhere "
"else.  It was useful before the cataclysm, but now it's useless."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sickle"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "An old-fashioned farming tool for cutting tall grass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scythe"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned farming tool used to cut tall grass.  Despite being a giant "
"blade on the end of a stick, it is incredibly awkward to use for anything "
