#. ~ Description of "atomic lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this device will "
"provide just enough light to read by for at least a decade.  Use it to close "
"the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "atomic lamp (covered)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
