"A handmade primitive percussion drum.  Looks to be in working condition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "harmonica with a holder"
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A harmonica with a holder, so that you can play it without a free hand."
msgstr ""
"Harmonijka z uchwytem dzięki któremu można na niej grać mając zajęte ręce."

#. ~ Description of "bone flute"
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
