"You are patient and know where to hit your opponent for best results.\n"
"\n"
"Effects lost if downed, stunned, or staggered.\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Perception but decreased by 25% of Dexterity, "
"bash damage increased by 75% of Perception but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff "Eskrima" in martial art "Eskrima Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are skilled at getting the most out of your weapons.  The term 'weapon' "
"might be very subjective.\n"
"\n"
"Effects lost if downed, stunned, or staggered.\n"
"+2 accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff "Fior Di Battaglia" in martial art "Stand Your Ground"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
