msgstr "Przyjmujesz praktyczną postawę bojową."

#. ~ Description of buff "Tiger Kung Fu" in martial art "Tiger Fury"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You attack with an endless barrage of strikes.  The more you hit, the "
"stronger you become.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +5% damage.\n"
