#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstable fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s's abdomen suddenly contracts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "Dziecko zmutowanego karalucha wielkości szczura."

#. ~ Description of monster "helpless dog"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near "
"it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in "
"its tail."
msgstr ""
"Ledwo żywy pies, dyszący w kałuży śluzu i krwi. Gdy się zbliżasz wydobywa z "
"siebie ciche skomlenie i widzisz jak ledwo ledwo porusza ogonem."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A black mutant spider the size of a housecat with a long legs and oversized "
"fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on the underside of its bulbous "
"abdomen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bloodbank mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A bloated abdomen the size of a dumpster floats like a balloon, aided but "
"surely not carried by a pair of furiously beating wings.  The flying "
"freakshow is still recognizable as a mosquito thanks to its spindly legs and "
"spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering "
"quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but "
"beware its venom."
msgstr ""
"Jaskrawa zmutowana stonoga wielkości małego psa, szybko smyrgająca w "
"poszyciu. Pewnie nie uzna cię za odpowiednią ofiarę, ale uważaj na jej jad."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A caterpillar undergoing a metamorphosis.  Considering the size of the "
"cocoon, you have a feeling the emerging adult will be massive as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cellar spider - also known as \"daddy long-legs\" - grown to distressing "
"size.  Its body is about the size of your head, with the long, spindly legs "
"raising it up to your knee.  It tries getting away from you with an "
"unnervingly fluid run."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge "
"ovipositor extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a "
"suitable home for her many, many children."
msgstr ""
"Kolorowa pasożytnicza osa wielkości psa, z ogromnym pokładełkiem wystającym "
"z odwłoka. Polatuje dokoła poszukując dobrego domu dla jej wielu, wielu "
"dzieci."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized queen ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A colossal red ant with a bulging, bloated thorax.  She moves slowly and "
"deliberately, tending to nearby eggs and continually laying more."
msgstr ""
"Kolosalna czerwona mrówka, z nabrzmiałym, opuchniętym odwłokiem. Porusza się "
"wolno i celowo, opiekując się pobliskimi jajami i stale składając kolejne."

#. ~ Description of monster "deathtrap spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark "
"brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to "
"see the light of day again."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowany pająk wielkości krowy, o mocnych, grubych nogach i bulwiastym "
"tułowiu, koloru ciemnobrązowego. Wszystko, co wciągnie do swojego "
"podziemnego legowiska, raczej nie ujrzy już światła dziennego."

#. ~ Description of monster "huge black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated black widow spider with a distinctive red hourglass "
"shape on its abdomen and fangs no doubt loaded with lethal venom."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "enormous web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in "
"color.  It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from "
"fleeing."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowany pająk trawiasty wielkości krowy, o długich, wrzecionowatych "
"nogach, koloru jasnoszarego. Porusza się ociężale, opierając się na swoich "
"pajęczynach, aby zapobiec ucieczce ofiar."

#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier acid ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized woolly brown ant, corrosive liquid seeping from her abdomen.  "
"Given the relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't doubt that "
"this one could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "enormous wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy mutant wolf spider.  Its mouthparts have noticeably "
"changed, and it moves much more slowly now with the additional weight it "
"needs to carry."
msgstr ""
"Włochaty, zmutowany wilczy pająk wielkości krowy. Jego aparaty gębowe "
"wyraźnie się zmieniły, a on sam porusza się teraz znacznie wolniej z "
"dodatkowym ciężarem, który musi dźwigać."

#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy red ant.  Bulging pincers extend from her jaws.  Given "
"the relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't doubt that this "
"one could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""
"Czerwona, owłosiona mrówka wielkości krowy. Z jej szczęk wysuwają się "
"wybrzuszone szczypce. Biorąc pod uwagę względną siłę mrówek w stosunku do "
"rozmiarów ich ciała, nie wątpisz, że ta jedna mogłaby rozjechać samochód lub "
"przebić się przez solidne ściany."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big "
"eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Ciemnobrązowy zmutowany pająk wielkości psa, z obrzmiałym tułowiem, dużymi "
"oczyma i przerośniętymi kłami."

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik midwife"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dermatik grown even larger, her wings and ovipositor chewed off by her "
"sisters.  She now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts "
"dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is "
"fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Dermatik, który urósł jeszcze większy, a jego pokładełko i skrzydła zostały "
"zjedzone przez siostry. Teraz stoi na straży gniazda, pilnując niefortunnych "
"nosicieli zaniesionych do gniazda i upewniając się, że nie padną zanim nie "
"wypełnią swej roli."

#. ~ Description of monster "large worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large mutated earthworm.  It possesses a fanged mouth and a "
"slender body as tall as a man.  It has no eyes, but seems keenly interested "
"in sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small "
"orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowana brązowa mrówka wielkości psa z opuchniętym odwłokiem z małym "
"otworem na końcu. Błyszczący płyn kapie stamtąd od czasu do czasu."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of inquisitive-"
"looking eyes.  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr ""
"Skakun wielkości psa z dużymi przednimi nogami i parą ciekawskich oczu. "
"Potrafi szybko skakać nawet na wysokość czubków drzew."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on "
"the underside of its bulbous abdomen.  A highly venomous nightmare come to "
"life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It "
"hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in "
"return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr ""
"Biały czerw wielkości psa, bez cech szczególnych nie licząc szczątkowego "
"aparatu gębowego. Wisi do góry nogami w swojej klatce, i zwraca słodko "
"pachnący fluid w zamian za skrawki wnętrzności którymi karmią go robotnice "
"poniżej."

#. ~ Description of monster "larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A fake monster.  If you're seeing this something went wrong."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike "
"mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Tłusty biały pędrak wielki jak wiewiórka, z parą dużych podobnych do szpadli "
"żuwaczek."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to "
"the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized "
"pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"Zaciekła jasnozielona ważka, nadal szybka jak błyskawica, pomimo rozmiaru "
"dziecka w wieku szkolnym. Jej głowa ma rozmiar piłki do koszykówki z czego "
"większość to złożone oczy mieniące się kolorami tęczy. Nogi z kolei - i tak "
"wyspecjalizowane do chwytania ofiar - kończą się zakrzywionymi szponami."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant maggot"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A fly larva the size of a rat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a "
"huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its "
"young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the underbrush."
msgstr ""
"Olbrzymia stonoga urosła jeszcze bardziej, a zadnie segmenty zawinęły się "
"chroniąc wielki stos jaj i potomstwa w różnym stadium rozwoju. Czasem jedno "
"z młodych spada zrzucone przez inne osobniki i znika w poszyciu."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant mutant mosquito with a spindly body, it flutters erratically to keep "
"its blood-swollen abdomen aloft.  Its face is dominated by a long, spear-"
"tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become "
"ensnared in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr ""
"Gigantyczny jasnoszary zmutowany pająk, który czeka na ofiary zaplątujące "
"się w rozłożyste sieci, które rozciąga pomiędzy drzewami."

#. ~ Description of monster "twitching spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A "
"translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its "
"chitin is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr ""
"Wielki zmutowany pająk leżący na plecach, którego nogi drgają bez przerwy. "
"Przezroczysty śluz zmieszany ze szlamem cieknie mu ze stawów, a chitynową "
"skorupę znaczy kilka ran wylotowych."

#. ~ Description of monster "skittering plague"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, sickly-looking cockroach that appears to be using the undead as its "
"primary food source.  If it's anything like the bugs from before the "
"Cataclysm, it's probably not a picky eater."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep "
"underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr ""
"Gigantyczny ciemnobrązowy pająk z okrągłym odwłokiem. Wykopuje głębokie jamy "
"ziemne które służą jako wilcze doły do chwytania nieuważnych ofiar."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant praying mantis"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic insect half-again the size of a man.  Its scythelike arms are "
"covered in sawlike barbs and its complex mouthparts are always in motion, "
"even when the rest of it remains deathly still.  The light reflects eerily "
"off of its enormous eyes, so that no matter where you are, it appears to be "
"looking directly at you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "cave worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic mutated worm.  It has a round, gaping mouth lined with dagger-"
"like teeth, and its flesh is slick with bubbling blue slime."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the "
"next generation.  Her abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends "
"in a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr ""
"Gigantyczna osa robotnica przeczesująca teren w poszukiwana łatwego "
"pożywienia dla nowego potomstwa. Odwłok błyska złowieszczymi żółtymi pasami "
"i kończy się na wpół ukrytym żądłem rozmiaru kuchennego noża."

#. ~ Description of monster "grasshopper nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A grasshopper nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant aphid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A green aphid about the size of a rabbit.  It is constantly searching for "
"plants to suck from."
msgstr ""
"Zielona mszyca o wielkości królika. Nieustannie poszukuje roślin, do których "
"może się przyssać."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge brown spider in constant movement, with a small body the size of a "
"child held up at chest level by a set of spindly legs that branch into three-"
"pronged graspers at the end.  Unlike the smaller variant it obviously "
"decided hunting you is worth a try, and follows you with mandibles "
"chittering in anticipation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cicada"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge cicada the size of a person.  These insects are mostly harmless but "
"may bite if attacked and produce a loud buzzing sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant grasshopper"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge green grasshopper about the size of a big dog, with long and strong "
"back legs.  It hops, it hops and never stops."
msgstr ""
"Ogromny zielony konik polny wielkości dużego psa, z długimi i silnymi "
"tylnymi nogami. Skacze, skacze i nigdy się nie zatrzymuje."

#. ~ Description of monster "armored centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of "
"metallic gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living "
"animal.  Its mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialized to hunt "
"prey at least as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if "
"you'd fare better."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her jet-"
"black carapace and a threatening stinger.  She flies around erratically, "
"searching for smaller prey."
msgstr ""
"Ogromna osa rozmiaru dużego kota z jasnymi żółtymi pasami na kruczoczarnym "
"tułowiu wyposażona w groźne żądło. Lata to tu, to tam w poszukiwaniu "
"mniejszych ofiar."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized acidic soldier ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A human-sized ant covered in bristly brown chitin.  A corrosive liquid seeps "
"from the end of her bloated abdomen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "cellar spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile cellar spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile centipede.  Despite its young age it is still quite large and you "
"reckon these mandibles could pack quite a bite."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "web spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant grass spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too young "
"to be venomous, or to walk proficiently for that matter"
msgstr ""
"Niedojrzały gigantyczny pająk sieciarz wielkości butelki piwa. Zbyt młody, "
"by być jadowity lub też sprawnie chodzić, jeżeli już o tym mowa."

#. ~ Description of monster "jumping spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile jumping spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "trapdoor spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile trapdoor spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "wolf spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A juvenile wolf spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "lady bug larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A large armored larva looking not unlike a centipede.  Even though it's just "
"a juvenile the armor on its back already looks functional."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized grasshopper"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A large grasshopper a few times bigger than a regular one."
msgstr "Duży konik polny, kilka razy większy od zwykłego."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A large mosquito larva.  A bit more unsettling now that it isn't microscopic."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized web spinning spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Jasnobrązowy zmutowany pająk wielkości psa, z długimi nogami, dużymi oczyma "
"i przerośniętymi kłami."

#. ~ Description of monster "locust nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A locust the size of a rabbit.  You'd hate to think what a swarm of these "
"could do."
msgstr ""
"Szarańcza wielkości królika. Wzdrygasz się na myśl co rój takich owadów "
"mógłby zrobić."

#. ~ Description of monster "lunar moth"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A majestic moth painted in pale colors.  This giant of the night only comes "
"out after the moon is out, leaving glittering dust."
msgstr ""
"Majestatyczna ćma w bladych kolorach. Ten gigant nocy wychodzi tylko wtedy, "
"gdy księżyc jest na niebie, zostawiając błyszczący pył."

#. ~ Description of monster "praying mantis nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mantis nymph about the size of a dog.  Even though its far smaller than "
"the adults, you have a feeling it wouldn't take kindly to you coming too "
"close."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice "
"at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Potworna brązowa mrówka z opuchniętym odwłokiem z małym otworem na końcu. "
"Błyszczący płyn kapie stamtąd od czasu do czasu."

#. ~ Description of monster "graboid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous worm with a mouth full of bladed tongues.  It keeps most of its "
"enormous body hidden underground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Zmutowana pszczoła wielkości małego psa."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a dog.  This size advantage is apparently all "
"it needs to start regarding humans as food!"
msgstr ""
"Zmutowany karaluch wielkości psa. Ta przewaga wielkości jest najwyraźniej "
"wszystkim, czego potrzebuje, aby zacząć traktować ludzi jak pożywienie!"

#. ~ Description of monster "pregnant giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen "
"with eggs."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowany karaluch wielkości małego psa. Jego brzuch jest mocno opuchnięty z "
"jajami."

#. ~ Description of monster "frigate fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly nearly the size of a man, creating a loud buzzing sound as "
"it inexplicably stays airborne."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a cat.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and "
"somehow sad."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a housecat, buzzing and fluttering erratically."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant red and black ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  "
"It smells faintly of gasoline, and in place of a stinger, a tiny flame "
"adorns its abdomen like a pilot light."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant red ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  She "
"possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Olbrzymia czerwona mrówka rozmiaru psa pokryta chitynowymi płytami. Posiada "
"parę ruchliwych anten i krwiożerczych żuwaczek."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant spider the size of a small dog with long forelegs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowany pająk wielkości małego psa, z dużymi przednimi nogami, dużymi "
"oczyma i przerośniętymi kłami."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated butterfly larger than a human.  Despite its size it is very "
"lightweight and feeds mainly on the nectar produced by triffid flowers."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowany motyl większy od człowieka. Mimo swoich rozmiarów jest bardzo "
"lekki i żywi się głównie nektarem wytwarzanym przez kwiaty tryfidów."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized firefly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing "
"abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It "
"looks strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowany świetlik rozmiaru domowego kota, którego świecący jasno odwłok "
"podskakuje w górę i w dół gdy chce zaimponować niewidocznej partnerce. Jest "
"dziwnie obojętny na twoją obecność i na wszystko inne."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated moth larger than a human.  It silently flies with its huge wings "
"after dusk looking for nocturnal flowers to feed upon."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowana ćma, większa od człowieka. Po zmierzchu bezszelestnie lata ze "
"swoimi ogromnymi skrzydłami w poszukiwaniu nocnych kwiatów, którymi może się "
"żywić."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white "
"egg in each empty cell she comes across while scurrying around on the paper "
"walls of her home.  She struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer "
"cells seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr ""
"Zmutowana królowa os, która urosła do rozmiaru człowieka, znosząca "
"pojedyncze jajo w każdym segmencie ula, przy którym przechodzi, wspinając "
"się po jego papierowych ścianach. Z trudem mieści się w niektórych z nich, "
"ale nowe segmenty wydają się coraz większe…"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around the nest.  While her foraging sisters "
"are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to attack "
"anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr ""
"Zmutowana robotnica osy, bzycząca wokół ich gniada. Podczas gdy jej siostry-"
"zbieracze są relatywnie zdecydowane zostawić cię w spokoju, to ta nie zawaha "
"się zaatakować czegokolwiek co uzna za zagrożenie dla gniazda. Nie zasiedź "
"się w pobliżu."

#. ~ Description of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, "
"terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and "
"flee."
msgstr ""
"Sparaliżowana wychudzona sarna. Drży gdy cię spostrzega, a jej rozbiegane "
"oczy wodzą wokoło błotnistej komnaty gdy nie jest w stanie się podnieść i "
"uciec."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly naiad"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and "
"feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its "
"sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into "
"something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr ""
"Drapieżna wodna larwa ważki, normalnie nie dłuższa niż centymetr i żywiąca "
"się narybkiem, rozrosła się do rozmiaru suma. Pod jej ostrymi szczękami "
"widzisz, że składana dolna żuchwa zmieniła się w rodzaj kolczastej włóczni."

#. ~ Description of monster "ant larva"
#. ~ Description of monster "fire ant larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A pulsating sausage of glistening white flesh, the size of a large cat.  On "
"one end is a set of squirming mouth parts."
msgstr ""
"Pulsująca kiełbasa z lśniącego białego mięsa, wielkości dużego kota. Na "
"jednym końcu znajdują się wijące elementy paszczy."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A red and black ant the size of a deer.  It reeks of petroleum, and little "
"tongues of fire occasionally gout from its abdomen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A shaggy brown mutant spider with eight long legs.  Though it stands only "
"knee-high to a grown man it moves quickly, and its big black eyes seem ever-"
"alert."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "plague nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking mutant cockroach about the size of a rat, raised from birth "
"on a diet of zombie flesh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant water scorpion"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A slender relative of the water bug, grown close to human size.  It uses its "
"long tail as a snorkel while ambushing prey."
msgstr ""
"Smukły krewny chrząszcza wodnego, który urósł do rozmiarów człowieka. Używa "
"swojego długiego ogona jako rurki do nurkowania podczas zasadzania się na "
"ofiarę."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A slimy earthworm the size of an anaconda, with misshapen fangs jutting from "
"its otherwise featureless face."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "Mała stonoga strząsa się podczas walki!"

#. ~ Description of monster "mutant mantis"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A spindly insect a bit taller than a man.  Its front legs remain folded in "
"front of its body in a posture reminiscent of prayer, but the jagged hooks "
"lining their grasping edge leave little doubt as to their purpose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "half worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded giant worm."
msgstr "Pełzająca zygzakiem odcięta część zranionego gigantycznego robaka."

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic ant larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A squirming yellow grub that seems to be oozing liquid from both ends of its "
"body.  It appears its chitin hasn't developed enough to resist acid."
msgstr ""
"Wierzgająca żółty pędrak który sączy płyn z obu końców ciała. Wygląda na to, "
"że jego chityna nie stwardniała wystarczająco, by chronić przed kwasem."

#. ~ Description of monster "monstrous cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A tangle of branching chitinous legs operating seemingly independently, "
"somehow still managing to carry a cow-sized central body.  A number of "
"malformed, twitching legs hang from the cephalothorax, but the head -and "
"especially the mandibles- still seem to be in working order."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, "
"incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr ""
"Olbrzymia mucha domowa wielkości psa, oczywiście z nieodłącznie "
"towarzyszącym bezustannym głośnym bzyczeniem."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles "
"and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of "
"spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly "
"orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr ""
"Dwumetrowa stonoga z groźnymi szczękami, z których kapie jad, jak i zestawem "
"chwytnych odnóży, przemieszczająca się zwinnie na tuzinie patykowatych nóg. "
"Ma parę złożonych oczu, ale głównie orientuje się w terenie wykorzystując "
"czułki."

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp pupa"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It "
"looks like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its "
"legs and wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr ""
"Larwa osy w trakcie metamorfozy w dorosłego osobnika wielkiej osy. Wygląda "
"jak dziwnie nieruchomy dorosły okaz okryty cienką białą membraną, z nogami i "
"skrzydłami ciasno upakowanymi w segmencie."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around her home.  While "
"her foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, this one "
"won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't "
"linger."
msgstr ""
"Robotnica osy, wielkości człowieka. Podczas gdy jej siostry-zbieracze są "
"relatywnie zdecydowane żyć i dać żyć innym, to ta nie zawaha się zaatakować "
"czegokolwiek co uzna za zagrożenie dla gniazda. Nie zasiedź się w pobliżu."

#. ~ Description of monster "water strider nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A water strider nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "mole cricket nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A whitish mole cricket nymph the size of a dog."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wolf spider mutated to the size of an actual wolf, it moves quickly and "
"aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant woodlouse"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A woodlouse grown to the size of a dog.  These humble crustaceans are "
"harmless and enjoy damp places."
msgstr ""
"Stonoga, która urosła do rozmiarów dużego psa. Te skromne skorupiaki są "
"nieszkodliwe i lubią wilgotne miejsca."

#. ~ Description of monster "earthworm larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A wriggling earthworm the size of a housecat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant locust"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a dog with big eyes and long, "
"powerful legs and wings that never seem to stop twitching.  It seems intent "
"on finding food above all else - any food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized locust"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a small dog, with big eyes and "
"long, powerful legs."
msgstr ""
"Brązowożółta zmutowana szarańcza rozmiaru małego psa z wielkimi oczyma i "
"długimi silnymi odnóżami."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over her "
"daughters.  Even with her abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused "
"she still poses a threat to interlopers, should her children have failed at "
"subduing them."
msgstr ""
"Królowa os, która urosła do rozmiaru konia, górując nad swoimi dziećmi. Mimo "
"opuchniętego od jaj odwłoka i dawno nieużywanych skrzydeł nadal stanowi "
"zagrożenie dla intruzów, o ile jej dzieci się z nimi nie rozprawią."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An aggressive mutant cockroach the size of a small dog."
msgstr ""
"Agresywny zmutowany karaluch wielkości małego psa. Ktoś powiedział, że "
"karaluchy przetrwają każdą apokalipsę, no i proszę!"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic queen ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous brown ant with an elongated, pulsating abdomen.  Her orifice "
"seems developed only for egg-laying rather than spraying acid like the rest "
"of the colony, but she doesn't seem affected by the acrid liquid either."
msgstr ""
"Olbrzymia brązowa mrówka z wydłużonym pulsującym odwłokiem. Jego otwór "
"rozwiną się tylko do znoszenia jaj, a nie do pryskania kwasem jak u reszty "
"kolonii, ale wydaje się być równie odporna na drażniący płyn."

#. ~ Description of monster "emperor butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous butterfly with regal looking wings.  This giant of the sky flies "
"cheerfully under the sun, leaving dust as it passes."
msgstr ""
"Ogromny motyl z królewsko wyglądającymi skrzydłami. Ten gigant na niebie "
"leci wesoło pod słońce, pozostawiając po sobie pył."

#. ~ Description of monster "missile spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous hairy mutated spider the size of a cow, with strong forelegs and "
"a raised, bloated thorax.  Its vast increase in size has caused it to lose "
"much of its mobility, and when near it you can smell rotten eggs for some "
"reason…"
msgstr ""
"Ogromny, włochaty, zmutowany pająk wielkości krowy, z silnymi przednimi "
"kończynami i uniesionym, rozdętym tułowiem. Ogromny wzrost rozmiarów "
"spowodował, że stracił wiele możliwości poruszania się, a w jego pobliżu z "
"jakiegoś powodu czuć zapach zgniłych jaj…"

#. ~ Description of monster "alpha bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger "
"spelling doom."
msgstr ""
"Olbrzymia zmutowana pszczoła z czarno białym wzorem i długim żądłem, które "
"może przypieczętować twój los."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of "
"wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Olbrzymia czerwona mrówa pokryta chitynowymi płytami. Posiada parę "
"ruchliwych anten i krwiożerczych żuwaczek."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mole cricket"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous underground bug.  Beware its ear-splitting screech and strong "
"shovel-like front legs."
msgstr ""
"Ogromny podziemny robal. Strzeż się rozdzierającego uszy pisku i silnych "
"przednich nóg przypominających łopaty."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized soldier ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An overgrown red ant the size of a deer.  Bulging pincers extend from her "
"jaws."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An oversized butterfly with vibrant colored markings.  Unlike the other big "
"insects of the Cataclysm this is a very peaceful nectivore."
msgstr ""
"Przerośnięty motyl z żywymi kolorowymi oznaczeniami. W przeciwieństwie do "
"innych dużych owadów z Kataklizmu, ten jest bardzo spokojnym zjadaczem "
"nektaru."

#. ~ Description of monster "firefly larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An oversized larva of a firefly.  Shockingly large when compared to the "
"adults of its kind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An oversized moth with its typical wood-like motifs.  It is as peaceful as "
"the mutated butterflies found during the day."
msgstr ""
"Przerośnięta ćma z typowymi dla niej motywami drewnopodobnymi. Jest równie "
"spokojna jak zmutowane motyle występujące w ciągu dnia."

#. ~ Description of monster "unstable fire ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"Something has gone more wrong than usual with this poor creature.  Its soft "
"is swollen to the size of a bean bag chair and occasionally leaks globs of "
"flaming liquid.  It struggles to drag its bulk around, compound eyes and "
"waving antennae communicating none of the pain it surely feels."
msgstr ""

