#. ~ Description of mutation "Fruiting"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A few odd-looking fruits ripen on stems growing out of your head.  They'll "
"probably die off come winter, but you could activate this mutation to pick "
"them before then, if you wanted."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Down"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A fluffy undercoat of downy feathers keeps you extra warm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Wings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A large pair of translucent wings grow from your back.  They are too small "
"to lift you, but if you're not weighed down, they can help a bit if you "
"fall.  You can flutter them quickly to improve your move speed, but this is "
"noisy and tires you out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tentacles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A long pair of tentacles like those of a squid grow from your shoulders in "
"place of human arms.  The underside of the paddle-shaped tips are lined with "
"suckers that aid in grasping tools and prey alike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Electroreceptors"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A network of jelly-filled electroreceptors, like that of a shark, have grown "
"throughout your face and nose.  They are very sensitive to magnetic fields, "
"allowing you to see robots and creatures charged with electricity through "
"walls, but being shocked will seriously mess you up."
msgstr ""
"Sieć wypełniona żelem elektroreceptorów, takich jak u rekinów, wyrosło ci "
"wzdłuż twarzy i nosa. Są bardzo wrażliwe na pola magnetyczne, pozwalając ci "
"widzieć roboty i naelektryzowane stworzenia przez ściany, ale porażenie "
"prądem poważnie cię przetrzepie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers (Fresh)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A pair of short, nubby antlers, still covered in velvet, are growing from "
"your skull."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Batrachian"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A perfect ambush predator, if only there were less competition."
msgstr "Idealny drapieżnik z zasadzki, gdyby tylko było mniej konkurencji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reflex Photophore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A photophore has grown from your head.  You can't consciously control it, "
"and it might start to shine in response to your emotions or your "
"physiological state."
msgstr ""
"Fotofory wyrosły z twojej głowy. Nie możesz tego świadomie kontrolować i "
"może zacząć świecić w odpowiedzi na twoje emocje lub stan fizjologiczny."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Photophore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A photophore has grown from your head; you can make it glow softly.  This "
"will make you very visible in the dark, ideal for attracting a partner "
"during mating season."
msgstr ""
"Fotofory wyrosły z twojej głowy; możesz sprawić, że będą delikatnie świecić. "
"Dzięki temu będziesz bardzo widoczny w ciemności, idealny do zwabienia "
"partnera w okresie godowym."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mandibles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of insect-like mandibles have grown around your mouth.  They allow you "
"to eat faster and provide a slicing unarmed attack.  Slightly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Wokół ust wyrosły ci owadopodobne żuchwy. Umożliwiają one szybsze jedzenie i "
"zapewniają atak bez broni w postaci cięć. Nieznacznie zmniejsza efekty "
"przemoczenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mouth Tentacles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of tentacles surrounds your mouth.  They allow you to eat twice as "
"fast.  Slightly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw macek otacza twoje usta. Pozwalają ci jeść dwa razy szybciej. "
"Nieznacznie obniżają kary za bycie mokrym."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleek Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of very flexible and slick scales has grown to cover your toughened "
"skin.  These act as decent natural armor, improve your ability to swim, and "
"make you difficult to grab.  Mostly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Able Sleeper"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Acid Blood"
msgstr "Kwasowa krew"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Acidic Secretion"
msgstr "Wydzielanie kwasu"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Acidproof"
msgstr "Kwasoodporność"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Active Duty"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Addiction Resistant"
msgstr "Odporność na uzależnienie"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Addictive Personality"
msgstr "Uzależniająca osobowość"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prototype"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "After all those experiments, what's a few more, hmm?"
msgstr "Po tych wszystkich eksperymentach, czym jest jeszcze kilka?"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Albino"
msgstr "Albinos"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Alcohol Metabolism"
msgstr "Metabolizm alkoholu"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lightweight"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Alcohol and drugs go straight to your head.  You suffer the negative effects "
"of these for longer."
msgstr ""
"Alkohol i narkotyki uderzają wprost do głowy. Odczuwasz ich negatywne efekty "
"przez dłuższy czas."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"All the hair on your body has turned to long, grass-like leaves.  Apart from "
"being physically striking, these provide you with a minor amount of "
"nutrients while in sunlight when your head is uncovered.  Slightly reduces "
"wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Włosy na twoim ciele zmieniły się w długie trawiaste liście. Oprócz tego że "
"są wizualnie uderzające, zapewniają także niewielkie odżywianie w słońcu gdy "
"twoja głowa jest odsłoniona. nieznacznie redukują efekty przemoczenia."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Alpha Purity"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Masochist"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Although you still suffer the negative effects of pain, it also brings a "
"unique pleasure to you."
msgstr ""
"Mimo że nadal odczuwasz negatywne efekty bólu, to przynosi on też niezwykłą "
"przyjemność."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Amorphous Body"
msgstr "Amorficzne ciało"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Amphibian Pheromones"
msgstr "Płazie feromony"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Amphibious"
msgstr "Ziemnowodny"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Arthropod Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"An extra pair of decidedly buggy arms have grown from your torso.  They "
"flail more or less uncontrollably, making you feel rather larval."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Arms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"An extra pair of decidedly buggy arms have grown from your torso.  Though "
"they're too thin to block or punch, you can fold them inside human-shaped "
"gear if need be."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Violent Monster"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Anger clouds your mind; you can't think straight, but you feel strong."
msgstr ""
"Gniew zaciemnia twój umysł; nie możesz myśleć trzeźwo, ale czujesz się silny."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Animal Discord"
msgstr "Waśń ze zwierzętami"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Animal Ears"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Animal Empathy"
msgstr "Zwierzęca empatia"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Animal Kinship"
msgstr "Więź ze zwierzętami"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Antennae"
msgstr "Czułki"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Antlers"
msgstr "Poroże"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Antlers (Fresh)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Antlers (Shed)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Antsy"
msgstr "Ruchliwość"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Apex Predator"
msgstr "Szczytowy drapieżnik"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Aqueous Repose"
msgstr "Wodne wytchnienie"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Barbed Tentacles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Arms?  No, you've got a pair of long tentacles with broad paddle-shaped "
"structures at the tips, granting the ability to strike while prone at a "
"reduced penalty.  Their grasping surface is lined with suckers and dozens of "
"swiveling hooks that function like vicious claws."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Arthropod Limbs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Violent Monster"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "As the morning comes, you return back to normal."
msgstr "Gdy nadchodzi poranek, wracasz do normalności."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Assault Barbs"
msgstr "Szturmowe kolce"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Assign Random Mission"
