#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We are the Mycus."
msgstr "Jesteśmy Grzybnią."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Flesh"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have begun adapting local physiology to Mycus physical structure, greatly "
"reducing wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Zaadaptowaliśmy lokalną fizjologię do fizycznej struktury Grzybni, znacznie "
"redukując efekty przemoczenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Blossoms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have developed local blossoms.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "Wyrosły nam lokalne kwiaty. Grzybnia musi rosnąć."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Spores"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have developed local spore sacs.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "Wyrosły nam torebki zarodnikowe. Grzybnia musi rosnąć."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Fireproofing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have spliced the dense, amphibole fibers from Mycus core towers with the "
"resilient, adaptive flesh of local physiology.  This reduces our speed by a "
"moderate amount, but provides powerful armor across our body, nullifies wet "
"effects, and provides complete protection from fire."
msgstr ""
"Połączyliśmy gęste, amfibolowe włókna z głównych wież Gryzbni ze sprężystym, "
"adaptacyjnym ciałem lokalnej fizjologii. Zmniejsza to naszą prędkość o "
"umiarkowaną ilość, ale zapewnia potężny pancerz na całym ciele, anuluje "
"efekty przemoczenia i zapewnia całkowitą ochronę przed ogniem."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Feeder"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have streamlined our nutritional requirements.  We rely on the Mycus for "
"sustenance, as it relies on us.  We may locate sources of sustenance in "
"close proximity to Mycus core towers, and in forested areas that the Mycus "
"has grown into."
msgstr ""
"Poprawiliśmy nasze zapotrzebowanie na składniki odżywcze. Opieramy się na "
"Grzybni dla wyżywienia, tak jak ona opiera się na nas. Możemy zlokalizować "
"źródła utrzymania w bliskiej odległości od głównych wież Grzybni, a także w "
"obszarach leśnych, w których rozwinęła się Grzybnia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycus Identity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have synchronized our local physiology with that of the Mycus.  Any "
"spores we may encounter will not attempt to germinate inside the local "
"system, and we may traverse Mycus biospheres easily, as native bioforms "
"shift shape to accommodate us."
msgstr ""
"Zsynchronizowaliśmy naszą lokalną fizjologię z tą z Grzybni. Zarodniki które "
"napotkamy nie będą próbować namnażać się wewnątrz lokalnego systemu i możemy "
"przemierzać biosfery Grzybni z łatwością, ponieważ rodzime bioformy "
"zmieniają kształt by nas pomieścić. "

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Photophore"
msgstr "Słabe fotofory"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Photophore (on)"
msgstr "Słabe fotofory (wł.)"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Scent"
msgstr "Słaby zapach"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Stomach"
msgstr "Słaby żołądek"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakening"
msgstr "Osłabienie"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Diver"
msgstr "Nurek sieci"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Spinner"
msgstr "Przędzarz sieci"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Walker"
msgstr "Kroczący w sieciach"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Weaver"
msgstr "Sieciarz"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Webbed Feet"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Webbed Hands"
msgstr "Błona pławna"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dungeon Master"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Weeks spent picking through manuals and researching topics you aren't versed "
"in has taught you to find what you need to know more quickly.  You read "
"slightly faster, and suffer no reading time penalty for books too complex "
"for you to easily understand."
msgstr ""
"Tygodnie spędzone na przeglądaniu podręczników i badaniu tematów na których "
"się nie znasz nauczyły cię szybszego znajdywania tego, czego potrzebujesz. "
"Czytasz nieco szybciej i nie ponosisz kary za czytanie książek zbyt "
"skompilowanych dla ciebie, by je zrozumieć."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weight: XS"
msgstr "Waga: XS"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weight: XXXL"
msgstr "Waga: XXXL"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Aranean"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Well, maybe you'll just have to make your own worldwide web."
msgstr "Cóż, może czas upleść sieć wielką jak kiedyś sieć internetowa."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Plant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Well, you still have those other walking flowers--and the mushrooms, too--to "
"deal with.  But you'll manage."
msgstr ""
"Cóż, nadal masz te inne chodzące kwiaty - i grzyby też - z którymi musisz "
"sobie poradzić. Ale dasz radę."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"What was that old advertisement?  'Paint the planet'?  That might be a good "
"long-term goal, but for now…"
msgstr ""
"Jak to szło w tej starej reklamie, „pomaluj planetę”? To może być niezły "
"plan długoterminowy, ale na razie…"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sapiovore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"What's left of humanity is merely prey.  If they can't outrun you, there's "
"no sense feeling bad about eating them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Irreparable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whatever caused the end of the world affected you in a horrible way.  Your "
"wounds will never heal on their own and your broken limbs will never mend."
msgstr ""
"Cokolwiek spowodowało koniec świata, dotknęło cię w straszny sposób. Twoje "
"rany nigdy nie zagoją się same, a złamane kończyny nigdy się nie zagoją."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Combat Adaptation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"When you are in great danger you may flip a chemical switch in your brain "
"and for a cost in hunger, fatigue, and thirst your nervous system will "
"process things around you slightly faster.  Giving you better reaction times "
"that you can pay for later if you survive."
msgstr ""
"Kiedy jesteś w wielkim niebezpieczeństwie, możesz włączyć chemiczny "
"przełącznik w swoim mózgu, a kosztem głodu, zmęczenia i pragnienia twój "
"układ nerwowy będzie przetwarzał rzeczy wokół ciebie nieco szybciej. Daje ci "
"lepsze czasy reakcji, za które możesz zapłacić później, jeśli przeżyjesz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Blindness"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether congenital or acquired, you suffer from nyctalopia, and see poorly "
"in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Addiction Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether due to a lifetime of exposure or through simple willpower, it's "
"harder for you to become addicted to substances, and easier to rid yourself "
"of these addictions."
msgstr ""
"Czy to przez dawny żywot ćpuna, czy przez zwykłą siłę woli, trudniej ci się "
"uzależnić i łatwiej wydobyć z nałogu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bad Knees"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether due to injury or age, your knees aren't particularly strong or "
"flexible.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down more than normal."
msgstr ""
"Czy to w wyniku urazów czy też wieku, twoje kolana nie są już tak mocne i "
"elastyczne. Poruszanie się po trudnym terenie zabiera ci więcej czasu niż "
"zwykle."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Languorous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether due to lack of exercise and poor diet, or due to a natural "
"disinclination to physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much "
"more readily than others."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Obligate Digestion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"While it is by no means pleasant, your body has adapted to handle the toxic "
"contaminants in mutant meat a little better.  You can eat a bit more of the "
"stuff before suffering ill effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whiskers"
msgstr "Wibrysy"

#. ~ Variant name of mutation "Bird Wings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "White Bird Wings"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of mutation "Feathers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "White Feathers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "White Feathers" of mutation"Feathers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"White feathers have grown to cover your entire body, providing a marginal "
"protection against attacks and minor protection from cold.  They also "
"provide a natural waterproofing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crustacean"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Who needs skin when you can have a hard carapace?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wide Mouth"
msgstr "Szerokie usta"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Will Not Bash"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wing Stubs"
msgstr "Wypustki skrzydłowe"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wiry Whiskers"
msgstr "Szorstkie wibrysy"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rope Webs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "With spinnerets like THESE, who needs rope?!  Activate to produce rope."
msgstr ""
"Z TAKIMI kądziołkami przędnymi kto potrzebował by liny?! Aktywuj, by "
"wyprodukować linę."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Speed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "With this, you'll be fixing those bugs faster than ever!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Near-Sighted"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Without glasses, your seeing radius is severely reduced!  However, you are "
"guaranteed to start with a pair of glasses."
msgstr ""
"Bez okularów twoje pole widzenia jest mocno ograniczone! Jednakże zawsze "
"zaczynasz z okularami."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Far-Sighted"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Without reading glasses, you are unable to read anything, and take penalties "
"on melee accuracy and electronics/tailoring crafting.  However, you are "
"guaranteed to start with a pair of reading glasses."
msgstr ""
"Bez okularów do czytania nie jesteś w stanie niczego przeczytać i masz karę "
"do celności w walce w zwarciu oraz w elektronice i szyciu. Jednakże zawsze "
"zaczynasz z okularami."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wool Allergy"
msgstr "Alergia na wełnę"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Terrible Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wounds are incredibly dangerous to you, as they barely heal at all.  Your HP "
"whilst asleep, as well as your broken limbs, heal at 10% of the regular rate."
msgstr ""
"Rany są dla ciebie niezwykle niebezpieczne, ponieważ ledwo się goją. Twoje "
"HP podczas snu, a także złamane kończyny leczą się w 10% normalnego tempa."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snackaholic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You *adore* the taste of junk food, and find it preferable to everything "
"else!  Additionally, you suffer no negative health effects from eating it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bile Stink"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You absolutely reek.  The bile you were splashed with seems to be reacting "
"with your body chemistry to produce a smell that's somehow even worse.  If "
"anything that hunts by scent is around, it's sure to notice you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "US Marshal"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn Federal marshal, with nationwide jurisdiction and the "
"authority of the United States of America."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś należycie zaprzysiężonym szeryfem federalnym Stanów Zjednoczonych, "
"funkcjonariuszem policji międzystanowej, z obejmującą cały kraj jurysdykcją "
"i władzą, sprawowaną w imieniu Stanów Zjednoczonych Ameryki."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a little nimbler.  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr "Jesteś nieco zwinniejszy. +1 zręczności."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a little smarter.  +1 Intelligence."
msgstr "Jesteś nieco mądrzejszy. +1 inteligencji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pretty"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a sight to behold.  People who care about such things will react "
"more kindly to you."
msgstr ""
"Ależ z ciebie widok. Ludzie którzy zwracają na to uwagę, będą dla ciebie "
"łaskawsi."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sociable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a social creature.  Spending time with friends will improve your "
"mood, but if you're alone too long, you'll start to feel unhappy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Beautiful"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a vision of beauty.  Some people will react very well to your looks, "
"and most people will trust you immediately."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś obrazem piękna. Niektórzy ludzie będą bardzo dobrze reagować na twoją "
"obecność, a większość zaufa ci od ręki."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Outdoorsman"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are accustomed to being exposed to the elements.  This decreases morale "
"penalties for being wet."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś przyzwyczajony do bycia wystawionym na żywioły. Obniża kary za bycie "
"mokrym."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wool Allergy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are badly allergic to wool, and cannot wear any clothing made of the "
"substance."
msgstr ""
"Masz silne uczulenie na wełnę i nie możesz nosić żadnych wełnianych ubrań."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Back"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying far more than someone with similar strength "
"could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 15%."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Blooded"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are cold-blooded and rely on heat to keep moving.  Your lose 1% of your "
"speed for every 2 (1.1) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), resulting in less "
"calorie usage."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś zimnokrwisty i bazujesz na cieple, by móc się poruszać. Tracisz 1% "
"szybkości na każde 2 stopnie Fahrenheita  (1,1 stopnia Celsjusza) poniżej 65 "
"F (18,3 C), co powoduje mniejsze zużycie kalorii."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are far smarter.  +7 Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hub 01 Ancillary"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are known to be a capable and resourceful mercenary at the employ of Hub "
"01."
msgstr ""
"Wiadomo, że jesteś zdolnym i zaradnym najemnikiem zatrudnionym przez Hub 01."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Stomach"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are less likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  If you "
"throw up despite this, you won't suffer any residual nausea."
msgstr ""
"Masz mniejsze szanse na zwymiotowanie z powodu zatrucia pokarmowego, "
"alkoholu, itp. Jeśli jednak zwymiotujesz, to nie będziesz cierpieć na "
"nudności."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Stomach"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are more likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc."
msgstr ""
"Masz większe szanse na pochorowanie się z powodu zatrucia pokarmowego, "
"alkoholu, itp."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are much nimbler than before.  +7 Dexterity."
msgstr "Jesteś zwinny jak nikt dotąd. +7 zręczności."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are much smarter.  +4 Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are nimbler.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "Jesteś zwinniejszy. +2 zręczności."

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Cold Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are now even less bothered by the cold and it is harder for you to "
"freeze or to even get chilly.  When you do though, it'll hit just as hard as "
"it did before."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Heat Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are now even less bothered by the heat and it is harder for you to "
"overheat or even sweat.  When you do though, it'll hit just as hard as it "
"did before."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Temperature Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are now not at all bothered by the heat and it is harder for you to "
"overheat or freeze at all.  When you do though, it'll hit just as hard as it "
"did before."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Prevent Death"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are prevented from death."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Dextrous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are quick and nimble.  +4 Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Learner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are slow to grasp new ideas, and thus learn things more slowly than "
"others.  Note that this only applies to real-world experience, not to skill "
"gain from other sources like books."
msgstr ""
"Słabo ogarniasz nowe idee, więc uczenie się nowych rzeczy przychodzi ci "
"wolniej niż innym. Dotyczy to jednak wiedzy pochodzącej z praktyki, a nie z "
"lektury książek."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Smart"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are smarter.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "Jesteś mądrzejszy. +2 inteligencji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Disorganized"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are terrible at organizing and storing your possessions.  You retrieve "
"things from containers 10% slower."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś okropny w organizacji i przechowywaniu swoich rzeczy. Pobierasz "
"przedmioty z pojemników 10% wolniej."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nyctophobia"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are terribly afraid of the dark.  You refuse to enter very dark areas.  "
"If you somehow still happen to stay in dark areas, you suffer from various "
"detrimental mental and physical effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are the tree under which humankind will shelter during these dark times."
msgstr ""
"Ty jesteś drzewem pod którym ludzkość znajdzie schronienie w tych mrocznych "
"czasach."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Martial Artist"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are trained in a hand-to-hand fighting style."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Little"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are very short.  Either you haven't fully grown up yet, or you've got "
"some form of dwarfism.  You can't carry as much, your feet can't reach the "
"pedals to drive a car, and you're not as durable as the average adult."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Digitigrade Legs"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Paws"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Rabbit Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You assume a less bestial posture."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Insect Wings" to "WINGS_INSECT_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid "You begin buzzing your wings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Transpiration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You body has begun moving nutrients via the evaporation of water.  This "
"increases your thirst when it's hot, but reduces it when it's cold."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało zaczęło przenosić składniki odżywcze poprzez odparowanie wody. "
"Zwiększa to pragnienie, gdy jest gorąco, ale zmniejsza je, gdy jest zimno."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Camouflage Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can change your skin patterns to match your environment, somewhat "
"increasing your stealthiness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slimewave"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can communicate with your extant mass without physical contact, "
"absorbing knowledge from nearby friendly slime."
msgstr ""
"Możesz komunikować się ze swoją masą bez kontaktu fizycznego, wchłaniając "
"wiedzę od pobliskich przyjaznych śluzów."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Substance Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can handle intoxicants well.  Their effects clear up more quickly for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Dobrze radzisz sobie z substancjami odurzającymi. Ich efekty szybciej się "
"rozpływają w twoim przypadku."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Comfortably Fluid"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can hear your heartbeat in your ears, feel the blood sloshing around in "
"your veins.  The uneven hitches in your breath, the aches in your joints, "
"the rumbling of your stomach.  It's nasty and messy and ugly.  And you are "
"extremely grateful for that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pounce"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can leap a good distance forward at a moment's notice."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crushing Leap"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can leap a significant distance and slam your body down hard on "
"anything, friend or foe, in your landing zone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Photophore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can make your photophore glow brightly."
msgstr "Możesz sprawić, że fotofory będą świecić jasno."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fleet-Footed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can move more quickly than most, resulting in a 15% speed bonus on sure "
"footing."
msgstr ""
"Poruszasz się szybciej niż inni, więc masz 15% bonusu do szybkości na pewnym "
"podłożu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Distributed Senses"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can now extend and reabsorb sensory organs at will, and can therefore "
"ignore most shocks that would overwhelm lesser beings."
msgstr ""
"Możesz teraz formować i wchłaniać narządy zmysłów na żądanie, i w ten sposób "
"ignorować większość szoków, które poraziłyby pośledniejsze istoty."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Persistence Hunter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can pursue prey for days if you have to.  Your stamina recovers quickly "
"and you can go a bit longer without sleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Persistence Hunter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can pursue prey for quite a long time thanks to your increased stamina "
"recovery and reduced need for sleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Cardio"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can run, but you'll never run out of breath."
msgstr "Możesz biegać, ale nigdy nie zabraknie ci tchu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey Nightsight"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can see almost perfectly in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Night Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can see incredibly well in the dark!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Full Night Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can see perfectly well even in near-total darkness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can sense things you never imagined.  +7 Perception."
msgstr ""
"Wyczuwasz rzeczy o których nigdy nawet sobie nie wyobrażałeś. +7 percepcji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bioluminescent Flare"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can spit a wad of bioluminescent goo several meters away.  There it will "
"light up its surroundings until it dissipates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hemovore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can still eat other food, but you crave the taste of blood over "
"everything else.  Without a steady supply or some kind of iron supplement, "
"you're prone to developing anemia."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Durable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can survive injuries that would incapacitate humans: you get a 20% bonus "
"to all hit points."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Introvert"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can tolerate others, but you prefer to be alone.  Spending time by "
"yourself will boost your mood slightly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cannibal"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't afford to pass up any opportunity to eat, even if it means gorging "
"yourself on human flesh to survive.  Besides, it's not as if you're really "
"one of them anymore…right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antsy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't bear to stay still for long.  Your morale will suffer unless you "
"constantly explore new territory."
msgstr ""
"Nie możesz znieść długiego pozostawania w bezruchu. Twoje morale ucierpi, "
"chyba że będziesz stale eksplorować nowe tereny."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Superiority Complex"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't stand to prostrate yourself before your lessers and hate it when "
"they don't immediately do what you say.  Persuasion is much more difficult, "
"but you're better at lying and intimidating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chaos"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't tell what you are anymore.  Everything and yet nothing, like you "
"weren't meant to exist.  But you do, and you're a force, no matter what "
"happens."
msgstr ""
"Nie jesteś już w stanie powiedzieć czym jesteś. Wszystkim i nadal niczym, "
"jakbyś nie powinien istnieć. Ale istniejesz i jesteś siłą, nie ważne co się "
"stanie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Large"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You carry your rugged body with the dignity you deserve.  Strength +2."
msgstr "Nosisz swoje silne ciało z szacunkiem na jaki zasługuje. Siła +2."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You consider yourself something other than human and no longer empathize "
"with them.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, but your critical "
"thinking, so characteristic to these creatures, suffers."
msgstr ""
"Uważasz się za coś innego niż człowiek i już nie sympatyzujesz z rodzajem "
"ludzkim. Umiejętności bojowe są łatwe do nauki i zapamiętania, ale "
"umiejętność krytycznego myślenia, tak charakterystyczna dla tych istot, "
"ucierpiała."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You consume three times as much food as the average human to maintain your "
"truly superhuman endurance."
msgstr ""
"Spożywasz trzykrotność tego co zjada przeciętny człowiek, by utrzymać swoją "
"nadludzką wytrzymałość."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Heavy Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You could probably sleep through a firefight."
msgstr "Prawdopodobnie przespałbyś akcję gaśniczą."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tireless"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You defend the realm all night and all day."
msgstr "Bronisz królestwa dniem i nocą."

#. ~ Message when spawning item "vine_30" with mutation "Vine Sprouter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You detach a vine from your body."
msgstr "Odłączasz pnącze ze swojego ciała."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bulging Reservoir"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You develop a reservoir of fluids that bulges out of your abdomen.  Your "
"body has adapted to containing extra liquids in event of shortfalls."
msgstr ""
"Pojawia się u ciebie zbiornik płynów, który wyłania się z twojego brzucha. "
"Twoje ciało przystosowało się do przechowywania dodatkowych płynów w "
"przypadku ich niedoboru."

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Extras"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't have any tails, whiskers, horns, or miscellaneous extra bits."
msgstr ""
"Nie masz żadnych ogonów, wąsów, rogów lub innych dodatkowych elementów."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pacifist"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You don't like thinking about violence.  Your combat skills advance much "
"slower than usual, and you feel more guilt about killing."
msgstr ""
"Nie lubisz myśleć o przemocy. Twoje umiejętności bojowe rozwijają się dużo "
"wolniej i odczuwasz większy żal z powodu zabijania."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extrovert"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You don't mind being alone, but you get a slight mood boost from being "
"around friends."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Little Sleep"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't sleep often.  But when you do, you need very little of it."
msgstr "Rzadko śpisz, a gdy sypiasz niewiele ci go potrzeba."

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Digitigrade Legs"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Paws"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Rabbit Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You drop down on all fours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Eight Legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You drop to the ground to use all your limbs to skitter along."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Thirsty"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You dry out seriously quickly, requiring three times as much liquid to stay "
"hydrated."
msgstr ""
"Odwadniasz się w bardzo szybkim tempie i potrzebujesz potrójnej dawki "
"płynów, by się nawodnić."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gourmand"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You eat faster, and can eat and drink more in a single sitting.  You also "
"enjoy food more; delicious food is better for your morale, and you don't "
"mind unsavory meals as much.  Activate to skip prompt for overeating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Retractable Claws" to "CLAWS_RETRACT_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You extend your claws."
msgstr "Wysuwasz swoje pazury."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Spray"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You exude slime from your pores.  You can spread that slime on an opponent "
"in melee range."
msgstr ""
"Wydzielasz śluz ze swoich porów. Możesz rozprowadzić ten śluz na przeciwniku "
"w zasięgu walki wręcz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You fare better than most in colder climates and are less bothered by lower "
"temperatures.  Note that while it will take more cold and exposure for you "
"to suffer the effects of frostbite, you aren't any better at dealing with "
"the symptoms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Tolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You fare better than most in warmer climates and are less bothered by hotter "
"temperatures.  Note that while it will take more heat and exposure for you "
"to suffer the effects of sunstroke, you aren't any better at dealing with "
"the symptoms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakening"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel as though you are slowly weakening and your body heals slower."
msgstr "Czujesz, że powoli słabniesz i twoje ciało leczy się wolniej."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gastropod"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You feel bad for all the creatures that don't carry their home on their "
"backs."
msgstr ""
"Szkoda ci wszystkich stworzeń, które nie noszą swojego domu na plecach."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nausea"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You feel nauseated almost constantly, and are more liable to throw up from "
"food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  You can, if desired, think yourself into "
"vomiting, too."
msgstr ""
"Czujesz mdłości niemal stale i z więcej wymiotujesz z powodu zatruć "
"pokarmowych, alkoholu, itd. Możesz też, jeśli chcesz, samą myślą wywołać u "
"siebie wymioty."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sunlight Dependent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You feel very sluggish when not in direct sunlight.  You suffer a 5% drop in "
"speed when in shade, and a 10% drop in speed when in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Czujesz ociężałość, gdy nie jesteś w pełnym słońcu. Cierpisz na 5% utratę "
"szybkości w cieniu i 10% utratę szybkości w ciemności."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rooter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You find it difficult not to sink roots when able.  You extract nutrients "
"and water whenever on diggable terrain, but move more slowly."
msgstr ""
"Trudno ci odmówić sobie zakorzenienia w każdej dogodnej okazji. Pobierasz "
"wodę i składniki odżywcze z każdej gleby w której da się kopać, ale wolniej "
"się poruszasz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mesopic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You find it difficult to see very far in bright light.  On its own, this "
"doesn't make you any better at seeing in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Sleepy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You find yourself needing to sleep quite often.  You'll spend about half of "
"your time in or around a bed."
msgstr ""
"Często odczuwasz potrzebę snu. Spędzasz połowę czasu w lub w pobliżu łóżka."

#. ~ Message when firing ranged attack with mutation "Assault Barbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You fire off some of your quills."
msgstr "Możesz wystrzelić niektóre z twoich kolców."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Howler"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You frequently let out a piercing howl."
msgstr "Często wydajesz przenikliwe wycie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weight: XXXL"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You gained an awful lot of weight before the Cataclysm.  Whatever the "
"reason, now that mobility is key to survival, your oversized figure presents "
"an additional danger.  You need to lose weight or die trying."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Directionally Challenged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You get lost easily.  Even in good conditions, you will uncover much less of "
"your overmap while exploring."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Marloss Gateway"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You get the feeling that you're on the cusp of becoming something greater "
"than yourself."
msgstr ""
"Masz przeczucie, że stoisz na progu stania się czymś większym od siebie "
"samego."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Psychopath"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a diminished capacity for empathy and feel little remorse for your "
"actions.  This does not necessarily make you predisposed to harming or "
"exploiting others, but your superficial charm and lack of guilt make lying "
"all too easy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tail Fin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a finned tail that allows you to swim more effectively."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slit Nostrils"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a flattened nose and thin slits for nostrils, giving you a lizard-"
"like appearance.  This makes breathing slightly difficult and increases "
"mouth encumbrance by 10."
msgstr ""
"Masz spłaszczony nos z parą szparek jako nozdrza, co daje ci jaszczurczy "
"wygląd. Utrudnia to trochę oddychanie i zwiększa skrępowanie ust o 10."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Growling Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a growling, rough voice.  Persuading or lying to people will be "
"more difficult, but threatening them will be easier."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Whiskers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a handsome set of whiskers around your mouth.  These make you more "
"aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to dodge very "
"slightly."
msgstr ""
"Masz atrakcyjny zestaw wibrysów wokół ust. Sprawiają, że jesteś bardziej "
"świadomy wibracji powietrza i nieznacznie ulepszają zdolność uników."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insomniac"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a hard time falling asleep, even under the best circumstances!"
msgstr "Masz problemy z zasypianiem, nawet w dogodnych warunkach."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ponderous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a hard time getting anywhere in a hurry.  This affects only your "
"movement, not your actions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pain Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a high tolerance for pain."
msgstr "Masz wysoką tolerancję na ból."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a huge rack of antlers, like those of a stag.  They allow you to "
"make a powerful headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is not "
"made of fabric."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Mouth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a human mouth with human teeth."
msgstr "Masz ludzkie usta i ludzkie zęby."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Club Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long tail that ends in a heavy, bony club.  It does not improve "
"your balance at all, but allows for a powerful bashing attack.  Prevents "
"wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Masz długi ogon kończący się ciężką, kościaną pałką. Nie poprawia równowagi, "
"ale pozwala na wyprowadzenie potężnych miażdżących ataków. Uniemożliwia "
"noszenie spodni nie zrobionych z materiału."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stinging Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long tail that ends in a vicious stinger.  It helps with balance "
"and can deliver a powerful stabbing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric "
"pants."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fluffy Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, furry tail.  It helps you dodge, but it also tends to "
"betray how you're feeling in social situations.  Prevents wearing non-fabric "
"pants."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, graceful tail, like that of a big cat.  It improves your "
"balance, making your ability to dodge higher, but prevents wearing non-"
"fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Masz długi, wdzięczny ogon, jak u dużego kota. Poprawia twoją równowagę, "
"ulepszając zdolność uników, ale uniemożliwia noszenie spodni nie zrobionych "
"z materiału."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rodent Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, hairless tail.  It's a pretty effective balancing aid, but "
"does look, uh, ratty.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, powerful set of jaws, like a monitor or a crocodilian.  "
"This makes it hard to find a mask that fits, but if you also have a set of "
"fangs, you can really do some damage while grappling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Croaking Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a low, croaking voice, like an aged grandparent.  Persuading or "
"lying to people will be easier, but threatening them will be more difficult."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vomitous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a major digestive disorder.  Though it causes you to vomit "
"frequently, you have found that you can trigger your vomit reflex on demand, "
"too."
msgstr ""
"Masz poważne problemy trawienne. Powoduje to częste wymioty, ale też "
"zauważasz, że możesz na życzenie wywołać odruch wymiotny."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antennae"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of antennae.  They allow you to detect the presence of "
"monsters up to a few tiles away, even if you can't see or hear them, but "
"prevent wearing headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""
"Masz parę czułek. Pozwalają ci wykryć obecność potworów odległych o kilka "
"kroków, nawet gdy ich nie widzisz i nie słyszysz, ale uniemożliwiają "
"noszenie nakryć głowy nie zrobionych z materiału."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Head Bumps"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of bumps on your skull, like something's growing beneath the "
"skin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Curled Horns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large curled horns, like those of a ram.  They allow you "
"to make a strong bashing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing most headwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Horns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, pointed horns, like those of an antelope.  They "
"allow you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing "
"headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""
"Masz parę długich, szpiczastych rogów na głowie, jak u antylopy. Pozwalają "
"ci na silny przebijający atak z główki, ale uniemożliwiają noszenie nakryć "
"głowy nie zrobionych z materiału."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Horns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of small horns on your head.  They'll make your headbutts do "
"more damage if uncovered, but prevent the use of most rigid headwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wing Stubs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of stubby little wings projecting from your shoulderblades.  "
"They can be wiggled at will, but are useless."
msgstr ""
"Masz parę grubych małych skrzydeł wystających z łopatek. Można nimi "
"potrząsać ale są bezużyteczne."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gluten Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a rare allergy that prevents you from eating wheat.  It's possible "
"for you to eat wheat-based products, but you will suffer morale penalties "
"and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr ""
"Masz rzadka alergię, która nie pozwala ci spożywać pszenicznych wyrobów. "
"Możesz je jeść, ale twoje morale ucierpi i otrzymasz z nich mniej wartości "
"odżywczych."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nictitating Membrane"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a set of clear lenses which lower over your eyes while underwater, "
"allowing you to see as though you were wearing goggles.  Slightly decreases "
"wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Masz drugą parę przezroczystych powiek, które zamykają się pod wodą, przez "
"co widzisz tak jakbyś miał założone gogle. Nieznacznie obniża kary za "
"przemoczenie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wiry Whiskers"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a set of prominent rodent-like whiskers around your mouth.  These "
"make you more aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to "
"dodge slightly."
msgstr ""
"Masz wydatny zestaw szczurzych wibrysów wokół ust. Sprawiają, że jesteś "
"bardziej świadomy wibracji powietrza i nieznacznie ulepszają zdolność uników."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stubby Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a short, stubby tail at the base of your spine, like a hamster.  It "
"serves no purpose, but it's easy enough to hide under your clothes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cattle Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a short, thin with a tuft on the end.  It's too small to aid your "
"balance or interfere with equipment, but it's pretty handy for reflexively "
"swatting away flies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sweet Tooth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a soft spot for sweets, snacks, and empty calories.  Junk food is "
"more enjoyable, but everything else is a bit less so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crushing Beak"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a strong, sharp beak, perfect for cracking open nuts or shellfish.  "
"You'll sometimes use it to bite in combat, especially while grappling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snarling Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a threatening snarl in your voice.  Persuading or lying to people "
"will be near impossible, but threatening them will be much easier."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stimulant Psychosis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a unique history with stimulants (like coffee or amphetamines).  "
"You can tolerate a lot more of them without overdosing, but if you indulge "
"too much, you start seeing things…"
msgstr ""
"Masz barwną historię ze stymulantami (jak kawa lub amfetamina). Tolerujesz "
"je bardziej bez przedawkowania, ale jeśli pozwolisz sobie na więcej, "
"zaczynasz widzieć rzeczy…"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bombardier Beetle Blast"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have an ability to spray boiling water on your enemies at melee "
"distance.  This will drastically increase your thirst.  Without an extra "
"reservoir you would quickly dehydrate yourself."
msgstr ""
"Masz możliwość rozpylania wrzątku na przeciwników w zasięgu ręki. To "
"drastycznie zwiększy twoje pragnienie. Bez dodatkowego zbiornika szybko się "
"odwodnisz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pyromaniac"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have an unhealthy obsession with fire, and you get anxious if you don't "
"light them every now and then or stand near them often.  However, you gain a "
"mood bonus from doing so."
msgstr ""
"Masz niezdrową obsesję na punkcie ognia i denerwujesz się, jeśli nie "
"zapalasz ich od czasu do czasu lub często się do nich nie zbliżasz. "
"Zyskujesz jednak premię do nastroju jeśli będziesz to robić."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wide Mouth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have an unsettlingly wide mouth, like a frog.  This looks hideous, but "
"allows you to swallow your food whole.  If you don't have any other bite "
"attacks, you'll still sometimes bite while grappling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Blue" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have blue avian eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Brown" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have brown avian eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Retractable Claws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have claws on the ends of your fingers, and can extend or retract them "
"as desired.  Gloves will still get in the way, though."
msgstr ""
"Masz pazury na końcach palców, które możesz do woli wyciągać i chować. "
"Rękawiczki nadal będą wchodzić w paradę, niestety."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have claws on the ends of your fingers.  If you aren't wearing gloves, "
"you'll be able to make barehanded attacks with these."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rigid Eyestalks"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have compound eyes on rigid stalks that can fold back against your head "
"to protect them from danger.  This gives you better all-around vision and "
"allows you to see underwater, but interferes with eyewear.  Perception +1"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Folding Fangs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have developed deadly extensible fangs.  This makes eating slower, but "
"they're great for striking your prey, especially when it's helpless.  "
"Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vines"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have developed several vines sprouting from your shoulder area.  They're "
"bulky, and get in the way."
msgstr ""
"Wyrosło ci kilka pnączy wyrastających z okolicy ramion. Są nieporęczne i "
"przeszkadzają."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Reflexes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have fast reflexes, allowing you to dodge attacks more easily."
msgstr "Masz szybki refleks, dzięki czemu łatwiej unikasz ataków."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crab Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have four prong-tipped legs, splayed out and articulated like a crab's.  "
"They're a little quieter than human feet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vine Sprouter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have full control of your vines, and can grow new ones and detach old "
"ones more or less at will."
msgstr ""
"Masz pełną kontrolę nad twoimi pnączami i możesz powodować wzrost nowych "
"oraz odłączać stare niemal na żądanie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mycorrhizal Communion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have gained the ability to commune with trees and comprehend their "
"ancient wisdom.  Activate next to a tree to gradually gain overmap vision "
"through connected forests."
msgstr ""
"Uzyskałeś umiejętność obcowania z drzewami i zrozumienia ich starożytnej "
"mądrości. Aktywuj obok drzewa, aby stopniowo uzyskiwać wizję nad mapą przez "
"połączone lasy."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stomach Cleanse"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have gained the ability to invert your stomach outside your body to "
"quickly eliminate toxins, and are more likely to throw up from food "
"poisoning, alcohol, etc.  If you throw up because of this, you won't suffer "
"any residual nausea."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Goosebumps"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have goosebumps that never seem to go away.  Are they getting bigger?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shell"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown a thick shell over your torso, providing excellent armor, but "
"you cannot wear anything on your torso.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Wyrosła ci twarda skorupa wokół tułowia, zapewniając doskonałą zbroję, lecz "
"nie możesz niczego nosić na tułowiu. Trochę redukuje efekty przemoczenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Freakishly Huge"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown even more massive, to the point where you cannot usefully fit "
"into human-sized clothing or vehicles.  Much of it is powerful muscle mass "
"(Strength +4), but it's a real pain to haul around."
msgstr ""
"Wyrosłeś nawet bardziej masywny niż przedtem, do poziomu w którym nie "
"mieścisz się w ludzkiego rozmiaru ubrania i pojazdy. Większość tego to silna "
"masa mięśniowa (Siła +4), ale sprawia dużo problemów, by ją dźwigać dookoła."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inconveniently Large"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown noticeably taller and broader.  Much of it is useful muscle "
"mass (Strength +2), but you find it throws off your balance and you get in "
"your own way (+10 torso and arm encumbrance)."
msgstr ""
"Wyrosłeś i jesteś zauważalnie wyższy i szerszy. Większość z tego to "
"użyteczna masa mięśniowa (siła +2), ale zauważasz, że jesteś mniej stabilny "
"i sam sobie wchodzisz w drogę (+10 do skrępowania tułowia i rąk)."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Toe Talons"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown wickedly sharp talons on your feet.  Fortunately, they don't "
"get in the way of your movement.  Unfortunately, they do prevent wearing "
"footgear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Arms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human arms."
msgstr "Masz ludzkie ręce."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Blood"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human ears and hearing."
msgstr "Masz ludzkie uszy i słuch."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human eyes."
msgstr "Masz ludzkie oczy."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Hands"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human hands."
msgstr "Masz ludzkie dłonie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human legs."
msgstr "Masz ludzkie nogi."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have human skin and no distinct smell."
msgstr "Masz ludzką skórę i brak charakterystycznego zapachu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Animal Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have large ears with broad pinnae, like a dog or a cow.  They enhance "
"your hearing, allowing you to hear at greater distances."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dead Lush Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have no leaves because it's wintertime.  This keeps you warm by reducing "
"heat loss, but you don't know that because you shouldn't be able to see this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Orange" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have orange avian eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Melee Weapon Training"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have practiced fighting with weapons.  You start with your choice of "
"Barbaran Montante, Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, "
"Kalaripayattu, Medieval Swordsmanship, Niten Ichi-Ryu, Pencak Silat, or "
"Sōjutsu."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Meat Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have problems with eating meat.  It's possible for you to eat it, but "
"you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from it."
msgstr ""
"Masz problem z jedzeniem mięsa. Możesz je jeść, ale twoje morale ucierpi i "
"otrzymasz z niego mniej wartości odżywczych."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiber Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have problems with eating vegetables.  It's possible for you to eat "
"them, but you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Masz problem z jedzeniem warzyw. Możesz je jeść, ale twoje morale ucierpi i "
"otrzymasz z nich mniej wartości odżywczych."

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Red" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have red avian eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have thick reptilian tail.  It helps you balance a bit but also makes a "
"serviceable whip.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Avian Eye Color: Yellow" of mutation"Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have yellow avian eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Healing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You heal as fast as most humans do in this new world."
msgstr "Leczysz się tak szybko, jak większość ludzi w tym nowym świecie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hissing Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You hiss when speaking, and your voice is a bit quieter.  Persuading people "
"will be more difficult, but lying to or threatening them will be easier."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tunnel Fighter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You know how to fight in cramped tunnels at risk of collapse.  You gain "
"bonuses when fighting underground."
msgstr ""
"Wiesz jak walczyć w ciasnych tunelach zagrożonych zawaleniem. Otrzymujesz "
"bonusy podczas walki pod ziemią."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Booming Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You know how to project your voice.  You are able to shout much louder than "
"the average person."
msgstr ""
"Wiesz, jak kierunkować swój głos. Jesteś w stanie krzyczeć znacznie głośniej "
"niż przeciętny człowiek."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vain"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You know you're beautiful, and the world deserves to know it too.  You "
"prefer to show off your stunningly good looks to the world and will be "
"unhappy if you cover up your face."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Vine Limbs" attacks
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Vine Sprouter" attacks
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You lash %s with one of your vines!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chiropteran"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You long for a colony, the cover of darkness, and a meal on the wing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weight: XS"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You lost an awful lot of weight before the Cataclysm.  Whatever the reason, "
"now that food is not always close at hand, your skeletal figure presents an "
"additional danger.  You need to gain weight or die trying."
msgstr ""
"Straciłeś/-aś strasznie dużo wagi przed Kataklizmem. Bez względu na powód, "
"teraz, gdy jedzenie nie zawsze jest pod ręką, twoja szkieletowa figura "
"stanowi dodatkowe niebezpieczeństwo. Musisz przytyć lub umrzeć próbując."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Light Step"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You make less noise while walking.  You're also less likely to set off traps."
msgstr ""
"Mniej hałasujesz, gdy chodzisz. Także szansa, że uruchomiasz pułapkę jest "
"mniejsza."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Clumsy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You make more noise while walking.  You're also more likely to set off traps."
msgstr "Mocniej hałasujesz, gdy chodzisz. Łatwiej też uruchamiasz pułapki."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Footed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You move a little slower than most.  This affects only your movement, not "
"your actions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sluggish"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You move quite slowly.  This affects only your movement, not your actions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Fast Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You need about twice as much food as the average human to maintain your "
"expanded cardiovascular and respiratory systems.  On the plus side, it "
"doesn't take you much time to recover from any strenuous activity."
msgstr ""
"Potrzebujesz około dwa razy więcej pożywienia niż przeciętny człowiek, by "
"podtrzymać swój rozwinięty układ naczyniowo-sercowy i oddechowy. Na plus "
"liczy się to, że nie potrzebujesz wiele czasu, by odzyskać siły po "
"wyczerpujących czynnościach."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Less Sleep"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You need less sleep than the average person."
msgstr "Nie potrzebujesz tyle snu, co przeciętna osoba."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleepy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You need sleep more often, but still spend most of your time awake."
msgstr ""
"Potrzebujesz więcej snu niż inni, mimo że i tak większość czasu jesteś na "
"nogach."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Illiterate"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/innawood/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You never learned to read!  Books and computers are off-limits to you."
msgstr ""
"Nigdy nie nauczyłeś się czytać. Książki i komputery są poza twoim zasięgiem."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inattentive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You never paid attention to your surroundings and specifically to people "
"around you.  You can't judge the intent of critters you see."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mutagenic Instability"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You occasionally mutate.  There's no telling what will change, or when."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shouter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You occasionally shout uncontrollably."
msgstr "Czasami krzyczysz niekontrolowanie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mucus Secretion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You once had a significant other call you slimy, now you exemplify that.  It "
"covers everything you come into contact with but now you can move through "
"slime you didn't create with ease."
msgstr ""
"Twój partner kiedyś nazwał cię oślizgłym, teraz jesteś tego przykładem. "
"Dotyczy to wszystkiego, z czym się stykasz, ale teraz możesz się poruszać po "
"śluzie, którego nie stworzyłeś z łatwością."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Schizophrenic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You periodically suffer from delusions, ranging from minor effects to full "
"visual hallucinations.  Some of these effects may be controlled through the "
"use of antipsychotics."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Photophore (on)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You photophore is glowing brightly."
msgstr "Twoje fotofory świecą jasno."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cenobite"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You positively adore pain, in all its varied forms."
msgstr "Pozytywnie adorujesz ból, we wszystkich formach."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Glorious"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You possess an unearthly beauty.  Most people cannot help themselves due to "
"your charms, and will do whatever they can to please you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You possess natural night vision, and can see further in the dark than most."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saprophage"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You prefer to sustain your nutritional needs using your roots and direct "
"nutrient extraction/synthesis.  Your human parts still need the raw caloric "
"bulk of 'food' to keep them going, though, and you handle it a lot easier if "
"it's had time to… age a little."
msgstr ""
"Preferujesz pożywianie się używając swoich korzeni i bezpośredniej "
"ekstrakcji/syntezy składników odżywczych. Twoje ludzkie części nadal "
"potrzebują surowej kalorycznej masy „pożywienia”, aby je utrzymać, a o wiele "
"łatwiej sobie z tym radzisz, jeśli masz czas… trochę się zestarzeć."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Narcoleptic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You randomly fall asleep without any reason."
msgstr "Przypadkowo zasypiasz bez żadnego powodu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hates Water"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You really hate getting your fur all wet.  This increases morale penalties "
"for being wet, and you will get them even when wearing appropriate clothing."
msgstr ""
"Naprawdę nienawidzisz mieć mokre futro. Zwiększa to kary morale za bycie "
"mokrym, a otrzymasz je nawet jeśli masz na sobie odpowiednie ubranie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lagomorph"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You really want to eat some carrots.  Welcome to the Lagomorpha family."
msgstr "Naprawdę chcesz zjeść trochę marchewek. Witamy w rodzinie zajęczaków."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quick Pain Recovery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You recover from pain faster than normal."
msgstr "Twój ból ustaje szybciej niż zwykle."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Quick Pain Recovery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You recover from pain much faster than normal."
msgstr "Twój ból ustaje dużo szybciej niż zwykle."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pain Recovery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You recover from pain slightly faster than normal."
msgstr "Twój ból ustaje nieco szybciej niż zwykle."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You require more food than most people, but recover stamina slightly faster."
msgstr ""
"Potrzebujesz więcej żywności niż większość ludzi, ale odzyskujesz staminę "
"nieco szybciej."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rapid Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You require more food than most, but you recover stamina and heal from "
"wounds more quickly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Extended Claws" to "CLAWS_RETRACT"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You retract your claws."
msgstr "Chowasz swoje pazury."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Changing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You shouldn't see this.  This makes you mutate."
msgstr "To nie powinno być widoczne. Sprawia, że mutujesz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tainted Shadow"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You shouldn't see this.  This makes you spawn tainted shadows."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bad Back"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You simply cannot carry as much as people with a similar strength could.  "
"Your maximum weight carried is reduced by 15%."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Rest"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sleep a normal amount for a human."
msgstr "Śpisz normalnie, tak jak człowiek."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Acidic Secretion" attacks
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You smear slime on %s!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smelly"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You smell awful.  Monsters that track scent will find you very easily, and "
"humans will react poorly."
msgstr ""
"Okropnie cuchniesz. Potwory które podążają za zapachem bardzo łatwo cię "
"znajdują, a ludzie źle na ciebie reagują."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptile"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You sometimes look back on your days before your tail came in.  But you're "
"better now."
msgstr ""
"Czasami wspominasz dawne dni zanim wyrósł ci ogon. Ale teraz jest lepiej."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Screamer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sometimes scream uncontrollably."
msgstr "Czasami wrzeszczysz niekontrolowanie."

#. ~ Message when spawning item "rope_30" with mutation "Rope Webs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You spin a rope from your silk."
msgstr "Pleciesz linę ze swojego jedwabiu."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Bombardier Beetle Blast" attacks
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You spray %s with a boiling chemical mixture!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Light"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You start to emit a light, so you can debug in the darkest nights."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chemical Imbalance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You suffer from a minor chemical imbalance, whether mental or physical.  "
"Minor changes to your internal chemistry will manifest themselves on "
"occasion, such as hunger, fatigue, pain, etc."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Jittery"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You tend to get a bad case of the shakes when you're hungry or under the "
"effects of stimulants.  Nicotine can help, and benzodiazepines will stop the "
"effect entirely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Seasonal Allergies"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You tend to get hay fever, especially in springtime.  Antihistamines are "
"your friend."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Seasonal Affective Disorder"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You tend to have bouts of depression during the fall and especially winter.  "
"Taking antidepressants can help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Savant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You tend to specialize in one skill and be poor at all others.  You advance "
"at half speed in all skills except your best one.  If multiple skills are "
"equal, the topmost one on the skill list will be selected."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Intelligence"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You understand almost everything about which you think, with minimal effort."
msgstr "Rozumiesz wszystko o czym pomyślisz, przy minimalnej dozie wysiłku."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Charger"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You walk slowly, but can run with surprising speed.  Additionally, you can "
"activate this mutation to perform a charging attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Asthmatic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You will occasionally need to use an inhaler, or else suffer severe physical "
"limitations.  However, you are guaranteed to start with an inhaler."
msgstr ""
"Od czasu do czasu potrzebujesz użyć swojego inhalatora, bo bez niego "
"będziesz cierpiał na znaczne ograniczenia fizyczne. Na szczęście zaczynasz z "
"nim w ekwipunku."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Loner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You'd really rather be by yourself.  Being alone will improve your mood, but "
"spending too much time around other people can grate on your nerves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Normal Human"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a normal human; there's nothing wrong with you.  No need to worry."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś normalnym człowiekiem, wszystko z tobą w porządku. Nie ma powodów do "
"obaw."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Reader"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a quick reader, and can get through books a lot faster than most."
msgstr "Szybko czytasz i pochłaniasz książki szybciej niż inni."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Beautiful"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a real head-turner.  Some people will react well to your appearance, "
"and most people have an easier time trusting you."
msgstr ""
"Obracają za tobą głowami z wrażenia. Niektórzy ludzie będą dobrze reagować "
"na twoją obecność, a większości łatwiej będzie ci zaufać."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Reader"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a slow reader, and it takes you longer to get through books than most."
msgstr "Wolno czytasz, więc książki zajmują ci więcej czasu niż innym."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Guileless"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a terrible liar and you have a difficult time haggling or "
"intimidating people.  Some find you more trustworthy, though others might "
"look down on your ineffectuality."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Picky Eater"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a very picky eater.  You refuse to eat any food that tastes bad "
"unless you're starving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Easy Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're able to fall asleep easily, even in less than ideal circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Grazer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're accustomed to eating plants directly, and can get nutrition from "
"grass as well as underbrush and shrubs.  Eat either one by activating this, "
"standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś przyzwyczajony do bezpośredniego spożywania roślin i możesz uzyskać "
"pożywienie z trawy jak i z poszycia i krzaków. Zjedz jedno z nich aktywując "
"to, stojąc nad celem i naciskając E."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Verminous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're accustomed to filth, and don't mind being covered in or surrounded by "
"it.  This does not confer any resistance to illness or infection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scout"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're an excellent navigator and your ability to recognize distant "
"landmarks is unmatched.  Your sight radius on the overmap extends beyond the "
"normal range."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś doskonałym nawigatorem a twoja zdolność do rozpoznawania odległych "
"punktów odniesienia jest niezrównana. Twój zasięg wzroku na mapie świata "
"wykracza poza normalne granice."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Amphibious"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're as comfortable in water as on land, and your body has adapted around "
"that fact.  Your base swimming speed is greatly increased, and weight will "
"hinder you much less while swimming."
msgstr ""
"Czujesz się komfortowo zarówno na lądzie jak i w wodzie, a twoje ciało jest "
"zaadaptowane do obydwu środowisk. Twoja bazowa zdolność pływania znacząco "
"wzrosła, a waga będzie znacznie mniejszą przeszkodą podczas pływania."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tank"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You're built like a brick shithouse.  You get a 40% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crustacean Carapace (Molted)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're covered in a great chitin carapace which reduces your Dexterity by 1, "
"however it has recently molted and will offer poor protection until it has "
"time to harden.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deft"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're especially nimble, making you better at a variety of tasks.  You're "
"less likely to be thrown off-balance when missing an attack, to fall down "
"when skating, or to lose your footing on slippery terrain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Squeamish"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're finicky, maybe even germophobic.  You can't willingly wear filthy "
"items, and certain foods may be especially upsetting to you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Wings (Buzzing)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're fluttering your wings as fast as you can.  This doesn't generate "
"enough lift to move you, but it does increase your movement speed.  If "
"you're not burdened, you can fall short distances without harm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Liar"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're great at bending the truth, and when it comes to haggling, you know "
"how to get a good deal.  It's usually an asset, but some people can see "
"right through it, and it makes sincere attempts at persuasion more difficult."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Badly Deformed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're hideously deformed.  Some people will have a strong negative reaction "
"to your appearance."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś okropnie zdeformowany. Niektórzy ludzie będą bardzo negatywnie "
"reagować na twoje pojawienie się."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deaf"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're not able to hear anything, and as such you're not able to talk to "
"anyone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ugly"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're not much to look at.  People who care about such things may react "
"less favorably toward you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey Hearing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're not sure the shape of your ears is helping you any; regardless, you "
"have become very sensitive to sounds."
msgstr ""
"Nie masz pewności, czy kształt twoich uszu ci w jakikolwiek sposób pomaga; "
"niezależnie od tego, stałeś się bardzo wrażliwy na dźwięki."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Dexterity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're perfectly coordinated."
msgstr "Masz doskonałą koordynację."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heavy Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're quite the heavy sleeper.  Noises are unlikely to wake you up."
msgstr "Twój sen jest bardzo głęboki. Hałasy rzadko cię budzą."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deformed"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're slightly deformed.  Some people will react badly to your appearance."
msgstr ""
"Masz nieznaczne deformacje ciała. Niektórzy będą źle reagować na twój wygląd."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unassuming"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're still tiny, but your anatomy has adjusted to make more efficient use "
"of your size.  You feel a little tougher, and you can eat and carry more "
"than before."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Avian"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're sure you'll fly someday.  In the meantime, there are still nests to "
"build."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś pewien, że kiedyś wzbijesz się w przestworza. W międzyczasie są nadal "
"gniazda do wybudowania."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Canine"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to lead a pack."
msgstr "Jesteś doskonałym kandydatem by prowadzić stado."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to tidy this mess."
msgstr "Jesteś doskonałym kandydatem do uporządkowania tego bałaganu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tiny"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're the size of a toddler!  You can't carry much, most clothes won't fit, "
"and your hit points are heavily reduced, but your stature confers a number "
"of advantages: you're harder to hit, quieter, less injured by falls, and too "
"light to set off certain traps."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nomad"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're too adventurous for your own good.  The more time you spend "
"somewhere, the unhappier it makes you to be there."
msgstr ""
"Masz zbyt wielką żądzę przygód dla własnego dobra. Im więcej czasu gdzieś "
"przebywasz, tym bardziej czujesz nieszczęście."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solidly Built"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You're tough as nails.  You get a 30% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vegan"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're very strictly vegan, eating animal products is out of the question, "
"even if it means death.  You also can't bear to wear clothing made of animal "
"products, such as leather or fur."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spiritual"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've always felt that there is more to the world than we can see.  Whether "
"driven by religious beliefs or philosophical interest, you find great "
"inspiration in studying holy texts and experiencing mystical things."
msgstr ""
"Zawsze wydawało ci się, że jest w tym świecie coś czego oko nie widzi. Czy "
"to napędzany religijnym zapałem, czy filozofią życiową, czerpiesz wielką "
"inspirację ze studiowania świętych tekstów i doświadczania mistycznych "
"rzeczy."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rigid Table Manners"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've been taught proper table manners from your early childhood on; now, "
"you can't even think about eating without being seated at a table and taking "
"your time.  Eating without a table and chair frustrates you, but eating like "
"a civilized person gives you a bigger morale bonus."
msgstr ""
"Od dziecka wpojono ci zasady zachowania przy stole. Teraz nawet nie "
"potrafisz myśleć o jedzeniu bez siedzenia spokojnie przy stole. Jedzenie bez "
"stołu i krzesła powoduje frustrację, ale posiłek spożyty jak cywilizowana "
"osoba daje ci większy bonus do morale."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rashy Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed a persistent skin rash.  Sometimes it's fine, other times "
"it itches like hell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pain Junkie"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed a serious appetite for pain, and take pride in your scars."
msgstr "Rozwinąłeś w sobie poważny apetyt na ból i z dumą nosisz swoje blizny."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Mind"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed an uncanny patience for problem-solving, making it easier "
"to stay focused on learning."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaping Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've developed quite a powerful leap."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snail Trail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed some ability to control your slime emissions.  As a result "
"of this you can leave trails of slime anywhere you walk."
msgstr ""
"Masz rozwiniętą pewną zdolność do kontrolowania emisji śluzu. Dzięki temu "
"możesz zostawiać ślady śluzu gdziekolwiek się udasz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hairy Chitin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed some sort of bristly hair growing out of parts of your "
"chitin.  It provides a bit of warmth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vine Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed the ability to control your vines; they make good lashes.  "
"You can even rappel down sheer drops using them, but disconnecting HURTS."
msgstr ""
"Zyskałeś zdolność kontrolowania swoich pnączy; są z nich dobre baty. Możesz "
"też opuszczać się na nich z wysokości, ale odłączenie ich BOLI."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hibernation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed the ability to stockpile calories and then sleep for "
"extended periods of time."
msgstr ""
"Rozwinąłeś zdolność gromadzenia kalorii a następnie przesypiania długich "
"okresów czasu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Weaver"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed the necessary anatomy and techniques to control your web-"
"generation.  Activate this to start or stop weaving webs."
msgstr ""
"Rozwinąłeś niezbędną anatomię i techniki kontroli wytwarzania swojej sieci "
"pajęczej. Aktywuj, by rozpocząć lub zatrzymać splatanie sieci."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Nose"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've got a short snout with a twitchy rabbit nose.  If you have matching "
"incisors, this will allow you to use them more effectively."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chitin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown a chitin exoskeleton, much like that of an insect.  In addition "
"to acting as armor, you are somewhat resistant to the harmful effects of "
"radiation.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gills"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown a set of gills in your neck, allowing you to breathe "
"underwater.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"Masz parę skrzeli na szyi i możesz oddychać pod wodą. Nieznacznie zwiększa "
"bonusy za przemoczenie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Gills"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown a set of gills, running from your neck up behind your ears.  "
"They allow you to breathe underwater and slightly increase wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"Wyrósł ci zestaw skrzeli od uszu wzdłuż szyi. Możesz oddychać pod wodą i "
"nieznacznie zwiększa bonusy za przemoczenie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleek Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown sleek fur, providing minor protection against attacks, and some "
"protection from cold."
msgstr ""
"Wyrosło ci gładkie futro, które zapewnia niewielką ochronę przed atakami "
"oraz pewną ochronę przed zimnem."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Culler"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've had a revelation: by killing the weaker creatures, who would only die "
"anyway, you preserve resources for those better able to survive.  You are "
"less bothered by the deaths of others: their own weakness invited these "
"fates upon them."
msgstr ""
"Miałeś objawienie: zabijając słabsze istoty, które i tak by umarły, "
"zachowujesz zasoby dla tych co mają większe zdolności przetrwania. Mniej "
"przejmujesz się śmiercią innych: ich własna słabość sprowadziła na nich ten "
"los."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Echolocation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've learned how to hunt without sight.  Activate this mutation to make a "
"quiet chirp that can reveal obstacles and enemies by its echo."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scruffy Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've lost your fluffy undercoat for the summer.  This feels a lot better "
"in the heat, but it's less protective and looks a little bedraggled."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Small"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've noticeably shrunk in size.  You're able to move with increased "
"litheness, but your smaller stature prevents you from driving a car or "
"carrying as much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fruiting (picked)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've picked all your fruit and no longer have any, as such this mutation "
"is not supposed to be visible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fat Deposits"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've put on some additional weight around your body.  It slows you down a "
"little, but helps your swimming and warmth."
msgstr ""
"Odłożyłeś nieco dodatkowej masy wokół ciała. Nieco cię spowalnia, ale pomaga "
"w pływaniu i utrzymaniu ciepła."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chitin (Molted)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've recently molted, and your chitin exoskeleton is still soft and "
"vulnerable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flowering"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've started blooming where your scalp used to be.  Your blossoms have a "
"pleasant aroma, are visually striking, and are quite sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Wypuszczasz pąki tam gdzie miałeś skórę na głowie. Twoje kwiaty mają miły "
"zapach, są wizualnie uderzające i dość wrażliwe."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chloromorphosis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've truly become a walking plant, though you mostly feel like sleeping in "
"the sunshine.  When you do, your roots and bark will take in more nutrients "
"than ever."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lactose Intolerance"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You, like 75 percent of the world, cannot tolerate milk or milk based "
"products.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale "
"penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr ""
"Ty, jak i 75% reszty świata, nie tolerujesz mleka i produktów mlecznych. "
"Możesz je jeść, ale twoje morale ucierpi i otrzymasz z nich mniej wartości "
"odżywczych."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Numb"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your ability to feel or express emotion has been greatly hampered."
msgstr ""
"Twoja zdolność odczuwania lub wyrażania emocji została znacznie utrudniona."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unbreakable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your anatomy is specialized to endure physical punishment.  You have a 30% "
"bonus to all hit points."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers (Shed)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your antlers have shed for the season.  If you can see this, you're using "
"debug, or you've encountered a bug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "White Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Brown Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Blue Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Black Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#. ~ Description of variant "Bald Eagle Bird Wings" of mutation"Bird Wings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your arms have mostly transformed into a huge pair of feathered wings.  "
"Though you retain a few fingers, your fine manipulation is greatly "
"hampered.  On the other hand, you can glide from ledges and will take less "
"damage if you fall, provided you're healthy and unburdened."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feathered Arms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your arms have sprouted feathers, and you find you can no longer fully "
"extend your elbows.  This gets in the way a bit, but the feathers offer "
"minor protection from damage and the elements."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Appeal"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your attractiveness would be considered unremarkable by the average human."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Shifting Bark (Distributed)" to "BARK2_b"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Shifting Bark (Consolidated)" to "BARK2_c"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Shifting Bark (Latticed)" to "BARK2_a"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your bark ripples across your body, repositioning at a cellular level."
msgstr ""
"Kora rozchodzi się po całym ciele, zmieniając położenie na poziomie "
"komórkowym."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Incisors"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your big teeth have grown in.  Folks had best show some more respect."
msgstr ""
"Twoje wielkie zęby wrosły w skórę. Ludziska lepiej okażcie trochę szacunku."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infection Immune"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your bloodstream has developed antibiotic properties.  Your wounds will "
"never become infected."
msgstr ""
"Twój krwiobieg zyskał zdolności antybiotyczne. Twoje rany nigdy nie staną "
"się zainfekowane."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mutagenic Chaos"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body alters itself rapidly, and without your intervention or conscious "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało zmienia się gwałtownie i bez twojej interwencji lub świadomej "
"kontroli."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Frail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body breaks very easily.  Its maximum HP is 50% lower than usual.  Your "
"weakness is apparent and makes you less intimidating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flimsy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 25% lower than usual.  "
"Your weakness is apparent and makes you less intimidating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Albino"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body cannot produce melanin, leaving you extremely pale.  You sunburn "
"extremely easily, and typically use an umbrella and sunglasses when going "
"out in the sun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Thirst"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body dries out easily; you need to drink more water."
msgstr "Twoje ciało łatwo się odwadnia; musisz pić więcej wody."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Walker"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body excretes very fine amounts of a chemical which prevents you from "
"sticking to webs.  Walking through webs does not affect you at all."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało wydziela niewielkie ilości związku chemicznego zapobiegającego "
"przyklejaniu się do pajęczyn. Chodzenie wśród pajęczyn w ogóle na ciebie nie "
"wpływa."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyperalgesia"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body experiences pain out of proportion to the physical causes.  Pain "
"dealt to you is increased by 50%."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciała doświadcza nieproporcjonalnego bólu na fizyczne bodźce. Zadany "
"ci ból jest 50% silniejszy."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metabolic Rehydration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body gets everything it needs from the food that you eat!  You no "
"longer need hydration from fluids."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało otrzymuje wszystko, czego potrzebuje z jedzenia które jesz! Nie "
"musisz już pić płynów."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hirsute"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body hair is growing in thicker than it used to.  It's almost like "
"you're going through a second puberty."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ectothermic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body has become permanently cold-blooded.  Your speed lowers or raises "
"1% for every 2 (1.1) degrees below or above 65 F (18.3 C).  You eat much "
"less than you otherwise would."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało jest na stałe zimnokrwiste. Twoja szybkość maleje, bądź rośnie "
"na każde 2 stopnie Fahrenheita (1,1 stopnia Celsjusza) poniżej. lub powyżej "
"65 F (18,3 C). Jesz znacznie mniej niż w innym przypadku."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Severe Radioactivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit heavy levels of "
"radiation, making your surroundings unlivable."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało stało się radioaktywne! Stale emitujesz twarde promieniowanie, "
"które czyni twoje otoczenie niezdatnym do życia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Minor Radioactivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit low levels of "
"radiation, which slowly contaminates the world around you."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało stało się radioaktywne! Stale emitujesz niewielkie wartości "
"promieniowania, które wolno skażają świat wokół ciebie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radioactivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit moderate levels of "
"radiation, which contaminates the world around you."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało stało się radioaktywne! Stale emitujesz umiarkowane wartości "
"promieniowania, które skażają świat wokół ciebie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Acid Blood"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has developed a wonderful defense mechanism.  Instead of normal "
"blood, you bleed a strong molecular acid which will damage any creature "
"foolish enough to harm you."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało rozwinęło cudowny mechanizm obronny. Zamiast normalnej krwi, "
"krwawisz silnym molekularnym kwasem, który rani każde stworzenie na tyle "
"głupie, by cię skrzywdzić."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Resilient"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body has grown accustomed to physical trauma.  You get a 20% bonus to "
"all hit points."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slimy"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is coated with a fine slime which makes uncovered skin harder to "
"grab and helps protect you from acid.  Greatly increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crustacean Carapace"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is covered with a durable carapace.  In addition to powerful "
"physical protection, you are somewhat resistant to the harmful effects of "
"radiation.  It reduces dexterity by 2 and greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quills"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is covered with large quills.  Whenever an unarmed opponent "
"strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will "
"receive significant damage."
msgstr ""
"Twoją skórę porastają duże kolce. Jeżeli nieuzbrojony przeciwnik zaatakuje "
"wręcz nieosłonięte partie twojego ciała, otrzyma spore obrażenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spines"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is covered with sharp spines.  Whenever an unarmed opponent "
"strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will "
"receive moderate damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fragile"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body is extremely fragile.  Its maximum HP is 75% lower than usual.  "
"Your weakness is apparent and makes you less intimidating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mutagenic Adaptability"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is ideally suited to mutation.  Taking different kinds of mutagen "
"won't result in more negative mutations than normal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Omnicellular"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is more or less one consistent whole: a single, giant, omni-cell "
"that alters itself as needed."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało jest mniej więcej homogeniczną całością: pojedynczą, gigantyczną "
"omni-komórką, która przekształca samą siebie wedle potrzeb."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Raider"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is one with the night.  You make less noise when the moon is up in "
"the sky, even when you cannot see it."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało jest jednością z nocą. Robisz mniej hałasu, gdy księżyc jest na "
"niebie, nawet jeśli go nie widzisz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Disease Immune"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is simply immune to diseases.  You will never catch an ambient "
"disease."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało jest po prostu odporne na choroby. Nigdy nie złapiesz choroby z "
"otoczenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Disintegration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is slowly wasting away!"
msgstr "Twoje ciało powoli wyniszcza się!"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Parasite Immune"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is unusually inhospitable to parasitic lifeforms.  You will never "
"become infested with internal parasites."
msgstr ""
"Toje ciało jest niezwykle nieprzyjazne dla pasożytniczych form życia. Nigdy "
"nie zostaniesz zaatakowany przez żyjące wewnątrz organizmu pasożyty."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deterioration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is very slowly wasting away."
msgstr "Twoje ciało bardzo powoli wyniszcza się."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Venomous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces a venom which may aid you in combat, provided you have a "
"way to deliver it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Spinner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces and anchors webbing.  Too bad you can't seem to control "
"the process.  There is a chance that you will leave webs in your wake."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało produkuje i daje oparcie sieci pajęczej. Szkoda że nie "
"kontrolujesz tego procesu. Jest szansa na to, że pozostawisz za sobą "
"pajęczynę."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Alcohol Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces enzymes that process alcohol more quickly.  Sobering up "
"faster makes it less addictive, and you won't suffer as many negative health "
"effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mammal Pheromones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces low-level pheromones which put mammals at ease.  They "
"will be less likely to attack or flee from you."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało produkuje słabe feromony, które uspokajają ssaki. Będą rzadziej "
"atakować cię lub uciekać przed tobą."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Amphibian Pheromones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces low-level pheromones, identifying you as a friend to many "
"species of amphibian.  Amphibians will attack you much less."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało produkuje słabe feromony, identyfikujące cię jako przyjaciela "
"dla wielu gatunków płazów. Płazy będą atakować cię znacznie rzadziej."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Pheromones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces low-level pheromones, identifying you as a friend to many "
"species of insects.  Insects will attack you much less."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało produkuje słabe feromony, identyfikujące cię jako przyjaciela "
"dla wielu gatunków insektów. Owady będą atakować cię znaczniej rzadziej."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Hyperalgesia"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body reacts cripplingly to any source of pain.  Pain dealt to you is "
"doubled."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało reaguje paraliżująco na każde źródło bólu. Zadany ci ból jest "
"podwójnej siły."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Alpha Purity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body rejects the corruption of subhuman mutations.  You can no longer "
"gain mutations from any category other than Alpha, though purifier should "
"still work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyper-Metabolism: burning"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body steams as it burns calories to visibly regenerate at an "
"astonishing rate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Carnivore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's ability to digest fruits, vegetables, grains and nuts is "
"severely hampered.  You've largely lost your taste for everything but meat, "
"but your nutritional needs have largely adjusted to suit your new lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Herbivore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's ability to digest meat is severely hampered.  Eating meat has a "
"good chance of making you vomit it back up; even if you manage to keep it "
"down, its nutritional value is greatly reduced."
msgstr ""
"Twoja zdolność trawienia mięsa jest znacznie obniżona. Pożywianie się mięsem "
"może łatwo spowodować, że je zwrócisz; nawet, gdy je utrzymasz w żołądku, "
"jego wartość odżywcza będzie znacznie mniejsza."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Able Sleeper"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's demanding energy needs mean you can fall asleep just about "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Wymagające potrzeby energetyczne twojego ciała oznaczają, że możesz zasnąć "
"niemal wszędzie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Viscous"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's slime output has become sticky and gel-like, making uncovered "
"skin harder to grab and offering some protection from acid.  Greatly "
"increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dense Bones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your bones are particularly dense and durable.  Your tougher frame grants 5% "
"more HP and 15% more carry capacity plus bashing attacks injure you less, "
"but your higher weight makes attacking and moving 5% slower.  Also, dodging "
"and swimming are harder."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hollow Bones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your bones are very light, hollow and partially supported by a network of "
"air sacs connected to your lungs.  You are faster and recover stamina more "
"efficiently as a result, but are vulnerable to blunt force trauma and cannot "
"carry as much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Light Bones"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your bones are very light.  This enables you to move and attack more "
"quickly, but limits your weight capacity and makes you vulnerable to bashing "
"damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hunter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has a lot more in common with a predatory animal than a human, "
"making it easier to control misplaced reactions to the death of your prey.  "
"Additionally, combat skills, which you use to hunt, are easier to learn and "
"maintain."
msgstr ""
"Twój mózg ma więcej wspólnego z drapieżnym zwierzęciem niż z człowiekiem, "
"czyniąc niestosowne reakcje na śmierć ofiar łatwiejszymi do kontroli. "
"Ponadto umiejętności bojowe których używasz by polować są łatwiejsze do "
"zapamiętania i zachowania."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has caught up with your eyes.  You can see much better in the "
"dark, but sunlight seems much brighter now.  Activate to toggle NV-visible "
"areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"Twój mózg nadąża teraz za twoimi oczami. Widzisz lepiej w ciemności, ale "
"światło odbierasz jako o wiele jaśniejsze. Aktywuj, by widzieć lub ukryć "
"widziane w noktowizji obszary."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Distributed Neurology"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has evolved beyond human imagination.  You'll show them the REAL "
"meaning of 'gray goo'!"
msgstr ""
"Twój mózg ewoluował poza granice ludzkiej wyobraźni. Pokażesz im PRAWDZIWE "
"znaczenie „szarej materii”!"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bat Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your broad, pointed ears are like radar dishes.  You can hear even the "
"slightest sounds at great distance, and are less likely to be deafened by "
"loud noises."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bull Roids"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your bulk has rendered you a veritable living wall.  Be careful around water "
"though; while you're as sturdy as a rock, you'll sink like one too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Capabilities"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your capabilities are pretty normal."
msgstr "Twoje możliwości są całkiem normalne."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Huge"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your cardiovascular system has caught up with your muscular physique, so who "
"needs pathetic human cars?  Strength +4."
msgstr ""
"Twój układ sercowo-naczyniowy doścignął twoją muskularną fizjonomię, więc po "
"co komu te żałosne ludzkie samochody? Siła +4."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Furred Chitin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your chitin hair has thickened and spread across your body.  It provides a "
"bit of warmth and helps you sense nearby vibrations."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bloodfeeder"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your craving for blood borders on obsession.  You need the stuff too much to "
"care about whether it came from a human, and your body can filter out most "
"of the toxins in mutant blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burrowing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your dextrous paws and long teeth allow you to dig through dirt and rubble "
"with ease."
msgstr ""
"Twoje zręczne łapy i długie zęby pozwalają z łatwością przekopywać się przez "
"glebę i gruz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater Of The Dead"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestion has evolved further.  In addition to mutated meat, you can "
"also stomach the tainted and long-dead flesh of zombies… if you can stand "
"the taste, of course."
msgstr ""
"Twoje trawienie ewoluowało dalej. Poza zmutowanym mięsem możesz też zjadać "
"skażone i od dawna martwe mięso zombie… jeśli oczywiście możesz znieść jego "
"smak."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your digestive system and cardio health are standard for a human."
msgstr ""
"Twój układ trawienny i zdrowie układu krążenia są normalne dla człowieka."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ruminant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system is capable of digesting cellulose and other rough "
"plant material.  You can eat underbrush and shrubs by activating this, "
"standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr ""
"Twój system odżywczy jest zdolny trawić celulozę i inne twarde tkanki "
"roślinne. Możesz spożywać podszycie i krzaki aktywując to, stojąc nad celem "
"i naciskając E."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saprovore"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system is specialized to allow you to consume decaying "
"material.  You can eat rotten food, albeit for less nutrition than usual."
msgstr ""
"Twój układ trawienny wyspecjalizował się umożliwiając ci konsumpcję gnijącej "
"materii. Możesz jeść zepsutą żywność, aczkolwiek jest mniej pożywna niż "
"normalnie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rodent Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ears are huge, round, and gray!  They're rather fascinating, and help "
"you hear from a much greater distance."
msgstr ""
"Twoje uszy są duże, okrągłe i szare! Są dość fascynujące i pomagają ci "
"słyszeć z o wiele większej odległości"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ears have extended into long, pointed, velvety ones, like those of a "
"feline.  You find it easier to tune in on sounds from afar."
msgstr ""
"Twoje uszy zmieniły się w długie, szpiczaste i jedwabiste jak u kota. "
"Łatwiej ci wyławiać dźwięki z daleka."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ears have grown into tall and flexible rabbit ears.  They're are "
"slender and enhance your hearing beyond the normal range."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ursine Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ears have grown longer and rounder, much like those of a bear.  You can "
"hear things a little farther away."
msgstr ""
"Twoje uszy urosły i zaokrągliły się, jak u niedźwiedzia. Słyszysz dźwięki z "
"nieco dalszych odległości."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Stamina"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your energy to squash bugs is endless!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Summer Coat"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your entire body is covered in dense fur, but it's thinned out a bit for the "
"summer, which may provide some relief from the heat at the cost of physical "
"protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Epicuticle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your epidermis has turned into a thin, flexible layer of chitin.  It "
"provides decent physical protection.  Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Twój naskórek zamienił się w cienką, elastyczną warstwę chityny. Zapewnia "
"ona przyzwoitą ochronę fizyczną. Nieznacznie zmniejsza efekt wilgoci."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sores"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your extremities are covered in painful sores.  The pain is worse when they "
"are covered in clothing."
msgstr ""
"Twoje kończyny pokrywają bolesne wrzody. Ból jest intensywniejszy gdy są "
"zasłonięte ubraniem."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Muscle Consolidation"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your extremities have gained strength but lost fine motor skills.  -1 "
"Dexterity +2 Strength."
msgstr ""
"Twoje kończyny zyskały na sile, ale straciły zdolności motoryczne. -1 "
"zręczności, +2 siły."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Compound Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes are compound, like those of an insect.  This increases your "
"Perception by 2 whenever you aren't wearing eyewear."
msgstr ""
"Twoje oczy są złożone, jak u owadów. To zwiększa twoją percepcję o 2, jak "
"nie nosisz okularów."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Intermediate Eyestalks"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes barely protrude from your head on stalks, preventing the use of "
"any rigid eyewear.  On the plus side, you can have additional awareness, but "
"sometimes your vision goes wonky as your brain tries to process the new "
"angles.  Perception +1"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bulging Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes bulge out several inches from your skull.  This does not affect "
"your vision in any way."
msgstr ""
"Twoje oczy wystają kilka cali poza czaszkę. Nie wpływa to na twój wzrok w "
"żaden sposób."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infrared Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes have mutated to pick up radiation in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr ""
"Twoje oczy zmutowały i odbierają promieniowanie w spektrum podczerwieni."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have mutated, with a brilliant iris and slitted pupil similar to "
"that of a lizard.  This could help you lie or intimidate people, but on its "
"own it's not helping you see in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have mutated; now you have slit pupils, and they glitter in the "
"light, much like a cat's.  This could help you lie or intimidate people, but "
"on its own it's not helping you see in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fey Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have turned… green.  It's tough to tell the exact shade, as it "
"seems to shift.  The hypnotic effect almost passes for natural, and makes it "
"easier to lie or persuade others."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lidless Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes lack lids and are instead protected by a translucent scale that "
"shuts out irritants.  This will make it much easier to see underwater, and "
"to spot danger approaching even while you rest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eyestalks"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes protrude from your head on flexible tentacles, preventing the use "
"of any eyewear.  On the plus side, you can see in two directions at once, "
"and they automatically retract to reduce damage.  Perception +2"
msgstr ""
"Twoje oczy wystają z głowy na elastycznych mackach, uniemożliwiając "
"korzystanie z jakichkolwiek okularów. Na plus należy zaliczyć to, że możesz "
"widzieć w dwóch kierunkach jednocześnie i automatycznie się chowają, aby "
"zmniejszyć obrażenia. Percepcja +2"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snout"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face and jaw have begun… changing.  Masks and such fit OK, but you're "
"noticeably mutated."
msgstr ""
"Twoja twarz i szczęka zaczęły się… zmieniać. Maski itp. pasują, ale jesteś "
"zauważalnie zmutowany."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rodent Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face and jaw have extended, giving you an alert and attentive "
"appearance.  If you have a pair of matching incisors, you can bite harder "
"and faster than any human ever could."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dromeosaur Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face has drastically mutated, with the bones of your jaws having "
"extended forth into a long, tapered snout.  While modern-day gas masks "
"mostly don't account for paleobiology, if you manage to evolve a set of "
"fangs, you will bite with the ferocity of long-dead beasts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bovine Snout"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face resembles that of a bull, with a significant snout.  It looks "
"fearsome but makes it difficult to find gear that covers your face."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saber Teeth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fangs have grown extremely large and incredibly sharp.  They get in the "
"way of wearing masks and eating, but they can punch through even heavily "
"armored enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Webbed Feet"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your feet are heavily webbed, allowing you to swim faster if you aren't "
"wearing footwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hooves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your feet have fused into hooves.  This allows you to perform a powerful "
"kicking attack, provides natural armor, and removes the need to wear shoes; "
"however, you cannot wear normal shoes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hooked Toes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your feet have grown into strong, curved claws.  They won't fit into normal "
"shoes and are not much help in combat, but they allow you to climb most "
"vertical surfaces with ease.  You can even cling to walls you glide into!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Fingernails"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fingernails are long and sharp.  If you're barehanded and not wearing "
"gloves, you'll be able to fight with them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bovine Bulk"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh has become dense with fat and muscle.  This makes you harder to "
"take down, but also a poor swimmer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiophile"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh has developed a unique reaction to radiation that lets you sense "
"when ambient radiation is abnormally high.  Turn off to ignore messages."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Amorphous Body"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh is a pleasing gel-like consistency.  Your bodily functions seem "
"to be moving around, and your leg-equivalents flow comfortably - if a little "
"slower than your old meat-legs."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało ma przyjemną żelową konsystencję. Funkcje twojego ciała "
"przemieszczają się swobodnie, a ekwiwalenty nóg przyjemnie pływają - chociaż "
"trochę wolniej niż twoje stare, mięsiste nogi."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Toxic Flesh"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh is highly poisonous, and creatures that bite you will receive a "
"nasty surprise."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało jest wysoce trujące i stworzenia które cię ugryzą będą miały "
"niemiłą niespodziankę."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Regeneration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your flesh regenerates and your limbs mend incredibly quickly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Bow-legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your folded wings make it easy to crawl."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Subterranean Build"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your frame has adapted for life in confined spaces.  You seem a little "
"shorter and bulkier, trading mobility for muscle mass.  (+2 Strength, -2 "
"Dexterity)"
msgstr ""
"Twoja budowa ciała zaadaptowała się do życia w ciasnych przestrzeniach. "
"Jesteś nieco niższy i tęższy, zamieniając mobilność na masę mięśniową. (Siła "
"+2; zręczność -2)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shaggy Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fur has grown out and thickened, providing great protection from "
"attacks as well as considerable insulation."
msgstr ""
"Twoje futro rozrosło się i zgrubiało, zapewniając świetną ochronę przed "
"atakami, jak i przyzwoitą izolację."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lynx Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fur has grown out significantly around your cheeks and neck, providing "
"excellent protection from attacks."
msgstr ""
"Twoje futro rozrosło się znacznie w okolicy policzków i szyi, zapewniając "
"doskonałą ochronę przed atakami."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Fur"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fur keeps you covered in winter, maintaining heat and allowing you to "
"better tolerate cold temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Twoje futro okrywa cię w zimie, utrzymując ciepło i pozwalając ci lepiej "
"znosić niskie temperatury."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Freshwater Osmosis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your gills and skin are highly permeable to moisture, and you can hydrate "
"your body through osmosis.  While submerged in fresh water, any thirst you "
"might have will be slaked."
msgstr ""
"Twoje skrzela i skóra są wysoce przenikliwe dla wilgoci, i możesz nawadniać "
"ciało w drodze osmozy. Będąc zanurzonym w słodkiej wodzie, doskwierające ci "
"pragnienie zostanie zaspokojone."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Potent Venom"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your glands swell with deadly venom.  Hopefully your fangs are big enough to "
"deliver it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Intestinal Fortitude"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your guts have developed the ability to handle the toxic elements of mutated "
"flesh.  Mostly."
msgstr ""
"Twoje kiszki rozwinęły zdolność radzenia sobie z toksycznymi czynnikami "
"zmutowanego ciała. W większości."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Webbed Hands"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands are heavily webbed, which significantly improves your ability to "
"swim, but makes manipulation more difficult and prevents wearing many kinds "
"of gloves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Little Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands have elongated and look a bit more like paws.  It makes fine "
"manipulation a little more difficult, but you can still probably manage.  "
"Plus, they allow you to move on all fours when crouching and unarmed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands have fused into quasi-paws.  Fine manipulation is a challenge: "
"permanent hand encumbrance of 10, difficulty with delicate craftwork, and "
"your gloves don't fit.  But they handle water better and bear weight well, "
"allowing you to move on all fours when crouching and unarmed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Autumn Foliage"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your head and upper limbs are covered in beautiful autumn leaves.  If "
"they're uncovered you'll still be able to photosynthesize, but not as well "
"as in the warmer months.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Glass Jaw"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your head can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 20% lower than usual.  "
"Your apparent fragility makes you less intimidating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blooming Roses"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your head is crowned with radiant flowers that spread their petals wide.  "
"The dizzying fragrance attracts people and pollinators alike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Slow Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your health recovery is severely impaired.  Your HP whilst asleep, as well "
"as your broken limbs, heal at 33% of the regular rate."
msgstr ""
"Twoja regeneracja zdrowia jest poważnie osłabiona. Twoje HP podczas snu, a "
"także złamane kończyny leczą się w 33% normalnego tempa."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lupine Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hearing has evolved further and is now on par with that of wolves.  You "
"can hear things significantly farther away."
msgstr ""
"Twój słuch ulepszył się jeszcze bardziej, dorównując wilczemu. Słyszysz ze "
"znacznie dalszych odległości."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Good Hearing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hearing is better than average, and you can hear distant sounds more "
"easily."
msgstr "Masz ponadprzeciętny słuch i łatwiej ci usłyszeć dalekie odgłosy."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Poor Hearing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hearing is poor, and you may not hear quiet or far-off noises."
msgstr ""
"Twój słuch jest słaby i możesz nie usłyszeć cichych lub odległych dźwięków."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyperactive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your heartbeat is so rapid, it sometimes feels like it's vibrating in your "
"chest.  Your fitness and stamina are greatly improved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scuttle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hook-shaped feet curl inward to grip the ground, allowing you to easily "
"walk along the bottom when you're underwater.  They're also a bit quicker at "
"climbing over obstacles, even on dry land."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Frog Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your huge, bulging eyes are great at tracking movement even underwater, and "
"you have a transparent third eyelid that allows you to sleep with your eyes "
"open."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Hyper-Metabolism: burning" to "EATHEALTH"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hyper-metabolism slows down."
msgstr "Twój hipermetabolizm zwalnia."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Hyper-Metabolism" to "EATHEALTH_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hyper-metabolism starts burning up calories."
msgstr "Twój hipermetabolizm zaczyna spalać kalorie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Immunity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your immune system is more or less normal for a human."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infection Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your immune system is particularly good at resisting infections.  You have "
"an increased chance for dirty wounds and infections to recover on their own, "
"and suffer reduced penalties from them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ursine Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your jaw and nose have extended into a bearish muzzle, which interferes with "
"most face-covering gear.  If you have a set of fangs, this will greatly "
"improve their effectiveness against downed enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lupine Muzzle"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your jaw and nose have extended into a wolfish muzzle, making it difficult "
"to find masks that fit.  If you have a set of fangs, you'll be able to trip "
"most enemies in combat by biting them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Knees"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your knees are strong and capable of angles that you couldn't imagine "
"previously.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down less than normal."
msgstr ""
"Twoje kolana są mocne i zdolne do poruszania się pod kątami, których "
"wcześniej nie można było sobie wyobrazić. Poruszanie się po nierównym "
"terenie spowolni cię mniej niż zwykle."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Verdant Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your leaves are vibrant, large, and green, and have become a major source of "
"nutrients for your body.  Whenever your arms and head are uncovered you will "
"gain a large amount of nutrients by standing in the sunlight.  Reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Twoje liście są żywe, duże i zielone i stały się głównym źródłem pożywienia "
"dla twojego organizmu. Gdy twoje ręce i głowa są odsłonięte, zyskasz dużą "
"ilość pożywienia, stojąc na słońcu. Redukuje efekty przemoczenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lush Leaves"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your leaves have grown in size and prominence, with additional leaves "
"sprouting along your arms.  While your arms and head are uncovered, you will "
"photosynthesize nutrients while in sunlight.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Twoje liście urosły i są bardziej widoczne, z dodatkowymi liśćmi "
"wyrastającymi wzdłuż twoich rąk. Gdy twoje ręce i głowa są odsłonięte, "
"będziesz fotosyntetyzować składniki odżywcze w słońcu. Redukuje efekty "
"przemoczenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Avian Leap"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have become bird-like; digitigrade with scaly skin and "
"grasping claws arranged three ahead and one behind.  They're perfect "
"gripping onto precarious perches, or for making a long-ranged leap attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Roadrunner"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your legs are extremely limber and fast-moving.  You can walk and run 30% "
"faster on flat surfaces."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your legs have gained muscle mass to propel you across any terrain."
msgstr ""
"Twoje nogi nabrały masy mięśniowej, która pozwoli ci poruszać się po każdym "
"terenie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leg Tentacles"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your legs have transformed into six tentacles.  This decreases your speed on "
"land by 20%, makes your movement silent, increases your swimming speed and "
"reduces wet penalties, but you can't use footwear any more."
msgstr ""
"Twoje nogi zmieniły się w sześć macek. To zmniejsza twoją prędkość na lądzie "
"o 20%, czyni twoje ruchy cichymi, zwiększa prędkość pływania i redukuje kary "
"za przemoczenie, ale nie możesz już używać obuwia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rubbery Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your limbs are significantly more flexible than any pathetic human arm or "
"leg.  +3 Dexterity, -2 Strength."
msgstr ""
"Twoje kończyny są znacznie bardziej elastyczne niż każda żałosna ręka czy "
"noga przeciętnego człowieka. Zręczność +3, siła -2."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stretchy Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your limbs seem to have a little more 'give' to them.  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Twoje kończyny najwyraźniej potrafią się nieco bardziej zginać i rozciągać. "
"Zręczność +1."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tentacle Bracing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your lower arms have developed strong suckers, perfect for walking along "
"lake beds and ocean floors.  They make land movement marginally more tiring, "
"but do a good job of keeping you set in place."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bow-legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your lower limbs have shortened and splayed, slowing your bipedal movement.  "
"As long as you're not wielding anything and you've got both wings, you're "
"able to crawl quickly and quietly when you run or crouch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Light Eater"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your metabolism is a little slower, and you require less food than most."
msgstr "Masz wolniejszy metabolizm i nie potrzebujesz tyle jedzenia co inni."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Mind"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mind and brain chemistry are not mutated."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Apex Predator"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mind and brain have adapted to your new place in the world: as one on "
"top of the food chain.  You can effortlessly master and maintain combat "
"skills, but your critical thinking has atrophied further."
msgstr ""
"Twoja umysłowość i mózg zaadaptowały się do twojego nowego miejsca w "
"świecie: na szczycie łańcucha pokarmowego. Bez wysiłku osiągasz mistrzostwo "
"i doskonałą pamięć umiejętności bojowych, lecz zdolność krytycznego myślenia "
"uległa dalszej atrofii."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mood Swings"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your morale will shift up and down at random, often dramatically.  Lithium "
"tablets can reduce the severity of this disorder."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Proboscis"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mouth is now a long, flexible tube.  You can no longer consume solid "
"food and must find liquid nourishment instead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quick"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your movement and reaction speed are heightened.  You move and act 10% "
"faster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Acidic Secretion"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mucus has developed an acidic component that seems to soften your prey "
"up."
msgstr ""
"W twoim śluzie pojawił się kwaśny składnik, który wydaje się zmiękczać twoją "
"ofiarę."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Dependent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of "
"your speed for every 5 (2.8) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  This sluggishness "
"helps you conserve energy, however."
msgstr ""
"Twoje reakcje mięśniowe są zależne od otaczającej temperatury. Tracisz 1% "
"szybkości na każde 5 stopni Fahrenheita (2,8 stopnia Celsjusza) poniżej 65 F "
"(18,3 C). Ta ospałość pozwala ci jednak w zachowaniu energii."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Heat Dependent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is highly dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose "
"1% of your speed for every 3 (1.7) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), but your "
"slow metabolism requires much less energy."
msgstr ""
"Twoje reakcje mięśniowe są bardzo zależne od otaczającej temperatury. "
"Tracisz 1% szybkości na każde 3 stopnie Fahrenheita (1,7 stopni Celsjusza) "
"poniżej 65 F (18,3 C), lecz twój wolny metabolizm wymaga mniejszych ilości "
"energii."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are a little stronger.  +1 Strength."
msgstr "Twoje mięśnie są nieco silniejsze. +1 siły."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are much stronger.  +4 Strength."
msgstr "Twoje mięśnie są znacznie silniejsze. +4 siły."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insanely Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are noticeably bulging.  +7 Strength."
msgstr "Twoje mięśnie są jak bochny chleba. +7 siły."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Strength"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are perfectly developed."
msgstr "Twoje mięśnie są doskonale ukształtowane."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Strong"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are stronger.  +2 Strength."
msgstr "Twoje mięśnie są silniejsze. +2 siły."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Flexibility"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your muscles, joints, and the movement center of your brain have changed "
"internally somewhat, allowing you to traverse obstacles with ease."
msgstr ""
"Twoje mięśnie, stawy i centrum ruchu w mózgu zmieniły się nieco wewnętrznie, "
"pozwalając ci z łatwością pokonywać przeszkody."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Acidproof"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mutated flesh is immune to the damaging effects of acid."
msgstr "Twoje zmutowane ciało jest odporne na szkodliwe efekty kwasu."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaf Nose"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your nose is upturned, ridged and flared out into a leaf shape that humans "
"will likely find unsightly.  On the plus side, thermoreceptors in your "
"nostrils allow you to smell heat as long as you can breathe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your optic nerves and brain caught up with your eyes.  Now you can see "
"pretty well at night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thermal Vision"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your optic nerves and brain have mutated to catch up with your eyes, "
"allowing you to see in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr ""
"Twoje nery optyczne i mózg zmutowały w ślad za oczami, pozwalając ci widzieć "
"w spektrum podczerwieni."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hyper-Metabolism"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your particular metabolism allows you to burn calories at a prodigious rate "
"to regenerate tissues in a matter of hours; this is, however, a very "
"wasteful process.  Activate to start healing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Broad Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your paws are much larger now.  They help you swim, and you can crawl around "
"easily if you crouch with your hands free, but they're a real impediment to "
"crafting and fine manipulation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Broad Paws"
#. ~ Trigger message of mutation "Little Paws"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your paws make it easier to crawl on all fours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Photophore (on)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your photophore is glowing softly."
msgstr "Twoje fotofory świecą delikatnie."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Weak Photophore" to "BIOLUM1_active"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Photophore" to "BIOLUM2_active"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your photophore starts glowing."
msgstr "Twoje fotofory zaczynają świecić."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Weak Photophore (on)" to "BIOLUM1"
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Photophore (on)" to "BIOLUM2"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your photophore stops glowing."
msgstr "Twoje fotofory zaczynają świecić."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Indefatigable"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your powerful heart delivers oxygen to your cells with greater than human "
"efficiency, improving your fitness and stamina."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Raptor Leap"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your powerful legs allow you to perform a long distance leap attack with "
"your talons out in front, a great way to strike at prey or get away from "
"something larger."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nacreous Shell"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your protective shell has developed increased strength and hardness and a "
"mother of pearl sheen."
msgstr ""
"Twoja ochronna powłoka rozwinęła zwiększoną wytrzymałość i twardość oraz "
"perłowy połysk."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Roomy Shell"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your protective shell has grown large enough to accommodate--if need be--"
"your whole body.  Activate to pull your head and limbs into your shell, "
"trading mobility and vision for warmth and shelter."
msgstr ""
"Twoja ochronna skorupa rozrosła się na tyle, by pomieścić - gdy trzeba - "
"całe twoje ciało. Aktywuj, by wciągnąć głowę i kończyny w skorupę, zyskując "
"ciepłe schronienie w zamian za mobilność i zdolność obserwacji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pseudolimbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your pseudopod-like limbs can fit into anything!  You also suffer reduced "
"penalties to attacking while prone.  +4 Dexterity, -4 Strength."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cephalopod Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your pupils have widened into horizontal squiggles.  Seeing underwater is no "
"problem, and your ability to see in the dark is significantly improved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Healing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your rate of healing speeds up dramatically so long as your body is kept at "
"or above room temperature, allowing even broken limbs to recover in record "
"time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Giant Pincer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your right hand has become a crab claw.  It encumbers you greatly, but you "
"can use it while grappling to deal massive damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bloodletter"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your saliva contains powerful anticoagulants.  If you have a bite attack, it "
"will prolong the bleeding of most animals, including humans and the undead.  "
"It may be less effective against insects and stranger creatures."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Scent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your scent is particularly strong.  It's not offensive to humans, but "
"animals that track your scent will do so more easily."
msgstr ""
"Twój zapach jest wyjątkowo silny. Nie jest drażniący dla ludzkiego nosa, ale "
"zwierzęta mogą wyczuć cię z łatwością."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Scent"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your scent is quite weak.  Animals that track your scent will do so with "
"more difficulty."
msgstr ""
"Twój zapach ma niską intensywność. Zwierzęta, które wyczuwają cię po zapachu "
"będą miały utrudnione zadanie. "

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sensory Disintegration"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your sense organs are all over the place: eyes extending and retracting, "
"'ears' of various shapes migrating about, and taste & smell are "
"uncontrollable.  The world is a horrible mixup.  Ugh!"
msgstr ""
"Twoje organy zmysłów rozlazły się tu i ówdzie; oczy wyciągają się i chowają, "
"„uszy” różnych kształtów migrują swobodnie, a zmysły smaku i zapachu są poza "
"twoja kontrolą. Świat jest straszliwą sieczką. Uch!"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are a little keener.  +1 Perception."
msgstr "Twoje zmysły są nieco wyostrzone. +1 percepcji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are keener.  +2 Perception."
msgstr "Twoje zmysły są wyostrzone. +2 percepcji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Prime Perception"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are keenly honed."
msgstr "Twoje zmysły osiągnęły doskonałą ostrość."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Perceptive"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are much keener.  +4 Perception."
msgstr "Twoje zmysły są bardzo wyostrzone. +4 percepcji."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Drill Beak"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your sharp, pointed beak can peck holes in solid wood.  You'll sometimes use "
"this against your enemies, especially while grappling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has grown thick and leathery and a set of heavy green scales has "
"grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  Further, bony "
"scutes cover your extremities, offering additional protection there.  While "
"difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces "
"wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smooth Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has lost some of its color and taken on a smooth, papery texture.  "
"This slightly reduces wet effects, but also makes you a little more "
"vulnerable to cuts and scrapes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Patchwork Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has mutated into an amalgamation of thickened fur, scales, and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Twoja skóra zmutowała się w połączenie zgrubiałego futra, łusek i innych "
"elementów."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sparse Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has toughened and grown thin, flexible scales in some places, "
"acting as natural armor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scales"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has toughened further and your scales have grown to cover most of "
"your body.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Protective Bark"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is coated in a light bark, like that of a tree.  This provides "
"powerful armor and makes you nearly waterproof."
msgstr ""
"Twoja skóra pokryta jest jasną korą, podobną do kory drzewa. Stanowi ona "
"potężną zbroję i sprawia, że prawie nie przepuszczasz wody."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spots"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is covered in a pattern of red spots."
msgstr "Twoja skóra jest pokryta we wzory z czerwonych kropek."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Colorful Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is covered in shifting patterns of dots, lines, and swirls.  This "
"is outside of your control and does not help your stealth.  In fact, it "
"makes you more noticeable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thorns"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is covered in small, woody thorns.  Whenever an unarmed opponent "
"strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will "
"receive minor damage.  Your punches may also deal extra damage."
msgstr ""
"Twoją skórę porastają małe, drewniane ciernie. Jeżeli nieuzbrojony "
"przeciwnik zaatakuje wręcz nieosłonięte partie twojego ciała, otrzyma "
"niewielkie obrażenia. Twoje pięści mogą także zadać dodatkowe obrażenia."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thin-Skinned"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is fragile and slightly vulnerable to cutting and stabbing attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Phelloderm"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is light green and has a slightly woody quality to it.  This "
"provides armor and helps you retain moisture, resulting in less thirst.  "
"Greatly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Twoja skóra jest jasnozielona i ma lekko drewniany wygląd. Zapewnia ona "
"pancerz i pomaga zatrzymywać wilgoć, dzięki czemu mniej odczuwasz "
"pragnienie. Znacznie zmniejsza kary za przemoknięcie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pale Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is rather pale."
msgstr "Twoja skóra jest raczej blada."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick-Skinned"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is tough.  Cutting and bashing damage is slightly reduced for "
"you.  There's a small chance you don't cut yourself on sharp terrain."
msgstr ""
"Twoja skóra jest twarda. Obrażenia cięte i miażdżące są u ciebie lekko "
"zredukowane. Jest mała szansa, że nie potniesz się na ostrym terenie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Peeling Skin"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin keeps peeling in big flakes, like you're recovering from a bad "
"sunburn.  Oddly, it doesn't hurt at all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Sensitivity"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin simply cannot handle ultraviolet radiation, such as sunlight.  It "
"will seriously burn you."
msgstr ""
"Twoja skóra po prostu nie radzi sobie z promieniowaniem UV, jak np. światło "
"słoneczne. Poważnie cię poparzy."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gorger"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your stomach can expand quite a bit.  This comes in handy as you tend to "
"swallow food whole."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rabbit Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your stubby tail has become fuzzy and more round, but doesn't seem to serve "
"any purpose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiogenic"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your system has adapted to radiation.  While irradiated, you will actually "
"heal slowly, converting the radiation into hit points."
msgstr ""
"Twój organizm zaadaptował się do promieniowania. Do tego stopnia, że gdy "
"jesteś napromieniowany to powoli się leczysz, przekształcając "
"promieniotwórczość w zdrowie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Poison Resistant"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your system is rather tolerant of poisons and toxins, and most will affect "
"you less."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ciało jest bardziej odporne na trucizny i toksyny, więc większość "
"będzie miała na ciebie słabsze działanie."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampire Fangs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your teeth are so sharp, you can use them to shave the fur from your victims "
"before you feed.  What's more, anticoagulants in your saliva will keep their "
"blood flowing long after it should have clotted."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shark Teeth"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your teeth have grown incredibly sharp, and have calcified even further.  In "
"addition to letting you eat much faster, you can use them as a lethal "
"natural weapon, especially in deep water."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fangs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your teeth have grown into long, sharp fangs.  If your mouth is uncovered, "
"you'll sometimes bite your enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human ACCLIMATIZATION"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your temperature tolerance is more or less normal for a human."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Toe Roots"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your toes have grown wriggly, and you can't imagine why you wear that stuff "
"on your feet.  Take it off.  It's in the way."
msgstr ""
"Twoje palce u nóg są teraz wijące i nie potrafisz wyobrazić sobie powodu dla "
"którego nosisz te rzeczy na stopach. Ściągnij je, zawadzają."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Barbed Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your tongue can extend halfway to the ground.  It's lined with jagged little "
"teeth, and its spearlike tip can stab with shocking force."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Harpoon Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your tongue can extend much farther and faster, propelled by incredible "
"hydrostatic pressue.  Activate this mutation to harpoon enemies and drag "
"them into melee range."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Whipping Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your tongue can extend quite some distance and its tip is incredibly "
"sticky.  It's not the best for talking, but you may use it to snare "
"creatures and pull them towards you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lolling Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your tongue has lengthened and often extends far beyond your mouth.  This "
"makes you a little worse at talking to people."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Forked Tongue"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your tongue is forked, like that of a reptile.  It softens your inflection, "
"making lying a little easier."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burrowing"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tough paws allow you to dig through dirt and rubble with ease."
msgstr ""
"Twoje twarde łapy pozwalają z łatwością przekopywać się przez glebę i gruz."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pointed Ears"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your upper earlobes have grown noticeably higher.  Fortunately, they don't "
"get in the way of your headgear, much.  Unfortunately, they also don't seem "
"to help your hearing any."
msgstr ""
"Twoje górne płatki uszne wyrosły znacznie wyżej. Szczęśliwie nie wchodzą w "
"drogę nakryciom głowy. Niestety nie wygląda też na to, żeby usprawniały twój "
"słuch."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Grotesque"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your visage is disgusting and liable to induce vomiting.  People will not "
"want to interact with you unless they have a very good reason to."
msgstr ""
"Twoje oblicze jest obrzydliwe i może wywoływać wymioty. Ludzie nie będą "
"chcieli mieć z tobą kontaktu, chyba że z bardzo ważnej przyczyny."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Avian Eyes"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your vision has become particularly acute: you suspect you could pick out "
"zombies much farther away.  Perception +4."
msgstr ""
"Twój wzrok się znacznie wyostrzył: podejrzewasz że można by zdejmować zombie "
"ze znacznie większego dystansu. Percepcja +4."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your voice doesn't sound especially abnormal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Screeching Voice"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your voice sounds like a bird trying to imitate a human.  It makes it harder "
"to lie, threaten, or convince anyone of anything."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shifting Bark (Consolidated)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your warped bark can be shifted in function, and is currently consolidated "
"on your torso.  Activate to shift your bark into a lattice, increasing bulk "
"but providing better protection for the entire body."
msgstr ""
"Twoja spaczona kora może zostać przesunięta w funkcji i obecnie jest "
"skonsolidowana na twoim tułowiu. Aktywuj, by przekształcić korę w kratę, "
"zwiększając jej objętość, ale zapewniając lepszą ochronę całego ciała."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shifting Bark (Latticed)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your warped bark can be shifted in function, and is currently expanded into "
"a sturdy lattice.  Activate to collapse the lattice, returning to an evenly "
"distributed form."
msgstr ""
"Twoja wypaczona kora może zmieniać swoje funkcje, a obecnie jest rozbudowana "
"w solidną kratę. Aktywuj ją, aby ją zwinąć i powrócić do równomiernie "
"rozłożonej formy."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shifting Bark (Distributed)"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your warped bark can be shifted in function, and is currently spread "
"evenly.  Activate to better protect your torso, at the cost of other areas."
msgstr ""
"Twoja spaczona kora może zostać przesunięta w funkcji, a obecnie jest "
"rozłożona równomiernie. Aktywuj ją, by lepiej chronić swój tors, kosztem "
"innych obszarów."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Web Diver"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your webbing is strong enough to support your weight.  Activate to rappel "
"down any drop you encounter, at the cost of nutrition."
msgstr ""
"Twoje pajęczyny są wystarczająco mocne, by utrzymać twoją wagę. Aktywuj, by "
"zjechać z każdej napotkanej wysokości, kosztem pożywienia."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Insect Wings (Buzzing)" to "WINGS_INSECT"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your wings go still."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fast Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your wounds and broken limbs heal quicker than usual."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Fast Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your wounds and broken limbs heal very quickly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Healer"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your wounds heal a little slower than most.  Your HP whilst asleep, as well "
"as your broken limbs, heal at 75% of the regular rate."
msgstr ""
"Twoje rany goją się trochę wolniej niż u większości. Twoje HP podczas snu, a "
"także złamane kończyny leczą się w 75% normalnego tempa."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Freedom fighter"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> believes in fighting… mostly for others, even at risk to their "
"own wellbeing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scrooge"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> collects trash like a RPG protagonist collects potions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Coward"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> flinches at the thought of fighting, whether it be other people "
"or the undead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Craven"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> is afraid of the dark, spiders, and unexplained sounds.  So are "
"you, but only because you've lived through the apocalypse.  <npc_name> has "
"always been like this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hero"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> is an ideal ally to those they call friend, always willing to "
"help others."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Survivor at any cost"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> is certainly a survivor.  You can only wonder how many they've "
"abandoned to save themself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Volatile"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> is just looking for an excuse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Kind"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid "<npc_name> just wants to help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Brave"
#: data/json/mutations/npc_personality.json
msgid ""
