msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"My evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of "
"dogs.  I took out a few with a plank, but pretty quick I realized it was "
"either head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
msgid ""
"Okay listen.  Don't believe that government stuff.  There's a common thread "
"to all of it: the riots, the military failing to contain it, even the giant "
"monsters they said were appearing in the last few days and had to be wiped "
"out with nukes."
msgstr ""
"Dobra, słuchaj. Nie wierz w te rządowe bzdury. To wszystko ma wspólny wątek: "
"zamieszki, wojsko nie potrafiące ich opanować, nawet gigantyczne potwory, "
"które pojawiły się w ciągu ostatnich kilku dni i musiały zostać zniszczone "
"za pomocą atomówek."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
msgid "Right.  Sorry."
msgstr "No tak. Wybacz."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
msgid "Sorry.  Could you tell me more about them?"
msgstr "Wybacz. Możesz mi więcej o nich powiedzieć?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
