#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "How 'bout you <swear> hand it over and I don't get <swear> pissed off?"
msgstr ""
"A może powiedzmy, że ty <swear> oddasz to a ja się <swear> nie wkurwię?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
msgid "Nice try.  You want the maps, you pay up."
msgstr "Nie ze mną te numery. Chcesz mapy, dawaj forsę."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
