msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well when the riots got worse, or I guess before that, we were all run "
"pretty ragged.  Lots of car crashes, uh, violence, which is weird thinking "
"about it now.  The hospitals were filling up, but not 'cause of a pandemic, "
"not like COVID anyway.  Everybody was just running wild, beating on each "
"other, shootouts.  The hospital looked like Fallujah or something, everyone "
"all banged up, bleeding out in the waiting rooms.  Then there wasn't any "
"more room, and they didn't have time to start burying dead people before "
"they started getting back up…  So the army rolled in with like, jeeps and a "
"tank and everything.  Took over the whole operation.  A lot more people died."
msgstr ""

