#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "At least we've got shelter."
msgstr "Przynajmniej mamy schronienie."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr "Doskonale!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm holding a thermal detonator!"
msgstr "Ponieważ trzymam detonator termiczny!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm your friend!"
msgstr "Ponieważ jestem twoim przyjacielem."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Don't try and talk yourself out of this, drop it now."
msgstr "Nie próbuj się z tego wykręcić, rzuć to natychmiast."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Eh, never mind."
msgstr "Ech, nieważne."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "W porządku."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Focus on the road, mate!"
msgstr "Skup się na drodze, kolego!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it to me, or else!"
msgstr "Daj mi to, albo!…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "Dobrze. Coś jeszcze…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Hmm, okay."
msgstr "Hmmm, okej."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "How much further?"
msgstr "Daleko jeszcze?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can keep you safe."
msgstr "Mogę zapewnić ci bezpieczeństwo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I don't know, look for supplies and other survivors I guess."
msgstr "Nie wiem, poszukaj zapasów lub innych ocalonych, jak myślę."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I don't think it's safe enough to do any teaching here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for not telling you."
msgstr "Mam swoje powody by ci nie mówić."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I need you to come with me."
msgstr "Chcę żebyś poszedł ze mną."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I really don't feel comfortable doing so…"
msgstr "Naprawdę nie czuję się z tym komfortowo…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I suppose getting a car up and running would be really be useful if we have "
"to move."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I understand…"
msgstr "Rozumiem…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I would prefer not to."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd like to lead for a while."
msgstr "Chciałbym poprowadzić przez pewien czas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give it back!"
msgstr "Zwrócę to z powrotem!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give you some space."
msgstr "Dam ci trochę przestrzeni."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll kill you if you don't."
msgstr "W przeciwnym wypadku cię zabiję."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm driving here!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm on watch."
msgstr "Stoję na straży."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  Look, I already dropped it, okay?"
msgstr "Przepraszam. Patrz, już to odłożyłem, okej?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay <topic_item_price> per batch for a total of "
"<topic_item_your_total_price>."
msgstr ""
"Zapłacę <topic_item_price> za zestaw, co razem daje "
"<topic_item_your_total_price>."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Just this once, you can keep it.  Don't tell anyone else."
msgstr "Wyjątkowo tym razem możesz to zatrzymać. Nie mów o tym nikomu."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Let's see…"
msgstr "Zobaczmy…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Let's talk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Look, I really need this.  Please let me have it."
msgstr "Słuchaj, naprawdę tego potrzebuję. Pozwól mi to wziąć."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "Może później."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Maybe we should start boarding up this place."
msgstr "Może powinniśmy zabić to miejsce dechami."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Never mind, I'll do without.  Bye."
msgstr "Nieważne, obejdę się. Żegnaj."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, I'm keeping it.  Try and take it off me, I dare you."
msgstr "Nie, zatrzymam to sobie. A spróbuj tylko to wziąć to ode mnie."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not a chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, I'm dropping it…"
msgstr "Okej, zostawiam to…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine, bye."
msgstr "Okej, niech będzie, żegnaj!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr "Okej, w porządku."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, here you go."
msgstr "Okej, proszę bardzo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's go!"
msgstr "Okej, ruszajmy!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, sorry."
msgstr "Okej, okej, przepraszam."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, this is all a misunderstanding.  Sorry, I'll drop it now."
msgstr "Okej, okej, to nieporozumienie. Wybacz, już to odkładam."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "Okej, okej."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Okej."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "Po zastanowieniu się, jednak nieważne."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Pleasure doing business!"
msgstr "Miło było robić interesy!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right, right, I'll ask later."
msgstr "Dobrze, dobrze, potem zapytam."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right… I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "Jasne… Nie szukam kłopotów."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "See you around."
msgstr "Do zobaczenia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Seriously, give me more stuff!"
msgstr "Serio, daj mi więcej rzeczy!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Smart choice."
msgstr "Mądry wybór."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Step aside.  I'm leader now."
msgstr "Z drogi. Teraz ja dowodzę."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "Dzięki!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!  But can I have some more?"
msgstr "Dziękuję! Czy mogę jeszcze więcej?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks, see you later!"
msgstr "Dziękuję, do zobaczenia!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Dzięki."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Understood.  I'll get those antibiotics."
msgstr "Zrozumiałem. Przyniosę te antybiotyki."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Want to share some useful items with me?"
msgstr "Chcesz się podzielić jakimś użytecznym sprzętem?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Want to travel with me?"
msgstr "Chcesz podróżować ze mną?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We could look for a farm.  They should have food and tools, and they aren't "
"close to cities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We should probably stay away from cities, even if they have lots of supplies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I am helping you out…"
msgstr "Cóż, przecież ci pomagam…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us."
msgstr "Cóż, myślę, że tylko my zostaliśmy."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "O co chodzi?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr "Co teraz zrobimy?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What, this?  It's not the same one, you are mistaken."
msgstr "Co, to? Mylisz się, to inny egzemplarz."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I share my equipment with you?"
msgstr "Czemu mam się dzielić ekwipunkiem?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I travel with you?"
msgstr "Czemu mam z tobą podróżować?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "Dla mnie bomba."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Yeah… I don't think so."
msgstr "Taaak… nie sądzę."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You can keep me safe."
msgstr "Możesz zapewnić mi bezpieczeństwo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You got it, I'm with you!"
msgstr "Rozumiem, jestem z tobą!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You might be seeing more of me…"
msgstr "Jeszcze mnie zobaczysz…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You picked up something that does not belong to you…"
msgstr "Wziąłeś coś co nie należy do ciebie…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "<chitchat_player_responses>"
msgstr "<chitchat_player_responses>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr ""
"Jesteś pewien? To nie wygląda na zbyt bezpieczne miejsce na plotkowanie…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr ""
"Jesteś pewien? To nie wygląda na zbyt bezpieczne miejsce na plotkowanie…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr ""
"Jesteś pewien? To nie wygląda na zbyt bezpieczne miejsce na plotkowanie…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Good point, let's find a more appropriate place."
msgstr "Słuszna uwaga, znajdźmy lepsze miejsce."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "It's fine, we've got a moment."
msgstr "W porządku, mamy chwile."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "What did you want to talk about?"
msgstr "O czym chciałeś pogadać?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "You're right.  Forget I said anything, let's get moving."
msgstr "Racja, Zapomnij, że o tym wspomniałem, ruszajmy dalej."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"--ACCESS GRANTED--\n"
"Mission Complete!"
msgstr ""
"--UZYSKANO DOSTĘP--\n"
"Misja ukończona!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "Kontakt z nami"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Disable External Power"
msgstr "Odetnij zasilanie zewnętrzne"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Emergency Message."
msgstr "Wiadomość alarmowa."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"GREETINGS CITIZEN.  A BIOLOGICAL ATTACK HAS TAKEN PLACE AND A STATE OF "
"EMERGENCY HAS BEEN DECLARED.  EMERGENCY PERSONNEL WILL BE AIDING YOU "
"SHORTLY.  TO ENSURE YOUR SAFETY PLEASE FOLLOW THE STEPS BELOW.\n"
" 1. DO NOT PANIC.\n"
" 2. REMAIN INSIDE THE BUILDING.\n"
" 3. SEEK SHELTER IN THE BASEMENT.\n"
" 4. USE PROVIDED GAS MASKS.\n"
" 5. AWAIT FURTHER INSTRUCTIONS."
msgstr ""
"WITAJ OBYWATELU. MIAŁ MIEJSCE ATAK BIOLOGICZNY I OGŁOSZONO STAN ZAGROŻENIA. "
"PERSONEL KRYZYSOWY WKRÓTCE CI POMOŻE. BY ZAPEWNIĆ CI BEZPIECZEŃSTWO POSTĘPUJ "
"WEDŁUG PONIŻSZYCH KROKÓW.\n"
" 1. NIE PANIKUJ.\n"
" 2. POZOSTAŃ WEWNĄTRZ BUDYNKU.\n"
" 3. SZUKAJ SCHRONIENIA W PIWNICY.\n"
" 4. UŻYJ DOSTĘPNYCH MASEK PRZECIWGAZOWYCH.\n"
" 5. OCZEKUJ DALSZYCH POLECEŃ."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Log off."
msgstr "Wyloguj się."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Make a note of the location."
msgstr "Zanotuj lokalizację."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Press any key."
msgstr "Wciśnij dowolny klawisz."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"REFUGEE CENTER FOUND!  IF YOU HAVE ANY FEEDBACK CONCERNING YOUR VISIT PLEASE "
"CONTACT\n"
" THE DEPARTMENT OF EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT PUBLIC AFFAIRS OFFICE.\n"
" THE LOCAL OFFICE CAN BE REACHED BETWEEN THE HOURS OF 9AM AND\n"
" 4PM AT 555-0164.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU WOULD LIKE TO SPEAK WITH SOMEONE IN PERSON OR WOULD LIKE\n"
"TO WRITE US A LETTER PLEASE SEND IT TO…"
msgstr ""
"CENTRUM UCHODŹCÓW ZNALEZIONE! JEŚLI MASZ UWAGI DO SWOJEJ WIZYTY PROSZĘ O "
"KONTAKT\n"
" Z DEPARTAMENTEM ZARZĄDZANIA KRYZYSOWEGO BIURA SPRAW\n"
"WEWNĘTRZNYCH.\n"
" LOKALNE BIURO JEST DOSTĘPNE W GODZ. OD 9 DO\n"
" 16 POD TEL. 555-0164.\n"
"\n"
"GDYBYŚ CHCIAŁ ROZMAWIAĆ Z KIMŚ OSOBIŚCIE\n"
"LUB NAPISAĆ LIST, WYŚLIJ GO DO…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_TRAIN_DATA.json
msgid "The computer awaits input…"
msgstr "Komputer czeka na dane…"

