"Widzisz ten uśmiech? Ładny uśmiech, prawda?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Another world is going and a new world is coming.  I hope this new one is "
"better than the last, a new golden age.  So far not great."
msgstr ""
"Inny świat odchodzi, a nowy nadchodzi. Mam nadzieję, że ten nowy będzie "
"lepszy od poprzedniego, że będzie to nowy złoty wiek. Jak na razie nie jest "
"najlepiej."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Cool, cool.  So you like myths and stuff?"
msgstr "Fajnie, fajnie. Więc lubisz mity i takie tam?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Fight me Malsumis!"
msgstr "Walcz ze mną, Malsimusie!"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Hunter with indigenous ancestry and big ideas.
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Glooscap"
msgstr "Gluskap"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Glooscap?  That's a funny name.  Is it foreign?"
msgstr "Gluskap? Zabawne imię. Jest zagraniczne?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Haha, good one Glooscap.  So funny.  Love that.  Let's move on."
msgstr "Haha, dobre, Gluskapie. Bardzo zabawne. Uwielbiam to. Przejdźmy dalej."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Haha, right.  What would Glooscap be doing in the sunrise lands at the "
"beginning of the fourth age?  That's silly.  I'm probably some Wabanaki that "
"got hit on the head or something.  And who turns into a beaver?  Haha.  You "
"got me.  Just a normal human made out of trees like the rest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Have you had any luck out there?"
msgstr "Poszczęściło ci się tam?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky.  "
"You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice one, "
"but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It takes "
"days."
msgstr ""
"Mam bliźniaka. Malsumis pewnie gdzieś tu jest, bardzo podstępny. Wiesz, że "
"raz zamieniłem Malsumisa w kamień? Powinienem być tym miłym, ale wiesz, jak "
"bardzo boli zamienianie się z powrotem w kamień? To zajmuje dni."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky.  "
"You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice one, "
"but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It takes "
"days."
msgstr ""
"Mam bliźniaka. Malsumis pewnie gdzieś tu jest, bardzo podstępny. Wiesz, że "
"raz zamieniłem Malsumisa w kamień? Powinienem być tym miłym, ale wiesz, jak "
"bardzo boli zamienianie się z powrotem w kamień? To zajmuje dni."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
