msgstr "Andrea Dzvonko"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
