msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Guard.json
msgid "I'm on watch duty.  Talk to the Boss.  He's upstairs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Guard.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I've got to go."
msgstr "Muszę już iść."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A member of the Gray Moose Lodge, trying to safe in their isolated location
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Guard.json
msgid "Militia Guard"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Guard.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"Stay safe out there.  Hate to have to kill you after you've already died."
msgstr ""
"Bądź bezpieczny tam na zewnątrz. Wolałbym cię nie zabijać po tym jak już i "
"tak będziesz martwy."

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ A member of the Gray Moose Militia, trying to safe in their isolated location
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Darby Sutton"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Do you have anything to trade?"
msgstr "Masz coś na handel?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"I can't say I can think of anything at the moment.  Our remoteness is our "
"defense.  We want to keep a low profile and try to keep out of any trouble "
"in this isolated location.  We are willing to trade for weapons and ammo "
"though.  Keeping the nearby area clear and hunting is always eating away at "
"our supplies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"I'm the most senior member at this point so I'm what passes for the leader "
"here now.  I'm just trying to make plans to keep us alive since everything "
"fell apart."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Keeping a low profile is good."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Stay safe out there.  Not enough of us are around anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Time for me to leave"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to our camp.  Behave yourself while you are here.  What can I do for "
"you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"Well, that's a long story.  We are what's left of the Grey Moose militia.  "
"We had plans for when things went south cause of crazy politicians or war, "
"but we didn't expect people to go crazy then turn zombie.  Only a handful of "
"our members actually made it through all that madness.  What's worse is that "
"we lost so much of our supplies and gear due to military checkpoints and "
"trigger happy soldiers.  It didn't matter that half of us were former "
"military the checkpoint guards just saw weapons, panicked and then "
"confiscated everything but the clothes on our back.  So here we are at our "
"planned escape location with not even a fraction of our manpower or supplies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "What do you do here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "What's the story behind this place?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Are you nuts?"
msgstr "Odbiło ci?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "Witajcie."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr "Znikam stąd. Żegnam."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Miner"
msgstr "Górnik"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid ""
"Poor fellow - looks like you're out of your mind.  Can't help you, sorry.  "
"I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr ""
"Biedny facet - wygląda na to, że postradałeś zmysły. Nie mogę ci pomóc, "
"przykro mi. Spadam stąd. Żegnaj."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Sorry, what?"
msgstr "Przepraszam, co?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<spirals>"
#. ~ Spiral madman's responses.
#. ~ Job description of "Miner" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Spirals."
msgstr "Spirale."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Spirals?"
msgstr "Spirale?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Why are you repeating 'spirals' over and over again?"
msgstr "Czemu powtarzasz „spirale” jak nakręcony?"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former miner, poor fellow succumbed to spiral madness.
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "miner"
msgstr "Górnik"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"A church must be full of them and who knows, maybe some of those <zombies> "
"carry some.  But please, do not waste your time making one yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"A few days ago another survivor and I were trying to avoid the cities by "
"staying in the woods during the day and foraging for gear at night.  It "
"worked well against the normal zeds but one night something caught onto our "
"trail and chased us for ten minutes or so until we decided to split up and "
"meet-up back here.  My buddy never showed up and I don't have the means to "
"kill whatever it was.  Can you lend a hand?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Inhaler"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Alright, as long as I have one of these, I should be fine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Flag"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "America, fuck ya!"
msgstr "Ameryka, kurwa tak!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "America, fuck yeah!"
msgstr "Ameryka, jak chuj!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"America, fuck yeah!  I was in the guard a few years back so I'm confident I "
"can make heads-or-tails of these transmissions."
msgstr ""
"Ameryka, jak chuj! Byłem w gwardii parę lat temu, więc jestem pewien że coś "
"jestem w stanie wygrzebać z tych transmisji."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgstr "Analizuj krew zombie"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Let Somebody Join"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Another survivor!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any leads on where a camp might be?"
msgstr "Jakieś pomysły gdzie możemy znaleźć ten obóz?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
