#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "What good is this?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "What have you found out?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"When we skipped town during <the_cataclysm>, most of us left our possessions "
"behind.  We only have a few Bibles here for all of us, and they're starting "
"to fall apart.  If you could get ten more of the King James version, I'd pay "
"well for them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Where is it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"While we are blessed with a bountiful stock, we need a way to preserve our "
"newer food, mainly those potatoes Darryl's growing.  Fortunately, he brought "
"a book on canning things.  We need five canning pots to get the setup going "
"in full fashion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Why have you failed us?!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"With my brains and your brawn we'll make an excellent team.  A regular solar "
"panel will do just fine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Worst case scenario you'll be covered in slime.  There's nothing to fear, I "
"hope."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Would you please reconsider?  Arturo's had some bad hallucinations before, "
"he'll go crazy without them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Writers' Will"
msgstr "Testament Pisarzy"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Writers' Will II"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Yes!  Are you good with words, by the way?  I was thinking, maybe you should "
"be the one to negotiate with Helena.  But whatever you do, don't accept "
"their icons.  Our work is worth a lot more than their valueless currency."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You could take apart some furniture in town, or make them yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"You could try cutting up some unneeded sweaters from a clothing store, or "
"you could make some yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"You give up now?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good "
"man to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You liar!"
msgstr "Kłamca!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "You remember what toilet paper is, right?"
msgstr "Pamiętasz, co to jest papier toaletowy, prawda?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid ""
"&Arturo stares blankly for a moment.  \"The man in the mirror comes to me at "
"night, and whispers things in my ear.  Eyes on the walls, watching, "
"watching…  The woman who crawls.\"  I'm sorry about that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Are you alright?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Chill out man, I'm leaving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Could you tell me about the community?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Hey Arturo, how are ya?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid ""
"Hi, <name_g>.  Could I pat you on the shoulder?  I wanna be sure you're here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "How are things around here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
