msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I "
"know you're not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
