msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr ""
"Jakim cudem tu się znalazłeś? Jesteś jakimś sposobem jednym z nich? Co tu "
"się wyprawia?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
