msgid ""
"Hmm, well it is not ideal but I appreciate you trying and being willing to "
"help.  I will have to do my best despite the bad memories.  Thank you, my "
"friend."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
