#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'm counting on you."
msgstr "Liczę na ciebie!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I'm running out of office supplies.  I know… of all the things to need at a "
"time like this!  I just need to be able to keep track of and organize "
"medical records so that I can focus on helping people.  Ten binders and a "
"ream of paper should tide me over until some shipments come in."
msgstr ""
"Kończą mi się materiały biurowe. Wiem… ze wszystkich rzeczy, których można "
"potrzebować w takiej chwili! Po prostu muszę być w stanie śledzić i "
"porządkować dokumentację medyczną, aby móc skupić się na pomaganiu ludziom. "
"Dziesięć segregatorów i ryza papieru powinny mi wystarczyć do czasu, aż "
"nadejdzie jakaś dostawa."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't have time to help you at the moment."
msgstr "Przykro mi, ale w tej chwili nie mam czasu, aby ci pomóc."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Is there anything else I can help with?"
msgstr "Czy jest jeszcze coś, w czym mogę pomóc?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Maybe I could help you with something?"
msgstr "Może mogę ci w czymś pomóc?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"One of the laborers injured their foot pretty badly and I don't want them "
"walking on it for a few days at least.  Do you think you could find a pair "
"of crutches?"
msgstr ""
"Jeden z robotników dość poważnie zranił się w stopę i nie chcę, żeby chodził "
"na niej przynajmniej przez kilka dni. Czy myślisz, że mógłbyś znaleźć parę "
"kul?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "Spokojnie. Nie chcę, żebyś wrócił tu zbyt wcześnie."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
