msgstr ""
"Klienci eleganckiego baru z burgerami, w którym pracowałeś byli dziś jeszcze "
"bardziej drażliwi i niedorzeczni niż zwykle. Pokazałeś im, co to znaczy "
"szybkie żarcie… uciekając w popłochu!"

#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all "
"communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"Twoją jednostkę Gwardii Narodowej zmobilizowano by przeciwdziałać epidemii. "
"Pomimo najlepszych wysiłków, nie zdołałaś się z nimi połączyć zanim ustała "
"komunikacja i znalazłaś się pośród martwych."

#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all "
"communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"Twoją jednostkę Gwardii Narodowej zmobilizowano by przeciwdziałać epidemii. "
"Pomimo najlepszych wysiłków, nie zdołałeś się z nimi połączyć zanim ustała "
"komunikacja i znalazłeś się pośród martwych."

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat "
"your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Miałaś ławę przysięgłych w garści, ale po tym jak pozwany chciał zejść ci "
"mózg, musiałaś haniebnie uciekać z sali sądowej. Nikt nie reagował na twoje "
"sprzeciwy."

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat "
"your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Miałeś ławę przysięgłych w garści, ale po tym jak pozwany chciał zejść ci "
"mózg, musiałeś haniebnie uciekać z sali sądowej. Nikt nie reagował na twoje "
"sprzeciwy."

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Assassin" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The product of millions of dollars of clandestine research, you are a bionic "
"sleeper agent capable of silently engaging your target while maintaining an "
"innocuous appearance.  Your handler cut all contact a week ago."
msgstr ""
"Jako produkt tajnych badań naukowych za miliony dolarów, jesteś bioniczną "
"uśpioną agentką, zdolną po cichu zlikwidować swój cel zachowując niepozorny "
"wygląd. Twój kontrahent uciął cały kontakt z tobą tydzień temu."

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Assassin" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The product of millions of dollars of clandestine research, you are a bionic "
"sleeper agent capable of silently engaging your target while maintaining an "
"innocuous appearance.  Your handler cut all contact a week ago."
msgstr ""
"Jako produkt tajnych badań naukowych za miliony dolarów, jesteś bionicznym "
"uśpionym agentem, zdolnym po cichu zlikwidować swój cel zachowując "
"niepozorny wygląd. Twój kontrahent uciął cały kontakt z tobą tydzień temu."

#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The riots were brutal, even before the dead rose and started to devour the "
"living.  The line you were holding broke.  It was only through a bit of luck "
"and a lot of head-bashing that you got away in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The riots were brutal, even before the dead rose and started to devour the "
"living.  The line you were holding broke.  It was only through a bit of luck "
"and a lot of head-bashing that you got away in one piece, and the worst is "
