#. ~ Description of profession "Patient" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Gdy diagnoza okazała się pozytywna przysięgałaś sobie, że będziesz walczyła "
"o życie i nie poddasz się rozpaczy. Czas najwyższy odnowić to przyrzeczenie."

#. ~ Description of profession "Patient" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Gdy diagnoza okazała się pozytywna przysięgałeś sobie, że będziesz walczył o "
"życie i nie poddasz się rozpaczy. Czas najwyższy odnowić to przyrzeczenie."

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Patient" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you signed up for a series of "
"experimental bionic surgeries that saved your life.  The problem is, they "
"needed power, and now the power's out.  Find a new place to charge your "
"batteries or you might wind up worse off than before."
msgstr ""

