msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have recently attended what might be the last anime convention ever.  "
"There are zombies everywhere now, buty you picked up something at the merch "
"tables that might even the odds.  This is just like one of your Japanese "
"Animes!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
