"You have spent many long years forging a bond with your equine companion, "
"from running down common thugs, to entertaining kids when you ride on by.  "
"The cataclysm is upon you, but at least you have each other."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjill" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have your trusty wood axe, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the "
"world ended, and you suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjack" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have your trusty wood axe, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the "
"world ended, and you suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Senior Citizen" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay "
"for what they've done."
msgstr ""
"Nie widziałaś tyle krwi od czasu wojny. Cały świat zwariował! Zjedli twoje "
"wnuki! Ale niech to dunder świśnie, dasz im wszystkim popalić za to, co "
"zrobili."

#. ~ Description of profession "Senior Citizen" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay "
"for what they've done."
msgstr ""
"Nie widziałeś tyle krwi od czasu wojny. Cały świat zwariował! Zjedli twoje "
"wnuki! Ale niech to dunder świśnie, dasz im wszystkim popalić za to, co "
"zrobili."

#. ~ Description of profession "Shower Victim" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You just stepped out of a nice, hot shower to find the world had ended.  "
"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr ""
"Właśnie wyszłaś spod przyjemnego gorącego prysznica, by dowiedzieć się, że "
"świat się skończył. Na szczęście masz mydło i najużyteczniejszą rzecz pod "
"słońcem… ręcznik."

#. ~ Description of profession "Shower Victim" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You just stepped out of a nice, hot shower to find the world had ended.  "
"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr ""
"Właśnie wyszedłeś spod przyjemnego gorącego prysznica, by dowiedzieć się, że "
"świat się skończył. Na szczęście masz mydło i najużyteczniejszą rzecz pod "
"słońcem… ręcznik."

#. ~ Description of profession "Wǔshùjiā" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You know kung fu.  Pretty much everyone else is dead, so maybe that makes "
"you The One."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Wǔshùjiā" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You know kung fu.  Pretty much everyone else is dead, so maybe that makes "
"you The One."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Cowboy" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You liked to spend your days taking care of the horses and cows, searching "
"the perimeter of the ranch on your steed and looking out for anything "
"suspicious, that's why you managed to escape in time when shit hit the fan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Cowboy" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You liked to spend your days taking care of the horses and cows, searching "
"the perimeter of the ranch on your steed and looking out for anything "
"suspicious, that's why you managed to escape in time when shit hit the fan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Rideshare Driver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving, and decided to start making some money doing it.  On your "
"way to pick up a customer, a riot broke out around you.  You took a long "
"detour to safety, only to find yourself somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiasz prowadzić i postanowiłaś zacząć zarabiać na tym pieniądze. W "
"drodze po klienta, wokół Ciebie wybuchły zamieszki. Wyruszyłaś w długi "
"objazd, aby zapewnić sobie bezpieczeństwo, tylko po to, aby znaleźć się w "
"nieznanym miejscu."

#. ~ Description of profession "Rideshare Driver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving, and decided to start making some money doing it.  On your "
"way to pick up a customer, a riot broke out around you.  You took a long "
"detour to safety, only to find yourself somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiasz prowadzić i postanowiłeś zacząć zarabiać na tym pieniądze. W "
"drodze po klienta, wokół Ciebie wybuchły zamieszki. Wyruszyłeś w długi "
"objazd, aby zapewnić sobie bezpieczeństwo, tylko po to, aby znaleźć się w "
"nieznanym miejscu."

#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Girl" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a pair of blades than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the cops aren't telling "
"you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Boy" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
