msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a pair of blades than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the cops aren't telling "
"you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Girl" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a skateboard than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the cops aren't telling "
"you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Boy" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
