#. ~ Description of scenario "Lost Underground" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the riots came to your home, you ran underground and hid.  Now days "
"later you are lost and hear movement echoing in the dark."
msgstr ""

