msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled "
"cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a crash "
"that totaled your vehicle.  Injured and alone, you'll need to think fast if "
"you want to survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
