#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "<mi-go_harvest>  <mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A network of sacs and vessels carry different fluids through the mi-go's "
"body, any of which you might call \"blood\".  One is thin and clear with a "
"grayish cast, while another is thick, foamy, and bubblegum pink, almost like "
"Pepto-Bismol."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Large pores all over the body connect short sections of tubing to small "
"balloon-like organs throughout the body, possibly serving as its respiratory "
"system."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Many short tentacles with rasping tips hang from beneath the subject's "
"head.  They're too small to serve as weapons, and it would be tempting to "
"assume these are how it eats if it had any apparent digestive tract."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"On close examination, the mi-go's rigid carapace is more of a pellicle, as "
"though its spongy insides have merely dried into a hard crust where exposed "
"to the air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Owing to its many limbs and hard carapace, it is at first tempting to "
"compare the mi-go to an insect.  Up close, there's little resemblance to be "
"had.  Its multijointed legs are more akin to tentacles, a comparison that's "
"easy to make because it also has a few of those."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The \"skeleton\" of this creature is almost a single solid piece, merely "
"softening at the joints to allow the limbs to bend."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The creature contains a lot of irregular clumps of tissue that must serve as "
"its organs, but it's difficult to guess at their purpose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The front of the creature's head, riddled with eyestalks and antennae, folds "
"open under gentle pressure to reveal a rippling interior like ruched "
"mortadella.  Perhaps this structure is how the creatures vocalize."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The mi-go's body is seemingly composed of a single material that merely "
"varies in density.  It's as hard as bone at its core, spongy and almost "
"gelatinous through the middle, and hard and crusty at the exterior.  Is this "
"all the same tissue?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The smell emanating from the specimen is a noxious combination of chlorine "
"and acetone.  There's none of the rot-stink or typical smells you'd expect "
"from an animal carcass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There's nothing that resembles an animal brain anywhere in the creature.  "
"Whatever it used to interpret the world and make decisions is simply beyond "
"your understanding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Tiny clumps of white crystal are buried throughout the creature's tissue "
"like so many kidney stones.  They don't look functional, but then again, how "
"would you know?"
msgstr ""

