#. ~ Description of vehicle part "bench seat"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid ""
"A soft, wide seat with a high back, the kind often used in back seats or "
"older cars.  It might be a decent place to sleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "steel bench"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid ""
"A steel bench with ankle and wrist restraints built in.  It looks very "
"uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"Stalowa ławka z wbudowanymi pasami do krępowania kostek i nadgarstków. "
"Wygląda na bardzo niewygodną."

