#. ~ Description of vehicle part "plastic windshield"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/windshields.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift windshield made of a rigid sheet of clear acrylic.  It'll keep "
"the wind out of your face, but it's not especially durable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reinforced windshield"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/windshields.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of glass that lets you see outside the vehicle.  Reinforced with "
"metal brackets and slats to make it harder to break."
