#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1273
msgid ""
"Muscle, toughness, and raw fortitude, strength is a useful stat in and out "
"of melee combat.  Strong characters are more resistant to illness, excellent "
"at grappling, and can make excellent use of bashing weapons.\n"
"\n"
