msgid "%s administers a saline infusion to treat your hypovolemic shock."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:731
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s administers a saline infusion to treat <npcname>'s hypovolemic shock."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:798
msgid ""
"You've got some kind of parasite.  It probably isn't immediately life-"
"threatening, but taking antiparasitic medication should clear it up."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:801
msgid ""
"Looks like you have a pretty serious fungal infection.  Taking antifungal "
"medication should clear it up, but I'd hurry if I were you."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:804
msgid ""
"You have acute radiation syndrome.  Taking prussian blue every three hours "
"should help treat it.  Most exposure comes from fine ash or dust in the "
"environment, so in the future, try to mask up and wear clothing designed for "
"environmental protection."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:807
msgid ""
"You have a bacterial infection.  There's a chance a healthy person can fight "
"this sort of thing off, but it can be lethal for just about anybody.  Find "
"the strongest antibiotics you can and take one every twelve hours until it's "
"cleared up."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:810
msgid ""
"You probably feel pretty horrible, but it's just the flu.  It should resolve "
"itself within two to twelve days from the time you first started noticing "
"symptoms.  Until then, you can take cough syrup to suppress most symptoms, "
"or opioids and antihistamines if you can't find any."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:813
msgid ""
"It seems you've caught a cold.  It should resolve itself within two days to "
"three weeks from the time you first started noticing symptoms.  Until then, "
"you can take cough syrup to suppress most symptoms, or opioids and "
"antihistamines if you can't find any."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:817
msgid ""
"You have a minor infenction of the conjunctiva - that is, pinkeye.  It "
"should resolve itself within a couple of days.  If the itching is bothering "
"you, try taking some antihistamines.  Cough syrup might also do the trick, "
"but not the non-drowsy kind.  You could also try taking an antibiotic every "
"twelve hours, but if the infection is viral, it won't have any effect."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:820
msgid ""
"Those irritated scratches look like rat bite fever.  You could try taking "
"some aspirin or ibuprofen to relieve the symptoms.  It's safe to wait it out "
"and let your body fight it off, but you can also take one antibiotic every "
"twelve hours to deal with it."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:823
msgid ""
"Your muscle cramps are caused by tetanus.  A dose of antibiotics every "
"twelve hours might get rid of it, otherwise you should look for "
"benzodiazepines to relieve the symptoms."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:826
msgid ""
"Neuropathy, cramps, and tremors.  I'm not sure what exactly is the matter "
"with you, but if I had to guess, you've been eating or drinking something "
"toxic.  Stop doing that, and maybe your body will filter out the poison over "
"time."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:829
msgid ""
"You've got anemia.  It's often caused by bleeding, but sometimes a poor diet "
"will do it, both are equally likely these days.  You need iron, either from "
"leafy greens, multivitamins, or red meat, and you need rest so your body can "
"rebuild itself."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:832
msgid ""
"Scurvy.  That's a vitamin C deficiency.  You're going to want to look for "
"fruit, greens, or organ meat, and it's got to be fresh, the preserved stuff "
"usually won't do.  Vitamin supplements would also do the trick."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:848
msgid ""
"Your pulse is elevated and I'm not liking the look of your blood pressure.  "
"You need more exercise."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:850
msgid "I'd say you could stand to get more exercise."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:852
msgid "Your vitals look good."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:854
msgid ""
"It seems like you're in pretty good shape.  Your vitals look great, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:856
msgid ""
"You're in incredible shape!  What exactly have you been doing out there?"
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:861
msgid ""
"You probably don't need me to tell you this, but you're starving.  You're "
"going to have a hard time staying healthy, let alone active, if your body "
"doesn't have enough energy for its basic functions."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:863
msgid "Your weight looks OK."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:865
msgid ""
"You might benefit from losing some weight.  Things being how they are I'd "
"say it's better to have too much than too little, but you're at the point "
"where it's starting to put a strain on your body."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:867
msgid ""
"We really should think about getting you on a diet.  I know, I know, I don't "
"like saying it, but now more than ever, your health matters."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:870
msgid ""
"I don't think your condition's going to improve without some sort of "
"miracle, so you need to stay out of trouble."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:872
msgid ""
"One last thing: your immune system's probably shot.  That means you'll have "
"a hard time fighting off infection and recovering from injury.  You need to "
"avoid drugs and alcohol, mask up whenever possible, and don't eat anything "
"weird.  Oh, and try to get some sleep.  You won't bounce back right away, "
"but if you can stay active, stay clean, and try to maintain a healthy "
"weight, you'll start feeling a lot better."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:874
msgid ""
"That's everything.  You'd probably benefit from some lifestyle changes, "
"though.  Little things, like exposure to toxins, junk food, smoke "
"inhalation, even just dealing with a lot of negative emotions - all this "
"stuff adds up, and it can really do a number on your health."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:876
msgid ""
"It looks like apart from everything else, you've been maintaining good "
"lifestyle habits.  Keep it up, it'll pay dividends the next time you're up "
"against an injury or illness."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:878
msgid ""
"Your health otherwise seems pretty good.  As long as you don't push it too "
"far, you should be able to bounce back pretty well from most health problems."
msgstr ""

#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp:880
msgid ""
"All else aside, your outlook seems great.  Clean living really is its own "
"reward."
msgstr ""

