#~ msgid ""
#~ "A t-shirt with the Ubuntu logo on it, underneath it says \"Ubuntu is a "
#~ "South African word for 'I can't configure Debian'\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "T-shirt z logo Ubuntu i napisem „Ubuntu to afrykańskie stwierdzenie na "
