#~ "dystanse, ledwo."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An inactive Karuba-ya hunter drone, folded for ease of storage.  If "
#~ "deployed, it will seek and fly to the closest enemy before detonating.  "
#~ "Unlike most robots, its activation depends on a successful throw, and not "
