#~ "szereg zabezpieczeń, w jakie wyposażone są te urządzenia."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An incredibly ancient and outdated laser pistol design with origins "
#~ "traceable to Earth's early Space Age.  One of the few 'open-hardware' "
#~ "guns, its leaked and widely-circulated design specifications allow this "
#~ "weapon to retain some popularity within backwater worlds."
