#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Pierzasta włócznia do rzucania z żelaznym grotem oraz pętlą do rzucania "
#~ "dla lepszego zasięgu."

#~ msgid "An issi nest."
#~ msgstr "Gniazdo issi."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An ointment made of caramel.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if "
#~ "you were made of sugar."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Maść zrobiona z karmelu. Można by nią leczyć swoje rany, gdyby być z "
#~ "cukru."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An old and decidedly uncommon firefighter robot of Soviet design.  Crab-"
#~ "like in form, its back mounts a squat water tank beneath a turreted water "
