#~ msgid ""
#~ "Created with the exploration of the deep sea in mind, Cecaelia are "
#~ "hybridized from cephalopod and fish DNA.  While you were mostly spared "
#~ "from the corporate wars by your scientific proclivities, the polite "
#~ "niceties of the surface are mostly forgotten underwater.  You were on dry "
#~ "land when the Cataclysm occurred and you have no idea if it's safer here "
#~ "or beneath the seas."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Stworzone z myślą o eksploracji morskich głębin, Cecaelia są hybrydą DNA "
