#~ msgid ""
#~ "Developed for the exploration of alien planes, the lightweight, orange-"
#~ "black HEV suit covers everything below the neck.  While it possesses only "
#~ "modest physical protection, it provides excellent protection from most "
#~ "environmental hazards.  A hatch in the front opens to provide a small "
#~ "amount of storage."
