#~ msgid ""
#~ "F'r to wax religious, eh?\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "*Rubik pauses for a while.  When they start talking again, their voice is "
#~ "slow and more serious than usual.*\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "This'n can't tell ye, rightly, but those what have a bottle an' a cork "
#~ "what fits it, they yark about the Enemy.  Most folks got a story like "
#~ "that in their ol' hearth-tales, an I'm ken.  A bad way, from times old, "
