#~ msgid "If you need something you'll need to talk to someone else."
#~ msgstr "Jak czegoś chcesz to pogadaj z kimś innym."

#~ msgid "If you say so."
#~ msgstr "Skoro tak twierdzisz."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you see any weird machines around, do not engage.  Sneak away, I'd "
#~ "say.  They seem to be hostile to zombies, but that doesn't mean they can "
#~ "tell you aren't one."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Jeśli zobaczysz w pobliżu jakieś dziwne maszyny, nie angażuj się. Raczej "
