#~ msgid ""
#~ "It could be a mighty challenge, but Alonso knows there are some that are "
#~ "into this, no?  I think they call themselves escalier, which is Italian "
#~ "for the scaly banana.  Or staircase.  It is not important, I mean to say "
#~ "that people love who they love, and the dinosaur, she does the same, and "
#~ "there is no shame in what two people or dinosaurs do in the escalier.  "
#~ "Alonso does not judge you.  You do you.  And maybe Alonso as well when "
#~ "you are done with the you doing."
