#~ msgid ""
#~ "Sure an that's a biggun'.  Otherworlds be the wherefore o' them uggo "
#~ "buggers you got round and here, eh?  Walkin' plants and talkin' mushrooms "
#~ "and whatlike.  Otherlands be tassed more of a kinship.  I be from Earth, "
