#~ "Through a lifetime of hard work, dedication, boot-licking and immense "
#~ "luck, you achieved the almost impossible, and were promoted from an "
#~ "indentured clerk to a minor managerial position.  Although you were still "
#~ "an expendable peon among the ranks of the corporation, you earned numbers "
#~ "most people could only dream of, and you savored it."
#~ msgstr ""
