#~ msgid ""
#~ "We can chit-chat, if you want.  People are social animals, right?  A "
#~ "little light conversation can do wonders for your mood.  But I don't want "
#~ "to be yapping all the time, so if we've chatted recently, I probably am "
#~ "not going to want to talk for a bit.\n"
#~ "  You can also ask me about my background.  I may not want to talk about "
#~ "it, though.\n"
#~ "  You can also ask me for advice - I've heard things here and there that "
#~ "may help us survive, but I don't usually give advice relevant to the "
#~ "situation.\n"
#~ "  I can also train you, and you can read books to me in order to train me."
