#~ msgid ""
#~ "You had a genius plan to skim fractions of cents out of your company's "
#~ "accounts.  This plan immediately failed and got you arrested.  They said "
#~ "you were too soft for prison, but guess what?  They're dead, and you're "
#~ "not."
#~ msgstr ""
