#~ msgid ""
#~ "You've used your knowledge of Biomancy to change your body into a form "
#~ "befitting a Stormshaper.  You can better withstand the power of "
#~ "electricity, and sparks leap from your skin when something hits you.  "
#~ "You're beginning to study spells that utilize your body's affinity for "
